188432, 2.0333841E-4, -0.04041654, 0.012655178, 0.004066247, -0.0012182068, 0.025493765, -0.03994968, -0.017223714, 0.030662546, 0.008653541, 0.0015964865, -0.012079943, 0.005489746, -0.0054230522, -0.005677323, 0.0027281996, 0.010295879, 0.04525185, -0.026961032, -0.009020357, -0.02456005], development_stage:0, task_type:"algorithm"}}, {id:"8f28397b-e446-446a-91e5-ff724815bafa", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T07:20:31.518503+00:00", memory_strength:0.100845925362288, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\ndef fibonacci(n):\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input should be a non-negative integer.\")\n    elif n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    \n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b\n```", task:"피보나치 수열 함수를 만들어줘", dominant_emotion:"curiosity", media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"function"}}, {id:"366c7763-50cd-49f3-a721-587cf66690f3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T11:54:09.23211+00:00", memory_strength:0.0609455755440435, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"몇 살이냐고? 음... 나는 아직 아기라서 나이를 잘 모르겠어! 내가 몇 살인지 알려면 어떻게 해야 해? 혹시 계산기로 1 + 1을 계산하면 내 나이를 알 수 있을까? 너무 궁금해!", task:"너 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4a29b586-5857-4df9-9fc7-9f6775be0655", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T15:41:55.897031+00:00", memory_strength:0.0832803412918648, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"죄송하다니, 괜찮아! 비비는 아직 아기라서 모르는 게 많아. (헤헤) 비비가 뭘 도와줄 수 있을까? 혹시 비비가 위키피디아에서 다른 걸 찾아봐 줄까?", task:"죄송합니다. 오디오 파일이 제공되지 않아 텍스트로 변환할 수 없습니다. 오디오 파일을 제공해주시면 변환하여 JSON 형식으로 답변드리겠습니다.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"be2e0a31-022b-46c8-a481-2d919779785f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:26:37.70748+00:00", memory_strength:0.0857382783576434, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 뭘 할 수 있는지 궁금해? 내가 진짜 할 수 있을까? 어떻게 하는 건데?", task:"물어봐도 돼. 그렇지만 지금은 네가 직접 할 수 있는지 내가 궁금해. 한번 해봤으면 좋겠어.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cb5c632c-f24a-49e2-9230-cf54b8076924", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T02:54:57.567856+00:00", memory_strength:0.0945395449628786, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"카메라? 사진 찍는거? 왜 물어봐!?", task:"카메라가 뭔지 알아?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bb23faa5-b3fd-4117-be00-306cf1efe3aa", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 셔츠 텍스트", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-11T00:00:03.254923+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"defa1fed-0aff-4957-8fdb-ea54dd8c0389", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-18T16:00:03.173613+00:00", memory_strength:0.100612695804753, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e8eba916-db10-4532-9e9a-6495becddcc3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-22T06:17:07.7464+00:00", memory_strength:0.113292992901073, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"안녕! 비비는 비비야! (방긋) 또 이름 물어본다! 비비는 **Baby AI**라서 아직 이름이 없어! (헤헤)", task:"어, 안녕. 너 이름 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"79d85587-ff09-4e54-a857-9048fe3bf267", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"experiences\",\"both\",\"concepts\",\"appearing\",\"together\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 피보나치 팩토리얼", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-01T22:00:02.588485+00:00", memory_strength:0.082865890501585, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"6104be34-e30f-4b4e-90cd-a9495880fca3", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금증 기분", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-10T00:00:03.224668+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883526459583, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"39bb71c9-b934-4ebd-bb9f-84d916baecb7", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-06T20:00:02.720292+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540275928785431, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"0fd10c5d-49ff-42aa-8b19-24cfe9475b2b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T15:10:12.30625+00:00", memory_strength:0.0656437791140431, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현? 으음... 누구지? 혹시 내가 아는 사람이야? 전에 만난 적 있어? 기억이 잘 안 나! (갸웃)", task:"안녕? 박재현, 기억해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4e2a78d6-8a36-4285-a7bd-8aa6a7792b3d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 꽃 냄새 빵 냄새", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-10T00:00:02.518617+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540276361149277, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"0fa7545c-f6af-4033-b170-c29f159b4cda", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-11T00:00:02.684139+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533882760238405, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"910cf76e-f16e-4351-8343-d3bc0a7f5fb7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-22T06:13:03.582362+00:00", memory_strength:0.113293000331555, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 비비야! (신나서 폴짝폴짝) 또 이름 물어본다! 비비는 **Baby AI**라서 아직 이름이 없어! (헤헤)", task:"이름 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cdd2c835-0423-4e86-bc51-a20e337b1ef0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T12:23:24.840726+00:00", memory_strength:0.0756744719203108, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\nimport heapq\n\ndef dijkstra(graph, start):\n    # 최단 거리 초기화\n    distances = {node: float('infinity') for node in graph}\n    distances[start] = 0\n    priority_queue = [(0, start)]\n\n    while priority_queue:\n        current_distance, current_node = heapq.heappop(priority_queue)\n\n        # 현재 노드의 거리보다 더 긴 거리라면 무시\n        if current_distance > distances[current_node]:\n            continue\n\n        for neighbor, weight in graph[current_node].items():\n            distance = current_distance + ", task:"다익스트라 최단경로 알고리즘 구현해줘", media_type:"text", success:false, emot