UNWIND [{id:"c50bfd6b-e4c9-47bc-ae1b-f39a1560762d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T12:46:32.194305+00:00", memory_strength:0.0761176818690256, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\ndef longest_unique_substring(s):\n    char_index = {}\n    longest = 0\n    start = 0\n\n    for i, char in enumerate(s):\n        if char in char_index and char_index[char] >= start:\n            start = char_index[char] + 1\n        char_index[char] = i\n        longest = max(longest, i - start + 1)\n\n    return longest\n\n# 예시 사용\nprint(longest_unique_substring(\"abcabcbb\"))  # 출력: 3\nprint(longest_unique_substring(\"bbbbb\"))     # 출력: 1\nprint(longest_unique_substring(\"pwwkew\"))    # 출력: 3\n```", task:"문자열에서 가장 긴 부분 문자열 찾는 함수 만들어줘", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, embedding:[0.03780509, 6.0493156E-4, -0.013448488, 0.010880801, 0.027224764, 0.0214156, -0.01153638, -0.009150798, -0.009979378, 0.027170133, -0.020796442, -0.0022046142, -0.031249296, -0.02105139, 0.020104442, 0.053648267, -0.028335609, -0.003255135, -0.013940172, 0.0017721136, -0.0029068582, -0.0189936, 0.0075573763, 0.026587395, 0.05139016, 0.016617123, -0.017400175, 0.042794783, 0.030010978, -0.03279719, -0.012474223, -0.025494764, 0.018055756, 0.0093966415, -0.06985565, 0.049496263, 0.028827293, -0.0017368307, 0.01806486, -0.014550226, 0.009342009, 0.014395436, 0.016562492, -0.07123965, 0.018155914, 0.008750167, -0.012911277, 0.06271712, 0.0081947455, -0.009970274, 0.016325753, 0.039662566, -0.025148762, 0.005540558, -0.003011569, 0.0030957926, 0.008609035, 0.032214455, 0.05951206, -0.035674457, -0.009027878, -1.251975E-4, -0.024875605, 0.01600707, -0.0039812806, -0.0043409388, -0.035237405, 0.026860554, -0.032833613, 0.010134168, -0.031959508, 8.382542E-4, -0.0012531132, -0.01872044, 0.016835649, -0.049386997, 0.010534801, 0.002654187, 0.026569186, -6.498888E-4, -0.044542994, -0.022599287, 0.02201655, -0.013321014, 0.0020122651, 0.042576253, 