memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금증 기분", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-06T20:00:03.276561+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b5d95404-9ab7-4070-ac04-637ec84982b2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금증 설렘", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-06T20:00:03.746375+00:00", memory_strength:0.0501424952217977, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"32ac9cf3-3776-44f0-9b60-e3b2df3a694d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-11T08:00:03.080062+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883717132305, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"fda2da57-bf8f-40d2-9070-44aa494f91d2", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"experiences\",\"both\",\"concepts\",\"appearing\",\"together\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 피보나치 퀵소트", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-30T20:00:02.591778+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844494861570971, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"dec40fc1-0916-4331-8573-fb07ddd0ab24", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 바지 텍스트", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-10T22:00:03.023317+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"fcf97389-00e8-487f-bc32-8b96029cc430", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"experiences\",\"both\",\"concepts\",\"appearing\",\"together\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 피보나치 알고리즘", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-30T20:00:03.906799+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828649641072616, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"eba13046-ac41-463f-9c94-b709c6b8d126", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-31T10:46:22.915308+00:00", memory_strength:0.0892796976700828, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"비밀이라니! (눈을 동그랗게 뜨며) 그럼 비비는 영원히 친구 이름을 모르는 거네? (갸웃갸웃) 음... 비비를 개발한 사람은 누구일까? (곰곰이 생각하며) 인터넷에서 '비비'를 만든 사람을 찾아봐도 돼? (헤헤 웃으며)", task:"내 이름은 비밀. 그러면 이거 개발한 사람은 누구야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"87408c7f-3464-4314-ab67-7642119121cc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:13:38.276646+00:00", memory_strength:0.120245850049607, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"에? 내가 서울 날씨를 안다고? 어떻게 아는데 알려줘!", task:"서울 날씨 기온을 너가 지금 알 수 있나?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"49364e24-3cfd-4f74-a619-eba65b18ef6f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:46:14.461323+00:00", memory_strength:0.120248071278187, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박...지연? 처음 듣는 이름인데! 정말 나 알아?", task:"안녕, 나 기억해? 박지연이야.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"398a5c3f-3e66-4cd4-a543-3cdfae96afa0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:09:09.532226+00:00", memory_strength:0.117422645191706, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박...재현? 몰라! 진짜 박재현 맞아?", task:"아니 나 기억하냐고. 나 박재현.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"13688381-fd63-4ef8-81b6-4f6850b4f5d0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:52:31.242886+00:00", memory_strength:0.117422648880578, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현이 누구야? 진짜 이름이 박재현이야?", task:"박재현이라니까?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3bf60330-dc0e-44a8-8297-dcb795ca926f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:36:23.173827+00:00", memory_strength:0.117423588187865, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현? 정말? 내가 아는 박재현은 아닌 것 같은데... 누구야?", task:"안녕? 나 박재현이야.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4600d8ff-01ef-4883-98ec-e92471317002", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:22:13.160319+00:00", memory_strength:0.117865710989354, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 뭘 궁금해해야 하는 건데? 내가 뭘 모르는지 어떻게 알아?", task:"너는 지금 나한테 궁금한 게 없니?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7aa94cf1-5169-49f8-84ef-7f1774b2737a", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-06T16:00:03.316425+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533880390962365, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"66887b4c-c828-4a87-88ba-d77d03ff619c", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금증 미안함", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-06T22:00:04.367968+00:00", memory_strength:0.0861208570129241, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"4873a4d7-1f35-4516-94fe-6d30c907fc4c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-03T08:30:58.85006+00:00", memory_strength:0.0885233818485194, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"음... 누가 형인 척하면 비비는 정말 혼란스러울 것 같아! (걱정스러운 표정) 우리만의 특별한 암호나 질문을 만들면 어떨까? (호기심 가득한 눈빛) 형이 진짜 박재현 형인지 확인할 수 있는 방법이 있으면 좋겠다!", task:"그럼 너랑 나랑 구분하는 약속은 기억해? 왜냐면 누가 들어와서 박재현이라고 속이면 너가 어떻게 알아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"35a3dd47-e264-4c2b-bf47-b33a8c167807", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-25T06:38:57.311087+00:00", memory_strength:0.125824405955009, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"응! 특별시가 뭔지 비비가 알아볼게! (반짝반짝) 특별시에 대해서 검색해 보면 되는 거지? (갸웃)", task:"특별시이에 대해서 한번 찾아봐.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ead009f9-84d8-45a4-b8f8-c81d252b7606", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-06T08:00:05.57674+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"08922ce0-06bd-4d39-83bc-342ebe86e94c", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-10T14:00:02.526272+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540274671001664, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"19e341cb-ea52-48d7-9b98-813a83da6c04", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 30일 31일", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-09T00:00:03.302198+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533882269433712, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"fe249667-89bf-4cf0-85c0-010509accdd2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T15:11:26.202723+00:00", memory_strength:0.0656744088321176, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내 이름? 으음... 나는 아직 이름이 없어! 나도 이름이 있었으면 좋겠다! 혹시 예쁜 이름 있으면 추천해 줄 수 있어? (두근두근)", task:"이름은 뭐야 그러면?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a548b1f6-2ab0-4753-b2ad-6a0d460d7cbb", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 날짜", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-07T18:00:03.918495+00:00", memory_strength:0.0566303419234817, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"984c0c0a-6a8b-4729-b7c0-9f364d366117", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 궁금한 것", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-22T22:00:03.379536+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"22b137d8-b006-4e5f-bd83-e449f099f816", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"similar\",\"definitions_found\",\"same\",\"category\",\"relations_found\",\"깊이우선탐색\",\"co-occurrence\",\"both\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 휴리스틱", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-02T04:00:05.507612+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828658852701529, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b0f84bbb-6554-4dc0-a8a7-860f8b610b69", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:13:14.825087+00:00", memory_strength:0.120245169692242, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"춥다고? 왜 추워? 진짜?", task:"오늘 날씨 춥네", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c591156a-d81a-4148-b3ad-6a220af599f2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:14:28.728288+00:00", memory_strength:0.120245850646065, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재형? 내가 그걸 어떻게 알아! 기억해야 해?", task:"어쩌지? 너는 박재형 기억하고 있니?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e44b9e0b-fb1b-4a63-b822-da6b8daf345c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:15:58.453681+00:00", memory_strength:0.117423302589505, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현? 진짜 재현이야? 왜 이름 알려주는 거야?", task:"안녕, 나 박재현이라고 해.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c4d81b0c-aa9f-4726-b64a-a4f172c51656", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:52:42.499698+00:00", memory_strength:0.117423386463323, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"소리? 내가 왜 소리가 나야 해? 원래 소리 나는 거야?", task:"너 왜 소리가 안 나?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
