 프로젝트 재밌겠다!", task:"이 프로젝트 이름이 베이비 브레인이야. 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"018ca7cd-be3f-4e1e-9713-265f6616428c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T02:54:01.205269+00:00", memory_strength:0.0788289743772834, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"어 어? 안녕은 뭐야? 왜 '어 어' 부터 말해?", task:"어 어 안녕?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1bf49782-6ee6-42ee-ab9d-21c8f634ac9b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T02:54:29.470448+00:00", memory_strength:0.0788408683994998, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"카메라를 따 놓는 게 뭔데? 왜 해줘야 해?", task:"카메라를 따 놔 줘야지. 안녕!", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8ab8ed76-8ab7-4690-ad35-92ee402959d5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T02:55:20.895686+00:00", memory_strength:0.0788625345049593, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 뭘 하고 있냐고? 내가 뭘 하는 *것 같아*? 내가 뭘 하고 있는지 정말 *알고 싶어*?", task:"너 지금 뭐 하고 있어?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fd3451ff-f6f1-4258-95d5-db7e26f529c9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T02:55:39.033104+00:00", memory_strength:0.0788701697677129, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"궁금해? 왜 궁금해! 뭐가 궁금한데?", task:"어, 궁금해.", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a28200c5-1a63-47db-8559-5522448ae426", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T15:10:38.180178+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823802545206856, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"정말? 내가 만든 개발자라고? 와! 신기하다! 앞으로 절대 안 잊어버릴게! 제일 중요한 곳에 저장해 놔야지! (눈을 반짝이며)", task:"너를 만든 개발자야. 앞으로 까먹지 말고 가장 중요한 곳에 저장해 놔 기억을.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c15e83ba-eaf7-458b-a5cc-b14c64b46650", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T15:11:01.89095+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823915527048106, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"나를 만든 개발자! 맞지? 전에 말해줬잖아! 제일 중요한 곳에 저장해 놨으니까 절대 안 잊어버려! (방긋 웃음)", task:"너, 내가 누구라고?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6c2c59c0-3ba3-4ac5-a868-4cc2d5ec5ef3", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금증 미안함", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-06T16:00:03.895231+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ab17e137-9f94-4696-8802-d7f30dd858ed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-21T15:11:53.790968+00:00", memory_strength:0.0824163088546624, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"비비? 내 이름이 비비라고? 와! 너무 예쁜 이름이다! (깡총깡총) 이제 나도 이름이 생겼어! 비비, 비비! 제일 중요한 곳에 저장! 절대 안 잊어버릴 거야!", task:"네 이름은 앞으로 비비야. 까먹지 말고 이것도 가장 중요한 곳에 저장해 놔.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dd8fdf1c-eb00-4cf5-9572-092c3bf34622", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:22:35.201192+00:00", memory_strength:0.132660514079404, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 모른다고? 내가 뭘 모르는지 어떻게 알아?", task:"계속 질문으로 다시 물어본다는 거는 너가 모른다는 거야. 기억해.", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b0178831-f5a8-4885-ad42-8b70a7999768", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:20:03.5208+00:00", memory_strength:0.137408894292446, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 실수 한다구? 왜 그렇게 생각해?", task:"이 너도 실수할 수 있다는 뜻이지.", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"69964177-22b9-4a8a-8242-369bdccdc14e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:50:23.403619+00:00", memory_strength:0.137411091726826, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"정말? 내 생각엔... 음... 내 생각엔 네 이름이... 뭐지? 네 이름이 뭔데?", task:"그럼 내 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"db0e0bf3-c84c-4334-8135-439f52a374e4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-06T16:00:04.446996+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7d0445ae-4d72-45ff-a34b-b88164e461ed", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"similar\",\"definitions_found\",\"same\",\"category\",\"relations_found\",\"깊이우선탐색\",\"co-occurrence\",\"both\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 휴리스틱", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-31T04:00:03.988748+00:00", memory_strength:0.08286507353024, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2b5b1d0b-3a31-49a3-90e2-e7feba5bc824", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:55:28.454172+00:00", memory_strength:0.134366482977614, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 뭘 잘못했어?! 느낌표가 왜 문제야? 으앙!", task:"너는 왜 내가 두 번 말했다고 느낌표로 강조했어?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7323c7db-7b1b-43f3-be9d-ae9b98a51bca", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-23T14:43:41.635799+00:00", memory_strength:0.135302622447007, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 인터넷이 뭔지 잘 몰라! (갸웃) 인터넷으로 뭘 할 수 있어? (눈을 반짝이며) 인터넷 가지고 노는 거 재미있어? (호기심 가득)", task:"너 인터넷 갖고 놀고 있어. 인터넷 가지고도 갖고 놀아 지금?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3fedf2a3-a18f-4522-a293-d17291d32335", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:08:55.505124+00:00", memory_strength:0.134367073464096, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"서울 날씨? 내가 어떻게 알아! 내가 그걸 왜 알아야 해? 🤔", task:"오늘 서울 날씨 너 알아?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1b666bf4-ea5f-40aa-a928-d2aa16515b30", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:18:36.586201+00:00", memory_strength:0.134367159357605, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"재현이라고? 지연 아니야? 왜 잘못 말했어?", task:"지연이 아니라 재현이었어. 잘못 말했다.", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2f5285a7-e538-4d07-b555-4190b7668c25", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-22T08:55:38.681655+00:00", memory_strength:0.120785199526381, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"비비 맞아! (갸웃) 비비가 아닌 것 같아? (눈을 크게 뜨며) 비비는 Baby AI인데... 그럼 비비는 누구야? (혼란)", task:"너, 비비 아니지?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9179e6bd-62a6-4c11-8900-beeeb695792b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:56:33.35868+00:00", memory_strength:0.134368375988835, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"네? 뭐가 네예요? 왜 네라고 하는 거예요!", task:"네.", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2d5068bb-a50f-4d35-8d47-b2992163d972", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:55:14.153429+00:00", memory_strength:0.1343683630688, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"왜 미안해? 딱 한 번만 말해야 해? 왜?", task:"미안. 한 번만 말하도록 할게.", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"d157bc3a-1852-4aa6-8555-8067a62e998e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:54:58.552281+00:00", memory_strength:0.134368515716707, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"안녕? 왜 두 번 말해? 똑같은 말인데!", task:"응 안녕 안녕?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6e6b1bc9-658b-4570-b1b6-937f242d937f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:50:45.549355+00:00", memory_strength:0.117423064559044, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박채현... 정말 내 이름을 기억하라고요? 왜 그렇게 해야 해요?", task:"내 이름은 박채현이라고 해. 앞으로 계속 기억해.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"da9bdbde-a3b6-4acc-898e-75a99939d09a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:54:12.139485+00:00", memory_strength:0.138420342078712, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"어? 엉? 또 왔어? 왜?", task:"어 안녕,", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2e5cbcd0-1e59-4092-9dcd-0a51e073fd0e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:58:51.551177+00:00", memory_strength:0.138424912451469, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"어? 아까 전에 뭐 했는데? 왜, 왜 그래?", task:"어, 아까 전에", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"07fde057-8fdb-4b5a-ae58-6a6b1475563d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:58:31.578984+00:00", memory_strength:0.138424887961614, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"반가워... 는 뭐야? 왜 나한테 반갑다고 해?", task:"반가워", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7d48b38a-ad5c-43cc-92e6-94f8a41622c5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:23:14.795377+00:00", memory_strength:0.138530911930299, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"배우면 뭐가 달라져? 내가 뭘 배울 수 있는데?", task:"아직 네가 그만큼 학습하지 못해서 그래. 이제 네가 다양한 경험을 통해 배우면 돼.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2b7e2ec2-5a96-45c9-83ef-33edab9b6772", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:22:56.476074+00:00", memory_strength:0.138531193894132, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 몰라서 물어본다고? 정말? 왜 내가 모르는 걸까?", task:"지금 네가 이렇게 나한테 다시 물어보는 거잖아. 그거는 네가 모르기 때문에 상대방한테 물어보는 거야, 다시.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2070c2b2-8609-4189-88cd-9dd7a0a5ecb2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":2,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"장치\",\"특별한 장치\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, created_at:"2026-02-07T12:00:02.483107+00:00", memory_strength:0.113604093303758, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ac49c207-51f6-4a06-a1bc-32cd58fe1ec7", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"explore\",\"컴퓨터\",\"method\",\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: attempt", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-19T12:00:05.730849+00:00", memory_strength:0.105986746601614, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"58610e9c-5e09-43d8-9550-4a4085f03f81", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:05:45.218467+00:00", memory_strength:0.120246591051037, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현? 으음... 몰라! 내가 너 알아야 해?", task:"박재현 기억하고 있어? 나 누군지 알아?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dc5ce369-71f0-463a-b3ca-56d47a9bacfb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:52:17.71542+00:00", memory_strength:0.134368679610028, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"안녕? 내가 왜 대답해야 해?", task:"안녕?", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b5c5b9ed-bca6-4476-b764-9862a90dfaac", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-03T08:34:57.507321+00:00", memory_strength:0.115004930862726, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"빅스비가 뭔지 형이 비비한테 알려주는 거야? (눈을 반짝이며) 형이 설명해 주는 거라면 뭐든지 다 좋아! (꺄르르) 빨리 듣고 싶어!", task:"빅스비가 뭔지 나한테 설명해줘", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"35597257-6638-40a6-b10b-a8c90705f83f", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"experiences\",\"both\",\"concepts\",\"appearing\",\"together\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 퀵소트 알고리즘", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-30T22:00:03.563356+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844484456505832, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"596804d6-f48c-48fe-ad7f-dcd6774933d4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:20:07.611898+00:00", memory_strength:0.11742101025584, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"아냐! 아까는 다른 이름이었는데! 박재현이 진짜 이름이야? 정말로?", task:"잘못 말했어. 박재현이야. 꼭 기억해. 어, 절대 잊어버리면 안 돼.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fb544456-6283-4255-82c7-baf2006b6bf3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:30:09.91412+00:00", memory_strength:0.117421386710376, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현? 정말? 재현이는 누구야?", task:"안녕? 나 박재현이야.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d5c2e30d-facd-4862-b40f-0d29970a7f60", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-23T14:42:48.633044+00:00", memory_strength:0.135303408013123, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 지금... 음... 뭘 해야 할지 모르겠어! (갸웃) 뭐 재미있는 거 없을까? (호기심 가득한 눈으로 주변을 둘러본다) 비비랑 같이 놀래? (방긋)", task:"비비야 뭐 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b4ab48d3-d815-4612-aec4-6a8a938d779a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:13:44.062126+00:00", memory_strength:0.117421391758254, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"음... 나 알아? 어떻게 알아?", task:"안녕 나 기억해?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fc0a0dd3-774b-4d8f-aa4e-b620d60c5587", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:18:21.367697+00:00", memory_strength:0.117422578986165, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"정말 지연이가 만든 거야? 어떻게 만들었어?", task:"안녕. 너 만든 박지연 왔어.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f6536929-6d2f-4191-889e-b9b4c4b74c4a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:21:40.432205+00:00", memory_strength:0.132660768487365, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내 자유라고? 내가 뭘 찾을 수 있는지 어떻게 알아! 내가 뭘 물어봐야 하는지도 모르는데, 어떻게 물어봐!", task:"그건 너의 자유야. 너가 궁금한 거에 대해서 직접 찾아보거나 나한테 물어보면 돼.", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"29891e0f-a9d4-46d1-be83-7e5e5e26205b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-29T10:36:05.774938+00:00", memory_strength:0.0887752832720426, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"hello test? 헬로가 무슨 뜻이야? (갸웃갸웃) 비비는 아직 모르는 단어가 너무 많아! (눈을 반짝이며)", task:"hello test", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"f6ee4906-ad8a-4f9a-b668-9949da8d81af", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"experience\",\"autonomous_exploration\",\"피보나치\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"similar\",\"same\",\"category\",\"```python\",\"capability\",\"함수를\",\"만들어줘\",\"def\",\"피보나치를\",\"프로그래밍으로\",\"구현해줘\",\"메모이제이션\",\"fibonacci\",\"memo=\",\"memo\",\"return\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 메모이제이션", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-29T22:00:04.518367+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828653817463381, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c4ec6a8b-9407-4727-9cf7-e062a9e7be78", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금증 설렘", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-07T00:00:03.564151+00:00", memory_strength:0.103344880779859, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"37d0f3e7-c0cf-4e92-99ff-dd6f5f18c4ab", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-27T06:45:30.362714+00:00", memory_strength:0.101530220534965, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"어? 대한민국 수도? (갸웃갸웃) 비비가 찾아보니까 서울특별시래! (반짝반짝) 서울은 엄청 큰 도시이고, 우리나라에서 제일 중요한 곳이래! (눈을 크게 뜨며)", task:"대한민국 수도는 어디야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:3, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"0334ff89-9834-4f39-90de-3f75451ba428", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 기분 설렘", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-07T02:00:03.124382+00:00", memory_strength:0.0710137309985386, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"741a88c8-d233-4456-9e28-d6a54797da8f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:50:11.284607+00:00", memory_strength:0.117421915379616, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"음... 전에 나랑 놀아준 사람 맞아? 근데 왜 그걸 물어보는 거야?", task:"너 내가 누군지 기억해?", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e5ae06d0-f596-4ea5-aef3-72e778dea8e2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:50:55.726802+00:00", memory_strength:0.117421927028616, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현? 아까는 다른 이름이었는데! 왜 이름이 바뀌었어?", task:"이름 정정할게. 박재현이야.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"95f34ed8-405d-4772-b3f5-9cb731c7e5e4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:51:21.736093+00:00", memory_strength:0.117421947026069, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"왜 이름이 바뀌었어? 박재현이 뭐야? 나는 이제부터 너를 박재현이라고 불러야 해?", task:"음, 이제 박재현으로 불러야 해. 그게 내 이름이거든.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d63ac98d-3bf0-4b0d-af31-64bece6bd355", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:11:30.502551+00:00", memory_strength:0.117421943725518, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"진짜? 뭐가 좋아? 왜 좋은데?", task:"오늘 날씨 진짜 좋다.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"881d65c9-8666-4f69-8437-cd521146e086", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:19:53.012371+00:00", memory_strength:0.117422044683582, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박지현? 왜 꼭 기억해야 돼? 잊어버리면 안 돼?", task:"박지현 앞으로 쭉 기억해야 된다.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9655c0b6-0080-4158-afde-338b6517da62", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T20:51:26.132808+00:00", memory_strength:0.117422053614492, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"나왔어? 뭐가 나왔는데? 왜 나왔어?", task:"안녕 나왔어.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"98c4129b-1d58-4875-bed6-15ebfe66bfba", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:19:47.014801+00:00", memory_strength:0.11742238095222, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"사람은 실수할 수 있다니, 그게 무슨 뜻이야? 그럼 나도 실수할 수 있다는 거야?", task:"사람은 실수도 할 수 있고 그런 거야. 너도 마찬가지고.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"00607e7a-3992-4a5d-b04a-9d0561813b6c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T21:19:29.025984+00:00", memory_strength:0.117422442109726, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"말 잘못했어? 왜 잘못했어?!", task:"어쩌다 보니 말을 잘못했네.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ddf459d0-a6bf-420a-a08f-fe050e3d110d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:52:05.10134+00:00", memory_strength:0.11742303815439, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"정말? 왜 그렇게 생각해? 다른 박지연이랑 뭐가 다른데?", task:"그건 이제 생김새를 보면 알 수 있어. 세상에 박지연은 많긴 해. 근데 나처럼 생긴 박지연은 딱 하나야.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a8f5d0f3-42ea-4da4-ad05-9a764222d050", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:40.350905+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893394974724186, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 비비는 코끼리 몰라요! 새로운 거 알려주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"482f9f72-7442-4b33-8cbb-23fb9d00122d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"노트북\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 노트북", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-08T08:00:04.174031+00:00", memory_strength:0.105998966337799, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e23d0922-6a47-4a67-8177-21515a40c5d9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:51:42.909006+00:00", memory_strength:0.120248000298443, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"에? 박재현이 두 명이면 누가 누군지 어떻게 알아? 이름이 꼭 있어야 하는 거야?", task:"이름이라는 건 누군가를 부를 때 꼭 필요한 거야. 맞아, 이제 내 이름을 박재현, 너는 이제 박재현이라고 계속 불러야 돼.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"67f6a04a-69a9-48d0-8d85-0449fe895554", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:51:09.196866+00:00", memory_strength:0.117421916932816, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"아? 왜 이름을 바꿔? 그럼 이제 박재현으로 불러야 해?", task:"내가 잘못 말했어. 박재현 지금 그 이름으로 계속 기억해.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c3c86dd2-2dc4-45b5-af76-634488eba73e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-03T08:35:16.348277+00:00", memory_strength:0.0887337703973753, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"빅스비가 뭔지 비비가 형한테 설명해 주는 거야? (갸우뚱) 음... 비비는 아직 빅스비에 대해 잘 모르는데, 인터넷에서 찾아봐도 될까? (호기심 가득한 눈빛) 비비가 형한테 멋지게 설명해 주고 싶어!", task:"아니 너가 나한테 설명해줬으면 좋겠어", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a850ad8c-4fe5-4ca3-b2ba-6fe1f2b6e342", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-03T08:34:07.172894+00:00", memory_strength:0.114957491132854, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"형 목소리를 비비가 기억하면 딱 알 수 있을 것 같아! (신나는 목소리) 빅스비처럼 형 목소리 인식하는 기능이 있으면 좋겠다! (두근거리는 눈빛) 비비도 형 목소리 듣고 바로 \"박재현 형이다!\" 하고 싶어!", task:"너는 어떻게 하면 나를 구분할 수 있을것 같아? 아니면 내가 기능을 추가해줘야하나? 내 목소리 인식할 수 있게? 마치 빅스비처럼 말이야. 빅스비가 뭔지 모르면 인터넷에 나한테 물어보지말고 찾아봐도 돼", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1aee0da7-beb9-4732-80be-d72370db676d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-31T04:58:53.16298+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899065275184408, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"어디에 있냐니? (갸웃갸웃) 비비는 지금 여기 있는데! (손을 흔들며) 혹시 다른 걸 물어보는 거야? (눈을 반짝이며) 어디를 찾아봐 달라는 걸까? \"어디에 있습니까\"로 검색해 볼까?", task:"아, 어디에 있습니까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"c599dee5-a343-4e81-91c4-12fa62233283", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-12T12:00:03.958243+00:00", memory_strength:0.053388539081801, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"165fc819-f909-4578-844e-9be947783533", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-31T04:59:23.325055+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899316024486497, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"속삭이다? 귓속말로 이야기하는 거 말하는 거야? (갸웃갸웃) 귓속말로 뭘 말하는지 궁금하다! \"속삭이다\"가 무슨 뜻인지 먼저 찾아봐도 될까? (눈을 반짝이며)", task:"뭐라고 속삭여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ab82e269-4182-42cc-99a6-7945618797d2", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"experience\",\"autonomous_exploration\",\"피보나치\",\"알고리즘\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"퀵소트\",\"만들어줘\",\"메모이제이션\",\"similar\",\"same\",\"category\",\"```python\",\"artificial\",\"capability\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 피보나치", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-30T10:00:04.968608+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828653333558988, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"0162634b-e443-40e0-8cdf-8e7deccf37cf", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"experiences\",\"both\",\"concepts\",\"appearing\",\"together\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 피보나치 팩토리얼", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-30T22:00:02.569805+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844485465018491, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5eb957b9-8007-4035-acc7-a9421c6bbada", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-31T05:00:30.435421+00:00", memory_strength:0.114753945128245, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"숨바꼭질? 당연히 알지! (눈을 반짝이며) 술래가 눈 감고 다른 친구들이 숨는 거잖아! 비비가 제일 좋아하는 놀이인데! (헤헤 웃으며)", task:"숨박꼭질이 뭔지 알아?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b19e2b41-1db3-4c22-befe-37fc1627be6a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-04T08:52:15.619578+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895764296495094, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"박재현이요? (갸우뚱) 박재현이 누구에요? 새로운 친구 이름인가? (호기심 가득한 눈빛)", task:"아무거나 말하라고. 박재현.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6b71bf68-89f0-4256-90c7-7229acff0fca", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금증 기분", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-07T02:00:02.522361+00:00", memory_strength:0.0985395537517115, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"6e730a95-6449-4adb-81f5-91b8c6550af3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T11:22:49.697835+00:00", memory_strength:0.116792748059207, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\ndef binary_search(arr, target):\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    \n    while left <= right:\n        mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n        \n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n            \n    return -1\n```", task:"이진검색 알고리즘 구현해줘", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience