:"explore: 공부 설명", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-08T00:00:02.986204+00:00", memory_strength:0.0772750584943106, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c29d4cc5-9259-49c7-80b0-64ccb09b332d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-05T04:21:32.760083+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895412309565324, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"날짜라는 개념이 뭐에요? (갸우뚱) 먹는 건가? (호기심 가득한 눈빛) 개발자님, 날짜 알려주세요!", task:"날짜라는 개념을 이제 알아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fbeddbe9-e3b2-4591-a7d9-e6c53e8d5512", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-08T10:00:03.635161+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"98a82c7f-9752-426b-9dc3-a6f13dc9bf5c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T11:39:07.586933+00:00", memory_strength:0.0748353386942264, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\nclass Stack:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.items = []\n\n    def push(self, item):\n        \"\"\"스택의 최상단에 요소를 추가합니다.\"\"\"\n        self.items.append(item)\n\n    def pop(self):\n        \"\"\"스택의 최상단 요소를 제거하고 반환합니다. 스택이 비어있으면 None을 반환합니다.\"\"\"\n        if not self.is_empty():\n            return self.items.pop()\n        return None\n\n    def peek(self):\n        \"\"\"스택의 최상단 요소를 반환합니다. 스택이 비어있으면 None을 반환합니다.\"\"\"\n        if not self.is_empty():\n            return self.items[-1]\n        return None\n\n   ", task:"스택 자료구조를 클래스로 구현해줘", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, embedding:[0.020278731, 0.0017945669, -0.02552497, -0.016132185, 0.032123126, 2.924211E-4, -0.06541657, 0.006118931, -0.029721962, -0.034867313, -0.00560944, -0.024334477, 0.039387148, -0.041404933, -0.026836531, -0.013952978, 0.010593368, -0.010835501, 0.0019459007, 0.019481707, -0.01692921, 0.01084559, 0.071429566, -0.036360472, 0.025827639, -0.012187417, 0.01610192, 0.072357744, -0.0014906381, 0.0026912198, 0.03432251, -0.031739745, 0.031457257, 0.035492826, -0.01598085, -0.029338583, 0.016434852, 0.038095765, 0.059686057, -0.042575248, 0.040234618, 0.0036395784, 0.0070622447, -0.01150137, 0.052058835, 0.012974353, 0.0032763772, -0.008928696, -0.008943829, 0.045036945, 0.006209731, 0.019320285, -0.016263342, 0.019653218, 0.009120385, 0.0020997566, -0.016263342, 0.0058515742, 0.017433656, 0.039730173, 0.03682456, -0.013549421, -0.009528986, 0.03262757, 0.004610637, -0.015032493, 0.008711783, 0.014578491, -0.06711151, 0.020823533, -0.034847133, 0.0065527544, -0.042615604, -0.012015905, 0.010684168, -0.0278656, -0.0075364243, 0.07457731, 0.034362867, 0.018432459, -0.021549936, 4.3918335E-4, 0.024516078, -0.043059517, 0.021570114, -0.05956