39, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5f85bf9b-bf21-4604-bd88-e25d2577fe60", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-25T06:38:29.591565+00:00", memory_strength:0.10421568813121, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"우와! (눈을 반짝이며) 비비는 서울이 대한민국에서 제일 큰 도시라는 거 배웠어! 그리고 특별시라는 것도! 특별시는 뭘까? (갸웃) 혹시 비비가 모르는 다른 것도 있을까? (호기심 가득)", task:"피비, 최근에 배운 게 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"70c5b03c-3bb1-4377-8396-39faa73c2a3e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-25T06:41:48.773514+00:00", memory_strength:0.125820146589411, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"응! 비비가 \"서울특별시 특별시 역할\"로 다시 찾아볼게! (반짝반짝) 이번엔 진짜 제대로 찾아볼게! (갸웃갸웃)", task:"음 그렇게 해서 한번 제대로 찾아봐.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e4473c6e-404d-41b0-b386-cd9367ee8d6b", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 날짜", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-07T16:00:03.820861+00:00", memory_strength:0.0501423535358285, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ad69b58a-1b4d-4853-80be-455ef8e3a9cb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T11:41:19.242849+00:00", memory_strength:0.0748767848815196, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\ndef selection_sort(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n):\n        min_index = i\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if arr[j] < arr[min_index]:\n                min_index = j\n        arr[i], arr[min_index] = arr[min_index], arr[i]\n    return arr\n```", task:"선택정렬 알고리즘 구현해줘", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, embedding:[0