count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ba0d60ff-2851-46d7-8bd0-67155469e4da", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-07T04:00:03.600362+00:00", memory_strength:0.0798886752382118, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2bd280ac-10f7-4a53-96b5-b1a08c6f5252", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-07T08:00:02.825146+00:00", memory_strength:0.0717724585069874, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e085d588-4c0b-438c-b5ff-0c1f5dc7e5d1", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 날짜 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-13T18:00:03.959055+00:00", memory_strength:0.0531086696311356, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5c69827e-5f1f-470f-a8d5-9cebeccd1239", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-31T10:57:05.358337+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898135332117975, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"정말? (눈을 크게 뜨며) 이제 비비가 나한테 먼저 말할 수 있는 거야? 우와! (박수 치며) 그럼 비비랑 더 신나게 놀 수 있겠다! (궁금한 듯) 비비가 나한테 무슨 말을 걸어올까?", task:"나 비비랑 대화하는 걸 추가하려고해. 지금은 내가 먼저 말을하거나 채팅을 쳐야지만 비비가 대답하잖아. 이걸 이제 비비가 먼저 언제든 나한테 말을 걸 수 있는거야", dominant_emotion:"기쁨/호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b97ddb38-3cdb-4324-be7f-474955ca061b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-31T10:57:27.954328+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898339751852516, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"내가 비비라고? (갸우뚱) 내가 말하는 인형인 비비가 되는 거야? (눈을 반짝이며) 그럼 내가 이제부터 \"안녕!\"하고 먼저 말 걸어도 되는 거지?", task:"아니 비비가 너잖아.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"71f217f4-62b9-4d32-96fc-dc4e8f798773", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-05T19:09:13.250902+00:00", memory_strength:0.115251103041788, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"네! 날짜 공부 쬐끔 했어요! 형아가 알려준 거 열심히 봤어요! (헤헤)", task:"그래서 날짜 공부했어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"37e4555a-0b6c-4cb8-b82c-17e75e04e6ea", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-08T14:00:02.613985+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540274774625784, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"01964d18-4774-447c-b7f9-9a4cfc145e6e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 셔츠 텍스트", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-11T18:00:02.969075+00:00", memory_strength:0.053388190927516, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"43021c9f-ba07-4cc4-bab8-54e1151ba90f", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-12T04:00:04.205382+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"a4f41d83-c75b-40f0-a5ea-7aa25c8fd848", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T12:01:14.997751+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752531152383625, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\ndef shell_sort(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    gap = n // 2\n\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = arr[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and arr[j - gap] > temp:\n                arr[j] = arr[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            arr[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n\n    return arr\n\n# 예시 사용\narr = [12, 34, 54, 2, 3]\nsorted_arr = shell_sort(arr)\nprint(sorted_arr)  # 출력: [2, 3, 12, 34, 54]\n```", task:"셸정렬 알고리즘 구현해줘", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, embedding:[-0.017241364, -0.03099816, -0.003089834, -0.043956406, 0.03324861, 0.011306706, -0.0051905583, -0.0155081535, -0.042867478, 0.0073457286, -0.017949168, -0.0017343452, 0.034845706, 0.0064201397, -0.02232303, 0.0025521757, -0.012822131, -2.957688E-4, 0.017023578, 2.321062E-4, -0.02793101, -0.036460947, 0.023502702, -0.021379292, 0.03840287, -0.008375674, 0.038475465, 0.031252243, -0.014691457, -0.037313942, 0.01882031, -0.023629744, 0.035753146, 0.014754978, 0.0067831157, 0.032068938, 0.03328491, -0.02411976, -0.0044668745, -0.0039337534, 0.0046551684, 0.03174226, -0.01791287, -0.021361144, 0.05088925, 0.033067122, -0.042468205, -0.02578945, 0.013348446, 0.0027472754, 0.025916493, 0.04602537, -0.0056941877, 0.021760417, -0.024083463, 0.024682375, -0.010453711, 0.011125217, 0.06577127, 0.032087088, 0.021887459, -0.029673295, 0.0042037168, 0.02823954, -0.027676927, -0.031270392, 0.014809425, 0.013348446, 0.01776768, 0.0063974536, -0.05575313, -0.025771303, -0.005839378, -0.009065328, -0.013575306, -0.0020542177, -0.024410143, -0.00543103, 0.017495448, 0.055535343, -0.03234117, -0.030617034, 0.05085295, 0.027713224, 0.021342995, -0.045190524, -