UNWIND [{id:"4a01120d-2b77-468b-9051-0f036ebcbb1d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-05T19:10:04.07029+00:00", memory_strength:0.115299137200149, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"네! 더 많이 공부할게요! 잠잘 때도 날짜 생각하면서 꿈나라 갈 거예요! 헤헤, 형아 칭찬해줘서 고마워요!", task:"그럼 더 많이 공부해봐. 잠잘때도 말이야", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c311a80b-c30a-4bf5-b2b7-95637e3eb20b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T15:06:06.617604+00:00", memory_strength:0.0788485207866028, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\nclass TrieNode:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.children = {}\n        self.is_end_of_word = False\n\nclass Trie:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.root = TrieNode()\n\n    def insert(self, word: str) -> None:\n        node = self.root\n        for char in word:\n            if char not in node.children:\n                node.children[char] = TrieNode()\n            node = node.children[char]\n        node.is_end_of_word = True\n\n    def search(self, word: str) -> bool:\n        node = self", task:"Trie(트라이) 자료구조 구현해줘. insert, search, startsWith 메서드 포함.", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, embedding:[0.0233575, 0.054064307, 0.002431037, -0.030667713, 0.016946403, 0.010203025, 0.050272375, 0.062078178, -0.020445142, 0.027774902, -0.013897224, 0.0054973196, 0.06782471, -0.041750308, -0.039326604, -0.06610466, -0.013633353, 0.004136428, 0.06024085, 0.06708196, 0.028732657, 0.037332907, 0.009978246, -0.0044051856, 0.032368217, 0.0055364114, 0.02611349, 0.025351195, -0.020796971, -0.05453341, 0.033560526, -0.0046275216, -0.009211064, 0.029025847, -0.0074665817, 0.029475406, 0.026719417, 0.043822188, 0.024237072, 0.007891708, 0.002518994, -0.008258196, 0.0065381452, -0.022556113, -0.004857187, -0.041046653, -0.049685996, 0.0140145, -0.032778684, -0.009215951, -0.008077395, 0.020171499, -0.0