ration\",\"만들어줘\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"팩토리얼\",\"피보나치\",\"알고리즘\",\"퀵소트\",\"이진트리\",\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"구하는\",\"재귀로\",\"```python\",\"class\",\"treenode\",\"def\",\"__init__\",\"self\",\"중위순회\",\"value\",\"클래스\",\"구현해줘\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 이진트리", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-01T02:00:03.70368+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828673234905224, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"d67f0ee1-871e-41df-aa0a-92b52b899501", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금증 기쁨", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-06T18:00:03.312185+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5d803837-8f9a-4a88-bafc-a99950b103ee", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T15:22:58.35934+00:00", memory_strength:0.0791850846334581, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\nclass Graph:\n    def __init__(self, vertices):\n        self.V = vertices\n        self.graph = []\n\n    def add_edge(self, u, v, w):\n        self.graph.append((u, v, w))\n\n    def bellman_ford(self, src):\n        distance = [float(\"inf\")] * self.V\n        distance[src] = 0\n\n        for _ in range(self.V - 1):\n            for u, v, w in self.graph:\n                if distance[u] != float(\"inf\") and distance[u] + w < distance[v]:\n                    distance[v] = distance[u] + w\n\n        # ", task:"벨만-포드 알고리즘 구현해줘. 음수 가중치 처리 포함.", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, embedding:[-0.032128476, -0.028140113, 0.028583264, -0.025126683, -0.021681182, -0.0078880945, -0.04101366, 0.017105643, -0.015754031, 0.06257298, 0.0064755497, -0.06722607, -0.05459625, -0.049854532, 0.028