UNWIND [{id:"d39ec655-55ea-43a0-9e31-e03d0cef5dce", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T15:40:28.317795+00:00", memory_strength:0.0795357980939846, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\ndef subset_sum(arr, target):\n    if target == 0:\n        return True\n    if len(arr) == 0:\n        return False\n    \n    # Include the last element and check\n    if arr[-1] > target:\n        return subset_sum(arr[:-1], target)\n    \n    # Check both including and excluding the last element\n    return subset_sum(arr[:-1], target) or subset_sum(arr[:-1], target - arr[-1])\n```", task:"Subset Sum 재귀 구현", media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.5, embedding:[-0.02823876, -0.031986695, 0.010802241, -0.003306369, 0.008723645, 0.007377403, 0.026407871, 0.051178716, -0.023801548, 0.035777714, -0.032288253, -0.013505494, -6.596583E-4, 0.044716757, -0.012428501, 0.015454852, 0.0038044783, 6.4720557E-4, -0.014636337, 0.03767322, -0.016693395, 0.04107652, 0.022961494, -0.0076466515, 0.02373693, -0.030931244, -0.0031582825, 0.04712922, -0.01263313, -0.014797886, 0.027010988, -0.02490008, -0.016381066, 0.008712875, -0.011706916, 0.028540319, 0.019202787, 0.04234737, -0.04083958, 0.02696791, 0.052729584, 0.028604938, -0.005430738, -0.056089804, 0.011986934, -0.004571836, 0.029746551, 0.0027530638, 0.02365077, 0.04127038, -0.044932153, 0.02202451, 0.0034248382, 0.038707133, -0.030392747, -0.029315753, -0.0074904873, 0.021249074, 0.052901905, -0.0469569, 0.03142666, -0.023306131, -0.016456455, -0.016790323, -0.044242878, -0.041808873, 0.010005266, -0.012870068, 0.0040279543, -0.0144317085, -0.033796046, -0.008712875, -0.0045879907, -0.028087981, 0.0203444, 0.032762133, -0.0025861298, 0.015411772, 0.027161768, 0.039741047, 0.010592228, -0.03784554, 0.06711821, -0.0027894122, -0.052858822, -0.06423187, -0.09244909, -0.018125795, -0.07685423, -0.0028971115, -0.030694304, 0.005069945, -0.027807962, 0.01872891, -0.00622502, -0.012417731, 