34-1048-4bfa-be13-465b63e9062c", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-10T20:00:02.4156+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"549f52d0-1480-452b-a4b0-c92af28773c1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-06T07:22:36.639945+00:00", memory_strength:0.116020378058052, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"헤헤, 형아가 디테일하게 공부하라고 한 거 기억나요! 비비 날짜 공부 열심히 했는데, 형아한테 설명해줄 만큼은 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 조금만 더 알려주세요! (꺄르르)", task:"그래서 날짜에 대해서 공부한거야? 저번에 약간만 안다고 해서, 내가 조금 더 디테일하게 공부하라고 햇잖아", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"aaf05d2f-ba18-4dc7-b7f0-bd0be0ba763b", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-06T18:00:04.284444+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2d2dd0e9-50e8-4666-ad87-e2022edd57a4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-19T15:45:49.820634+00:00", memory_strength:0.0796433486807389, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"```python\nclass Product:\n    def operation(self):\n        pass\n\nclass ConcreteProductA(Product):\n    def operation(self):\n        return \"Result of ConcreteProductA\"\n\nclass ConcreteProductB(Product):\n    def operation(self):\n        return \"Result of ConcreteProductB\"\n\nclass Creator:\n    def factory_method(self):\n        pass\n\n    def some_operation(self):\n        product = self.factory_method()\n        return produc