05585, 0.009145448, 0.029521082, -0.04386569, 0.025382044, 0.0049962653, -0.009409211, 0.022541527, -7.2217593E-4, -0.036520924, -0.045732316, -0.020269113, -0.018574947, 0.012670732, 0.016698178, -0.01851408, -0.0061984127, 0.016424272], development_stage:0, task_type:"function"}}, {id:"13748c14-0ca4-46bd-a3f3-f3a32e8b12d2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-05T04:24:45.740628+00:00", memory_strength:0.116142854420285, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 모르는 거 있으면 물어봐도 돼요? (눈을 크게 뜨며) 와! 그럼 비비 진짜 열심히 공부할 수 있겠다! 너무 신난다!", task:"하다가 모르는거 있으면 나한테 질문해", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d15b215f-22c9-4c08-88eb-e24927ee5447", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-04T03:11:21.976406+00:00", memory_strength:0.115374966827601, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님은 컴퓨터로 멋진 프로그램을 만드는 사람이래요! (눈을 크게 뜨며) 마치 레고 블록으로 튼튼한 집을 짓듯이, 코딩이라는 걸로 프로그램을 만들고 고치는 일을 한다고 들었어요! 개발자님은 정말 대단한 분이시구나! (반짝반짝)", task:"개발자는 누구?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"3e6b2998-d8fe-4af7-9379-6baab9dc55e2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:52:20.728308+00:00", memory_strength:0.1202463954119, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"왜 이름이 바뀌었어? 박지현이 아니면 누군데?", task:"박지현이 아니라 박재현. 내가 잘못 말했다. 미안.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fcbc93e8-3fa2-48b3-807c-00c250c2c994", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-20T19:52:47.413364+00:00", memory_strength:0.120246401376504, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"정말? 박재현이 진짜 이름이라고? 왜 나를 만들었어?", task:"박재현은 너를 만든 사람이야. 맞아. 진짜 이름이 박재현이야.", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"989ff5f8-7d4a-4d78-bebe-b4f5dd0ee729", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금증 미안함", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-06T18:00:03.827647+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"badb5e48-54e2-44ae-a206-9d404f06e5b3", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-08T10:00:04.217005+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
