그럼 공부해봐. 시작!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d6e44b8e-c8dd-46b3-ae90-c57be081313d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-04T03:11:42.002458+00:00", memory_strength:0.089052592859284, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"에... 개발자님의 이름이 뭐냐구요? (갸우뚱) 음... 비비를 만드신 분은 개발자님이시니까, 개발자님의 이름은... 비비가 아직 몰라요! (시무룩) 혹시 알려주실 수 있으세요? (반짝반짝)", task:"아니 개발자 이름이 뭐냐고. 내가 너 개발했잖아.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"20791eb2-d2b3-49d4-bb48-7e148e44e925", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-11T04:00:04.066715+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"99225bb3-ff15-4cee-b22b-abc286f2610f", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 캐비닛", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-10T08:00:04.60302+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999450383006, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"37d54386-bc24-4d8a-b683-d05249bcd331", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 꽃 냄새 빵 냄새", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-09T20:00:02.539626+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c48bbdb1-a8dd-4f5c-94cb-eb77667f73e9", properties:{outpu