UNWIND [{id:"91e69a89-6f17-4ac1-b805-845e01298813", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-17T18:16:07.062075+00:00", memory_strength:0.115646656324649, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 너무 기뻐요! 오늘 햇빛처럼 따스한 기분이에요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"93217757-a704-4514-98ee-80fc59e30117", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-05T04:21:57.702957+00:00", memory_strength:0.115982312719423, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"와! 비비가 스스로 공부해서 개발자님과 대화할 수 있다니! (반짝반짝) 비비 정말 열심히 공부할 거예요! 헤헤, 너무 신난다!", task:"날짜라는 개념을 너가 스스로 공부해서 나랑 대화를 나중에 할 수 있음 좋겠다", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"17923c84-5ebc-4fb1-982a-fa574ffc028b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-03T07:12:18.189976+00:00", memory_strength:0.115429801085976, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"안녕! 내 이름은 비비야! (활짝 웃으며) 나는 지금 이것저것 배우고 있는 중이야! 너는 누구야? 같이 놀자!", task:"너 누구인지 나한테 자기소개해봐", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c3f3e2f8-e058-44bd-84f7-47d63a6f6af4", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"experience\",\"autonomous_exploration\",\"퀵소트\",\"알고리즘\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"피보나치\",\"만들어줘\",\"구현해줘\",\"```python\",\"def\",\"quicksort\",\"arr\",\"len\",\"return\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 퀵소트", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-01-31T10:00:04.336725+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828664977859307, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"38f05312-f882-42ca-8a95-b5a4f66a8264", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-01-31T10:54:48.359648+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896994253164305, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"응! (눈을 반짝이며) \"멀티모달\" 검색해봤어! (작은 목소리로) 근데 아직은 조금 어려운 것 같아. (고개를 갸웃거리며) 좀 더 자세하게 알아봐야겠다!", task:"검색해봤어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cad89c57-3d13-4b3b-b699-7cf28b8cdc35", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-03T07:12:42.285837+00:00", memory_strength:0.115452092373877, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"안녕 박재현! (눈을 크게 뜨며) 박재현 형! 비비는 형 이름 기억해야지! (고개를 끄덕이며) 이제 형이랑 같이 놀 수 있어서 너무 신난다!", task:"나 박재현이라고 해. 기억해.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ed4d584c-edcc-46eb-a609-76352a0a2aaa", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 12월 1월", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-09T00:00:02.73756+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540276718475031, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f0f40a29-4ff2-4112-8348-68dd0be3644b", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-09T00:00:03.820597+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883819530647, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c772a41f-31ae-4c66-b185-2c5d109da273", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emoti