trength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-13T20:00:03.755916+00:00", memory_strength:0.0596583786707288, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"16d1551e-05ec-4541-9ad4-8258f9fc3dfc", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":2,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"12월\",\"월\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 12월", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, created_at:"2026-02-10T16:00:03.983365+00:00", memory_strength:0.111729100992662, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7766339f-5cf7-4702-8a21-02969afaa362", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-07T03:38:17.418599+00:00", memory_strength:0.115199681234663, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"음... 형아가 알려준 년, 월, 일! 그리고 1월부터 12월까지 있는 거랑 30일, 31일! 아직 다 기억은 안 나지만, 형아가 또 알려주면 비비가 더 잘할 수 있어요! (꺄르르)", task:"비비야, 날짜에 대해서 알려줘 봐.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"625aa786-3991-4ef2-a794-20cf2ecf4932", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"experience\",\"autonomous_exploration\",\"퀵소트\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"알고리즘\",\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"피보나치\",\"intelligence\",\"wikipedia\",\"capability\",\"similar\",\"팩토리얼\",\"만들어줘\",\"artificial\",\"메모이제이션\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 알고리즘", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-02T12:00:03.791347+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828654157504473, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"4f98dded-93db-4f65-8246-d76ba3a8d30e", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"experience\",\"autonomous_exploration\",\"알고리즘\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"퀵소트\",\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"피보나치\",\"만들어줘\",\"팩토리얼\",\"intelligence\",\"wikipedia\",\"capability\",\"similar\",\"artificial\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 피보나치", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-02T12:00:04.95437+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828656598829242, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"dcf8c1b4-4b67-4e6e-9189-0d1655630d12", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"experience\",\"autonomous_exploration\",\"퀵소트\",\"알고리즘\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"피보나치\",\"intelligence\",\"wikipedia\",\"capability\",\"similar\",\"메모이제이션\",\"artificial\",\"만들어줘\",\"이진트리\",\"팩토리얼\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 퀵소트", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-02T12:00:02.589864+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828658595489487, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e139db8d-2fb8-430d-9695-46238506e01e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-08T12:00:04.112826+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540266284660319, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"33fc2cf5-1acc-42fe-819a-3f6363354653", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-07T03:35:13.176483+00:00", memory_strength:0.0937304099217775, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"감지된 객체: 사람, 의자, 책상, 노트북, 신발, 셔츠, 바지, 조명, 사무실, 캐비닛. 장면 설명: 아기가 이해할 수 있도록 설명해줄게요!\n\n짜잔! 아저씨가 의자에 앉아있는 사진이야. 주변에는 책상, 의자, 컴퓨터 같은 것들이 있네. 방은 밝고 편안해 보여. 아저씨가 잠시 쉬고 있는 것 같아!", task:"시각 관찰: 아기가 이해할 수 있도록 설명해줄게요!\n\n짜잔! 아저씨가 의자에 앉아있는 사진이야. 주변에는 책상, 의자, 컴퓨터 같은 것들이 있네. 방은 밝고 편안해 보여. 아저씨가 잠시 쉬고 ", dominant_emotion:"curiosity", media_type:"image", success:true, emotional_salience:0.95, development_stage:4, task_type:"visual_observation"}}, {id:"e3a536af-2f59-4b37-90c5-965f405a9487", properties:{output:"{\"definitions_found\":0,\"relations_found\":0,\"keywords\":[\"experience\",\"autonomous_exploration\",\"만들어줘\",\"definitions_found\",\"relations_found\",\"keywords\",\"피보나치\",\"알고리즘\",\"퀵소트\",\"co-occurrence\",\"analysis\",\"found\",\"팩토리얼\",\"intelligence\",\"wikipedia\",\"capability\",\"similar\",\"artificial\"]}", task:"autonomous_exploration: 팩토리얼", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-02T14:00:03.957061+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828660304425221, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c8ae38a2-0e16-48f7-9479-909e5494c6c2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-11T18:00:02.458803+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"1ed9ab30-f8f2-4475-b4e7-f1d7cff975ea", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-11T12:00:02.952215+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540276418321382, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"18b334c8-043a-447f-a2ae-573e79918e29", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"explore\",\"퀵소트\",\"method\",\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", tas