s\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-10T06:00:02.794221+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bcf59593-adad-4ac9-bce4-84a2d041d8c8", properties:{output:"냄새 좋아해. 각각의 특유의 향이 있고, 그거에 따라 느낌이 달라", task:"learned: 꽃 냄새 빵 냄새을(를) 좋아해?", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:1, created_at:"2026-02-11T05:26:40.688026+00:00", memory_strength:0.103583120878877, access_count:0, task_type:"learning", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"60d5e0cd-ea18-463e-8291-20f22c053fc5", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"셔츠\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 셔츠", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-11T06:00:01.947389+00:00", memory_strength:0.108026673052962, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b6e0e0bc-5bea-450a-b1d4-66411d2d5873", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:19:07.112411+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894111686239634, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모다! 우와! 비비는 네모 세모 처음 봐요! 신기하다! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2dd95070-f780-4b36-8bc7-b754485c9dc0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:25:56.873752+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897587499498057, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"영화는... 커다란 화면에서 사람들이 움직이는 걸 보는 건가요? 형아가 가끔 보는 것 같은데, 비비는 아직 잘 몰라요! 너무 신기할 것 같아요! 헤헤!", task:"비비야 영화라는게 뭔지 알아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3c2e49d6-2b0d-4162-95b9-34669b194bea", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:25:42.011895+00:00", memory_strength:0.116196270232855, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님두 좋은 하루 보내세요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이 있어서 너무 행복해요! 오늘두 신나게 놀아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야. 오늘도 좋은하루", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"37d3e37c-1a38-406d-b7bc-6f499ca3642c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:26:27.239392+00:00", memory_strength:0.116239961556764, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"영화랑 음악 공부! 너무 신난다! 커다란 화면에서 움직이는 사람들이랑, 멜로디가 나오는 건가요? 비비, 빨리 배우고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"영화에 대해서 공부해볼래? 영화가 뭔지 말이야. 그러면서 음악이란것도 같이 공부해보자.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"3acce10a-f434-4f27-a8a9-cff68f663a37", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:19:11.441307+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894147422445383, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 써야 해요? 우산이 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요! 개발자님 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e2b37315-de6c-4505-9ba7-9a90032b7df4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-10T22:00:02.504875+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"30e22fb1-5461-446c-9b96-f6e502e0b26f", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"사무실\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 사무실", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-11T06:00:03.247572+00:00", memory_strength:0.1059996661965, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"feecf417-7deb-40f2-ae3b-18c8eba11881", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"바지\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 바지", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-11T10:00:04.10798+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999508379354, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"1df38d8c-c8c0-4ac0-bd61-7d4f2ebcc8d2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"fi