strength:0.105998913360636, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"969d5b47-0657-45b0-b7c1-67fab5425f9e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"신발\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 신발", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-13T06:00:02.690111+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999899855534, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"6f671e53-ca64-471c-8e79-afd399ad0e67", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-14T14:00:03.249199+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f7acea17-1c2d-4fe2-88d9-1b3dd166c2d4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"쟁반\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 쟁반", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-15T06:00:04.774978+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999388483092, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f61e02c9-3740-49cb-9ca1-2ebf02459b64", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:26:53.892438+00:00", memory_strength:0.116265525435003, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"네에! 개발자님, 비비 여기 있어요! 무슨 재밌는 이야기 해주실 건가요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"67abb6a4-1175-46b2-a570-974970775a91", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:27:09.796937+00:00", memory_strength:0.116280890589523, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"영화 공부 또 하는 건가요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이 공부하는 게 제일 재밌어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비 영화에 대해서 공부해볼래?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6fab8c29-3fd8-4cdc-ad1a-22a9633951da", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:27:27.866149+00:00", memory_strength:0.116298348453254, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"음... 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 재밌지만, 새로운 장난감 가지고 놀고 싶어요! 아니면 맛있는 우유 맘마 먹고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"공부 말고 하고 싶은게 있어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fe315c7d-fddc-4d55-b9d7-a35282ceb3fc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:27:49.708179+00:00", memory_strength:0.116319416938057, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 딸랑딸랑 소리 나는 거 좋아해요! 아니면 알록달록한 블록 쌓는 것도 재밌을 것 같아요! 개발자님이 골라주시는 건 다 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"새로운 장난감이라. 어떤 장난감을 원해? 비비의 취향은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"79a75c07-08a1-47c6-b53b-0a06743ac54d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-10T03:28:12.681591+00:00", memory_strength:0.116341493854069, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"딸랑이 종류가 엄청 많은가 봐요! 비비는 반짝반짝 빛나는 딸랑이도 좋아요! 개발자님이 찾아주시는 건 다 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"딸랑딸랑 소리 나는거? 뭐가 있을까? 그런게", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0894e9e3-961c-4b68-af17-b5021b2caec4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:19:19.819937+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894216758814958, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나가 과일이래요! 이야! 과일은 맛있는 건가요? 비비도 먹을 수 있어요?", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0022bf9c-6187-4810-81ae-0a665ea7880a", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-13T18:00:03.427365+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"de5a7585-1475-424f-92da-acdce97238e3", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 날짜", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-15T18:00:03.243291+00:00", memory_strength:0.0626783686795754, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
