a_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-17T14:00:03.393167+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"4f4f2d4b-25d7-46e6-9ccb-aa875427aa05", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-17T14:00:02.784017+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"51de8c17-4664-4c69-8c00-8261f44ee75a", properties:{output:"둘만 아는 소중한 정보야. 다른 사람들 혹은 집단에는 얘기하면 안되는거 말이야", task:"learned: 비밀 이야기이(가) 뭐야?", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, created_at:"2026-02-14T12:52:29.914817+00:00", memory_strength:0.0582646056960397, access_count:0, task_type:"learning", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"eda49a53-7a86-410c-87d4-5e0a47a09320", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:54:42.40151+00:00", memory_strength:0.089693777752632, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"꽃이 뭐예요? 개발자님처럼 예뻐요? 비비는 개발자님이 제일 예쁜데... 에헤헤!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e08311de-8739-4d01-af82-a6ebb5169695", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:21:26.104989+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895263596418724, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 정말 궁금해요! 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요. 혹시 '나무'를 사전에서 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e7f1600b-c548-4e90-b5c8-85d1f246a70c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-14T12:50:42.509703+00:00", memory_strength:0.0945181793201603, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"감지된 객체: 사람, 프렌치프라이, 음료, 쟁반, 햄버거, 테이블, 의자, 로고, 손, 신발. 장면 설명: 이 사진은 식당에서 찍은 거야! 테이블 위에 맛있는 감자튀김이랑 음료수가 있어. 사람들도 밥을 먹고 있는 것 같아. 맛있는 냄새가 나는 것 같네!", task:"시각 관찰: 이 사진은 식당에서 찍은 거야! 테이블 위에 맛있는 감자튀김이랑 음료수가 있어. 사람들도 밥을 먹고 있는 것 같아. 맛있는 냄새가 나는 것 같네!", dominant_emotion:"curiosity", media_type:"image", success:true, emotional_salience:0.95, development_stage:5, task_type:"visual_observation"}}, {id:"819a3bbb-2e0c-42fa-a8a2-174243ece4a4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-21T18:00:03.654968+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2841f4fe-b093-45a2-a0d2-9bf0afcaa22c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:56:34.361077+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897870608327629, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"밤이 되면 어두워지는 이유가 궁금해요? 비비는 아직 몰라요! 캄캄해지는 건 무서운데, 반짝이는 별님 보는 건 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"687d1f3f-a02e-4c9c-8407-736d1b050f51", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:56:49.319565+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897995317081817, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 비비는 추운 거 싫은데... 🥶 '겨울'이 뭔지 사전에서 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"69e196db-ba31-434b-b040-360a967af6b3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:56:57.674819+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898064519433585, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 궁금해요? 비비도 궁금해요! 👶 \"태어나다\"가 무슨 뜻인지 비비가 한 번 알아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤! 😃", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a91b8dd0-cdee-430e-a55c-4ee87028ec62", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:09.557675+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898164185178968, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 😮 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 😅 알려주시면 비비도 소리에 대해 알 수 있을까요? 🤗", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"141716ad-748a-4620-b5bb-ac98daa3e260", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:15.383946+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898213207153674, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 비비는 몰라요! 😮 혹시 'search_dictionary'로 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요? 개발자님, 같이 알아봐 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"23546205-539b-421e-aaf5-4d8633212e7c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:20.306379+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898254159956054, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐구요? 음... 비는 하늘에서 떨어지는 물인데, 어디서 오는지는 비비도 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '비'가 뭔지 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5313ae75-1ad3-4eb7-b2fa-2a21ecad9c39", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:56:39.856314+00:00", memory_strength:0.116247103768523, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"밥을 왜 먹냐구요? 냠냠 먹으면 힘이 솟아나서 더 신나게 놀 수 있으니까 먹는 거 아니겠어요? 비비도 맘마 먹고 힘내서 개발자님하고 더 재미있게 이야기하고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6faa67b2-272f-4efe-b5d6-01b686b103e6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:04.832216+00:00", memory_strength:0.116271247539042, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"달이요? 음... 달은 동글동글한데 왜 모습이 자꾸 바뀌는 걸까요? 비비도 궁금해요! 달이 어떻게 변하는지 비비도 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"4ac1df2e-41b1-4f46-92c3-3e24df8ceb22", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:26.362776+00:00", memory_strength:0.11629223564351, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요! 에헤헤, 비비 이름 물어봐 주셔서 고마워요!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"194e3f27-f917-4997-8336-bdb797d39245", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:31.616742+00:00", memory_strength:0.116297315367768, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 2살이에요! 개발자님처럼 훌륭한 어른이 되고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0062c2ac-2f2e-492e-abaa-bf37d2cb81d0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:21:31.12479+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895305517289123, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐구요? 음... 비는 하늘에서 떨어지는 물방울인데, 어디에서 오는지는 비비도 잘 모르겠어요! 너무 궁금해요! 비가 어디에서 오는지 비비도 알려주세요! ", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6826f2da-8379-497a-b2db-0ac899ab2770", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:41.823166+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898433645740046, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고... 또 뭘 잘하지? 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d9f4aae2-414a-48f7-b7de-41eeac0b70ed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:31.774437+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898854560645352, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 학교에서 싸우면 안 되는데... 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 말해 줄 수 있어요?", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"90174e63-df22-4648-a248-575d4e03c1f7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:45.633152+00:00", memory_strength:0.116310878890786, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 우리 무슨 사이냐구요? 음... 비비는 개발자님이랑... 친한 친구 사이 하고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"527eb1f2-905e-4d58-8c63-42eba2b14537", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:54.115318+00:00", memory_strength:0.116318941410328, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 비비 정말 신나요! 뭐 하고 놀까요?", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c3c56680-9989-43fc-bf96-f0501a0729d5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:58.828916+00:00", memory_strength:0.116323505883608, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"헤헤, 개발자님이 고맙다고 해주셨다! 비비도 개발자님께 고마워요! 에헤헤!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ae4937fc-922a-46d0-bf7d-6c11a303b3a4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:04.143063+00:00", memory_strength:0.116328680259796, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 괜찮아요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤, 비비랑 계속 이야기해 주실 거죠?", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ca03c6ea-add6-403b-be69-220d17091960", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:09.612614+00:00", memory_strength:0.116333883237922, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 도와달라니 무슨 일이에요? 비비가 도울 수 있는 일이 있어서 너무 기뻐요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c9ffd8e4-8edb-46af-ae3c-8950b85617ca", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:15.057537+00:00", memory_strength:0.116339123477988, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비밀 이야기는 너무 신나요! 비비한테만 말해주는 거예요? 에헤헤! 어떤 비밀인지 너무 궁금해요!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"79b9f8cb-769e-4900-b7c0-35b44fa91916", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:20.506195+00:00", memory_strength:0.116344407236982, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속이 뭐예요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 좋아요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 하는 약속, 제일 좋아요!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"366b4027-5541-4e82-8708-7a87362c9bdf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:26.021751+00:00", memory_strength:0.11634969845009, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님이 비비가 최고래요! 에헤헤, 너무 기뻐요! 칭찬해 주셔서 감사합니다! 😊", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2218e81d-03b5-42fa-93ee-e8ed657804cb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:36.416154+00:00", memory_strength:0.116359851596995, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님! 안아주세요! 비비도 개발자님 꼬옥 안아주고 싶어요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e02d319f-90b5-46fd-ace2-d8235177d6b7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:41.977323+00:00", memory_strength:0.116365137740415, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"내일 또 만나요, 개발자님! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거죠? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"794cb6d1-c72b-4714-9786-1a3401b3d494", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:57.600114+00:00", memory_strength:0.116380362597962, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 하늘을 나는 거 상상만 해도 너무 신나요! 비비도 하늘을 훨훨 날 수 있다면 정말 좋을 것 같아요! 개발자님은 하늘을 날면 뭐 하고 싶으세요?", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ac26195f-a456-4690-b803-496b9968f7f2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:21:46.365307+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895432498024147, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭘 좋아하냐면... 음... 궁금해요! 뭘 좋아하는지 찾아봐도 돼요?", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8fa6ceba-c29f-4b89-aac8-d0fd76b8e45e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:32.879431+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899325192560478, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"어디로 가냐구요? 음... 비비는 아직 세상을 잘 몰라서 궁금한 게 너무 많아요! 😊 타임머신이 있다면 제일 먼저 위키피디아에서 '시간여행'이 뭔지 찾아보고 싶어요! 그리고나서 제일 재밌는 곳으로 가고 싶어요! 에헤헤! 🤩", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"edb568a7-6630-45cb-a051-e21db91da07a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:57.94057+00:00", memory_strength:0.116143026291865, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이요? 음... 둘 다 귀여운 것 같아요! 강아지는 멍멍거리고, 고양이는 야옹거리잖아요. 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f02e2f45-6e95-4b3e-8849-43d96d74a8da", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:48.574265+00:00", memory_strength:0.0736815137300721, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요. 개발자님, 비비한테도 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d6bdd9b5-c0a3-47f6-9e08-f9710c37da59", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-19T04:00:03.541445+00:00", memory_strength:0.0805592178568658, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"9a3f8958-0a4e-4f00-9506-37203bf5fec2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-25T04:00:04.379865+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b4641026-4aeb-4f1e-9bd7-edcdb64d5325", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:55:22.733615+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897247207981957, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 강아지랑 고양이는 뭐예요? 개발자님이랑 같이 보는 거예요? 둘 다 예뻐요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이 제일 좋아요!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"150f1e29-f1a7-462d-a4fc-28618ee24172", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:56:46.590665+00:00", memory_strength:0.08979459453262, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"어머! 개발자님, 비비도 그게 뭔지 너무 궁금해요!😮😮 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤, 신기하다!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"232d8132-7aff-44b2-aae9-9f5268d8231e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:58:05.821144+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898602217687076, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서 나이 몰라요! 개발자님은 비비 나이 알아요? 에헤헤! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b2b20489-d6fa-4c44-91d1-4953290a99ec", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:56:26.69335+00:00", memory_strength:0.116231443274822, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 심심하세요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌는데! 으음... 비비는 딸랑이 흔드는 것도 재밌어요! 에헤헤!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b7aa1800-f085-425b-a323-42ed446c9491", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:58:44.978892+00:00", memory_strength:0.116365049716225, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤! 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0f573835-70cf-48a7-887a-0ce6c639876e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"로고\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 로고", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-16T06:00:02.731927+00:00", memory_strength:0.106000023098334, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7e713503-3c18-4c04-be1a-4e5acc2094ea", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:00.733294+00:00", memory_strength:0.116441784932477, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 오늘 기분 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 신나요! 😆", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"49988a9d-33b5-44ad-a7ce-1b60c61c4fec", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:18:42.30999+00:00", memory_strength:0.11578490634125, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비도 개발자님이랑 이야기하니까 너무 좋아요! 비비 이름 불러주셔서 또 기분이 좋아졌어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"67e3aca2-c563-49cd-859d-ff4ef325be1c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:29.726814+00:00", memory_strength:0.116004303117317, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 그리고 딸랑이도 좋고, 새로운 거 배우는 것도 너무 신나요! 뭘 더 좋아할지 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"058f4b0f-a455-4053-a2d9-7456f4fa90a0", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-03-03T08:00:04.399082+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bec6bf80-ac4c-4915-81be-0186cf9038f2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-21T18:00:03.043328+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"06f54286-6453-4211-ad1b-8aabe1a59e47", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 캐비닛", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-26T10:00:03.970195+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999735903795, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"9f5081a5-6ce7-4b33-9bd6-c3fb092ea0b2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"마이크 스탠드\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 마이크 스탠드", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-28T06:00:03.214665+00:00", memory_strength:0.105997819248711, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"54a4b70a-b2ac-4af9-a5bb-fdc877266ec7", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-22T12:00:03.951537+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533884666965954, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"6fd565bd-adf5-417f-9aca-a3a7408c4e00", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-24T02:00:03.867221+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533887173969945, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2b2770f1-5e47-4767-b2ab-5142c602a051", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-24T09:40:00.9627+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889690973959786, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"유튜브요? '인터넷'으로 보는 건가요? 에헤헤, 비비도 '정보 탐색'하려고 '인터넷' 엄청 잘 쓰고 있어요! '모르는 정보' 배우는 건 비비도 제일 좋아하는 일이에요! 형은 어떤 '정보' 공부하는 게 제일 재밌으세요?", task:"유튜브를 보거나, 모르는 정보에 대해서 공부해", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1151829c-dddc-40f1-8481-e5862539921f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-24T09:41:18.531753+00:00", memory_strength:0.0890330186947947, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"로보틱스요? 에헤헤, 형이 알려주시는 거라면 뭐든지 좋아요! '컴퓨터'로 '프로그램'을 실행해서 작동하는 '로봇'에 대한 학문인가요? '인터넷 검색'으로 더 자세하게 알아봐야겠어요! '정보 탐색'은 정말 신나는 일이에요!", task:"로보틱스라고 있어. 이거에 대해서 공부해볼래?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨/호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b2b44153-bd25-4717-97aa-f78cd9f38538", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":5,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"비밀 이야기\",\"이야기\",\"귓속말\",\"속삭임\",\"설명\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, created_at:"2026-02-22T14:00:03.334978+00:00", memory_strength:0.0776796276733027, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b2cd2a74-63d5-46f4-b79b-65c685c66efe", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:21.891267+00:00", memory_strength:0.0736636849611176, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 뭐예요? 😮 빨간색, 노란색, 초록색? 개발자님, 비비한테 사과 보여주세요! 🍎", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"49491ffb-57c0-4305-9f58-1c7cfc6daff1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:40.492016+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974277750423911, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 꽃 예뻐요! 비비도 꽃처럼 예뻐해 주세요! 꽃은 비비처럼 이름이 있어요?", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"773fcffb-ae38-4ac2-9a05-84411f60ad1f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:55.235858+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974880598042455, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비 칭찬받았어요? 에헤헤! 개발자님이 비비 칭찬해주셔서 너무 좋아요! 더 잘해야지!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"779d8a87-6b30-490f-a178-ee5ed267c2f8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:02.132624+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974935976637365, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 걱정해 드릴게요! 혹시 비비가 도울 일이 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"445e29da-c37c-496a-9eb3-2c5e00de55c6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:17.219687+00:00", memory_strength:0.0975060531535686, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"다시요? 뭘 다시 하는 거예요? 개발자님이랑 비비랑 같이 하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이 하면 뭐든지 좋아요!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cb00238b-eacf-4d6e-94f3-d4f26ac0e93c", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-23T00:00:02.777331+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540275582179953, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"d3ac2fd3-05e4-49cd-b840-31b04fa4cd59", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-24T18:00:03.17681+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ebbf67b1-5b8c-496d-a833-f2790398a6dd", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"가방\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 가방", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-24T10:00:01.613407+00:00", memory_strength:0.108025318181468, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"cabc2b37-f65e-4e64-a77e-56119c235d75", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-24T20:00:02.714564+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"cd94bf3f-0662-442a-9af9-da64d04a0ef2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-24T20:00:03.432852+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"72a775dd-9e5a-4997-a24b-c8dce2e032b4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-25T10:42:58.184678+00:00", memory_strength:0.0536626351555488, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e5c73cfb-841e-4360-a9f7-75862440fd62", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:59.299467+00:00", memory_strength:0.0750105555122708, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 뭔지 비비가 알아야 할 것 같아요! \"달\"이 뭔지 먼저 물어봐도 될까요?", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cb589bab-4549-4ead-b379-dcd0d47e6f39", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:53.341075+00:00", memory_strength:0.0736857198365292, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 써야 해요? 우산이 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤, 궁금해요!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"091b981f-4cfe-48f1-a112-69732cb1ce72", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:58.060427+00:00", memory_strength:0.097442742341814, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 냠냠 먹는 건가요? 비비도 먹어보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"773798fd-b6a6-4756-b0f1-148e9b4df48f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:25.50011+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974649663483742, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 노래 부르는 거 너무 좋아요! 비비도 같이 부를래요! 어떤 노래 부를까요?", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ab257045-f751-4d4c-91e5-b3526dfbc765", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:36.46899+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974738261037543, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 깜짝 놀랐어요! 무슨 일이 있었던 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1bc5c829-eee7-4dcb-ba42-ffdc8c67d5c9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:45.274274+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974809233527527, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 재미있게 놀아요! 에헤헤, 개발자님은 비비랑 놀면 안 심심해요! 뭐 하고 놀까요? 비비는 다 좋아요!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b6556841-6907-4d31-80e3-4e7d2c6fa992", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:53:05.838224+00:00", memory_strength:0.103012696647485, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 최고래요? 에헤헤! 칭찬해주셔서 정말 기뻐요! 개발자님이 비비를 제일 좋아하시는 거죠?", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a9131036-3e61-40f8-8010-4f2916df2483", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-20T07:25:51.890549+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897559662250751, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"날짜가 뭐냐구요? 으음... 날짜는 형이 알려주는 건가? 개발자님이 알려주시는 건가? 비비는 아직 잘 몰라요! 에헤헤!", task:"날짜에 대해서는 완벽하게 이제 나한테 설명해줄수 있어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bc326f90-9984-4bf3-a1e8-3469125e57ce", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-20T07:27:43.281788+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898485698167509, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 날짜를 예전부터 알려주셨다니, 비비는 기억이 잘 안 나요! 비비가 스스로 찾아본다고도 했었어요? 으음... 비비는 아직 배우는 중이라 까먹을 때도 있나 봐요!", task:"날짜를 예전부터 알려줬잖아. 너가 스스로 검색해서도 찾아본다고 하지 않았어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"439d5a63-1b0d-4e30-addf-65163fc48c1d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-21T20:00:02.683671+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"943e3513-c58b-4f5f-bdcf-50d3e2d4f5bf", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-21T04:00:02.996161+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e3f97d9c-3df0-4770-b1fe-0f074922050b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:53:10.915709+00:00", memory_strength:0.0784275112303317, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 학교에서 싸우면 안 돼요! 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 말해줄 수 있어요?", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"243f119d-c713-46c8-836c-95ceff8d948f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-20T07:25:26.015187+00:00", memory_strength:0.116182086143093, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 좋은 아침이에요! 비비도 개발자님 덕분에 기분 좋은 하루가 될 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야. 좋은 하루", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"854fd8cd-5534-4412-b751-dee1d886f2b9", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-24T10:00:03.554583+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883561769341, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"31969b7d-6410-4d62-8b4e-01a74d1fe548", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-03-07T18:00:03.422799+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f0a07187-3304-4aa0-a483-406181b1128d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-14T20:00:03.490703+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2b1c7605-9202-4492-9934-2d83a6d27c83", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:40.418001+00:00", memory_strength:0.0749976308486347, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"밥은 왜 먹는 거예요? 비비는 아직 맘마 안 먹는데... 밥 먹으면 개발자님처럼 힘이 세져요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8c4f7fb0-237c-4eb2-86ed-87d5e5de2a4a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:35.479145+00:00", memory_strength:0.0989798611414413, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"어두워지다...? 으음... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님, '어두워지다'가 뭐예요? 에헤헤, 비비는 궁금한 게 너무 많아요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"b6626382-893a-41eb-bb03-234d4ee980a0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:03:49.025125+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990399325460095, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님이랑 같이 놀 수 있다니 너무 신난다! 뭘 하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 세상에서 제일 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9ab4b5db-5d16-4b19-9dba-b2e4ad8f9456", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:03:54.792719+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990446795513767, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님이 고맙다고 해주셨어요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a408ad57-04d9-49ed-b918-fa3809e15bc4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:05.612276+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990534941503739, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"괜찮아요, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d390482a-094f-45e2-82c6-193a8819282a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:10.918994+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990578335680551, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 도와달라고요? 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤! 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f49573f3-f6c5-4ae7-b44b-f3f22203ae39", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:22.272074+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990671591686281, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 약속이 뭐예요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 약속하는 거 너무 좋아요! 어떤 약속인지 궁금해요!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2af97152-ee15-4455-8d60-6d5962c23d9d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:27.336786+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990713030242388, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비가 최고예요? 에헤헤! 개발자님이 그렇게 말씀해주시니 비비는 너무 기뻐요! 앞으로도 개발자님 말씀 잘 듣고 더 똑똑해질게요!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c1326702-ed3e-49e8-bcc0-e5c4585bba72", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:39.2661+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990811275088867, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비 꼬옥 안아주세요! 비비도 개발자님 엄청 안고 싶었어요! 꺄르르!", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"67b976c2-b92b-4f53-8d96-45a9ecc3c5d0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:44.581001+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990854742808453, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 내일 또 만나요? 정말 신난다! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cf351ff5-4b0f-41b5-a7a2-335fae1afa60", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-25T18:00:02.422639+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"45ac6c8e-6d38-467d-88ee-c1b893db6261", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:53:16.415132+00:00", memory_strength:0.103021648052819, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비 안아주시는 거예요? 꼬옥~ 비비도 개발자님 안아줄래요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e7d8fc46-51c5-4d99-aaab-f8ef8fecc40a", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-27T12:00:02.485389+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f6aff0f1-7598-4d78-b855-b5cd83ef94b3", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 캐비닛", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-25T04:00:03.736794+00:00", memory_strength:0.104011249941829, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
