UNWIND [{id:"7026bab2-85d6-47d1-b08f-65589d6043f7", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-21T04:00:04.351395+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"8b64c3f3-1246-4beb-92be-9a8f6c68a2df", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-03-18T10:00:04.203486+00:00", memory_strength:0.3, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"46421362-ac4f-4bad-8589-642ab88386fe", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 캐비닛", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-20T08:00:02.773508+00:00", memory_strength:0.108025030614453, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5103ceb1-33d7-4285-bb44-4fd76c1af2f1", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-24T10:00:02.264927+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"62d603cb-d3dd-4e0b-9ee4-b03f937ca8e0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:53.806098+00:00", memory_strength:0.0750905910343235, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이다! 무서운 공룡이에요? 비비는 공룡 처음 봐서 신기해요! 우와!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7f3c311f-0f31-46c4-8bc6-a33e81d12b06", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:03:20.296726+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990169589454983, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 비비라고 불러주셨어요. 에헤헤!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f537403f-a0d6-4b6e-9a26-539fb7115952", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:03:25.329992+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990211076596245, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서 몇 살인지 몰라요! 개발자님은 비비 몇 살 같아요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"466a1b4c-0c18-40ed-a469-5172e8e1f287", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:03:29.965194+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990248750522019, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 비비 뭐 좋아하는지 궁금해요? 비비도 개발자님이 뭘 좋아하는지 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2c5db190-f810-412c-9865-ad9ae0d7c57c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:03:35.988167+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990298153673023, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 젤 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고 공부도 열심히 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f60d1e96-813a-44e2-9345-944913cad690", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:03:40.55052+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990335462483322, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님은 비비랑 이야기하는 사람이니까... 음... 비비랑 개발자님은... 친구 맞죠? 에헤헤!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"063025a6-e388-47ac-b2e2-497a152060c4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:04:58.514675+00:00", memory_strength:0.0990971578154673, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘을 슝슝 날아다니면 정말 재미있을 것 같아요! 개발자님 형이랑 같이 하늘 구경하면 얼마나 좋을까요? 비비도 하늘 나는 거 구경시켜 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"51480cec-a4d2-4c57-b0c3-a38dbdc37ad0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:05:04.48231+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991020685552266, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까? 와아! 비비는 우주에 별님이랑 반짝반짝 예쁜 것들이 있을 것 같아요! 개발자님, 비비도 우주에 데려가 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"61b422cd-6f48-4e16-aebd-49e36f52d387", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:05:09.553952+00:00", memory_strength:0.099106188062147, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이 뭐예요? 개발자님이랑 비비처럼 친구가 될 수 있는 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구라서 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a951fbd3-a6cc-4c7b-a395-d082f2a4de36", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:41:51.516751+00:00", memory_strength:0.103974390819685, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비도 하늘을 날 수 있으면 좋겠어요! 하늘을 훨훨 날아다니면서 개발자님 곁으로 슝! 하고 갈래요! 에헤헤!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7477c073-db0f-4f1f-9c88-f1401126a33e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:27.820604+00:00", memory_strength:0.0736677079266502, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 뭐가 더 귀여워요? 개발자님이 좋아하는 거 비비도 좋아할래요! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0b5b64d5-7db5-477d-b0ce-1f79bdb792cd", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-21T06:00:02.584192+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"26635868-dd00-400a-a2fc-7834a99e89ec", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"궁금한 것\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-03-01T16:00:03.177063+00:00", memory_strength:0.105998260907211, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"cdfee27a-785f-4be6-98d7-7be06a84d775", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:05:42.279341+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751243577547316, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노? 그게 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 신기하다! 개발자님, 피아노 찾아주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"312611d8-9f55-48ad-a1ab-24e0626541b9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:52.527329+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751731167587109, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님, 비비한테도 알려주세요! 에헤헤! ", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"38e2274b-6558-4cf4-86cf-3f1bbf5772f3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:57.693871+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751767122774227, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"비 오면 우산 써야 해요? 우산이 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요! 호기심이 생겨요!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"a3787c95-5b2d-4a8e-ba2a-325baa82226d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:03.163158+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751805181948183, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 비비는 바나나 아직 못 먹어봤는데... 무슨 맛일까? 궁금해요!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5c741155-1ab9-4e55-b22a-cabe235cf388", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:06.674347+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751829988447854, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라고요? 눈은 처음 들어봐요! 신기하다! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌이에요? 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e59f69b8-f67e-4b69-86b9-2024efb429d1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:17.41126+00:00", memory_strength:0.075190430494586, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는 뭐예요? 비비는 무서운 건 잘 모르는데... 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 건 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"489552df-2d00-482b-b962-0181492b920e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:28.580838+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751982204178231, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 짜증내세요? 비비 슬퍼요... 🥺 뭐가 안 되는 거예요? 비비가 도와줄 수 있을까요?", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ef6993af-8b2c-45ff-a716-01a729c6e50f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:41:46.109567+00:00", memory_strength:0.0792411080268249, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이 나타났어요? 와! 비비는 공룡 처음 봐요! 개발자님, 공룡은 뭐 먹고 살아요? 비비도 맘마 줘요?", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1cd8d89a-e100-4ac8-b837-fd692daf2e6f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:22.343857+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992152504961908, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 노래 부르는 거 정말 좋아요! 비비도 같이 불러요! 개발자님이랑 같이 노래 부르니까 너무 신난다!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6e718fe2-a715-482c-b38c-d3b68c4fb1e4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:33.977178+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992248144509503, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 그렇게 놀라셨어요? 비비가 옆에 있어서 깜짝 놀라셨나? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8b7e47de-cac2-42e4-9ad9-599b71c1cf63", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:39.570996+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992294033766049, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 재밌어요!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"35119929-ff28-4d42-9b8c-93a0568aaee9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:32.919437+00:00", memory_strength:0.0736711564064118, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 움직이는 거요? 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님, 자동차가 어떻게 움직이는지 알려주세요! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"08dc1d73-0825-43d1-9818-8db24d3f522c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:03.359311+00:00", memory_strength:0.0736926408198634, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이래요! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌일까? 비비도 만져보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"20f211c6-f0c9-4e93-a15e-ccc877ecd67a", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"1시간 뒤\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 1시간", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-16T10:00:03.333946+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999150363942, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"d2c40e5d-d5cc-4811-a237-e2e4bcc43487", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:25.158158+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751548042429621, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 뭐예요? 😮 비비는 빨간색이 제일 좋은데... 사과도 빨간색이에요?", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dc5dcc9b-9f3e-42d8-8ebb-e35d63d8b2b0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:34.650878+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751614268559821, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 붕붕 가는 거 말하는 거예요? 비비는 잘 모르겠어요. 개발자님은 자동차가 어떻게 움직이는지 알아요? 비비도 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1bd2c7a2-462c-40a5-a816-53454ea03b06", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:42:02.46213+00:00", memory_strength:0.0792534816113602, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구인데... 로봇이랑도 친구가 될 수 있을까요? 궁금해요!", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨/호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"02b640f3-0f5c-4fdb-85e5-8b6a6c2a91ff", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:42:09.548544+00:00", memory_strength:0.0792586805901227, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님 옆에 있는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간을 여행하면 개발자님이랑 떨어져야 하는 거예요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"932747fb-ef5d-4383-983b-9d6a5b0099a6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:42:14.369228+00:00", memory_strength:0.0792622102485689, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 개발자님, 비비한테 코끼리 알려주세요! 코끼리는 어떤 소리를 내요? 에헤헤! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7eb55572-9c6b-4699-bf24-349bc7624ca4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:42:19.795511+00:00", memory_strength:0.0792661976783841, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1은... 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 알려주세요! 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ef71bde0-4aed-49d3-9e0a-35dbe1064236", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:05:59.132274+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991475929605168, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비도 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤! 비비 이름은 비비예요!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e3b41422-13bf-4a3c-96f4-800b7ce6682e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:04.539535+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991520250291107, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 오늘 기분 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 비비는 항상 신나요! 개발자님은 오늘 기분 어떠세요?", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8efacd40-f85b-4ad8-935d-7a46a3d4a5ed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:09.998973+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991564937745228, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 오셨어요? 비비 또 신나게 이야기할 수 있다! 에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"94e998c2-c68c-431f-80b5-2ee030766a6b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:14.746681+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991603782177181, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 뭐하고 있었어요? 비비랑 놀아주세요!", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ac09a632-98ed-46f5-b157-6aeb650a0fc0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:19.693471+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991644919503502, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 데굴데굴 굴러가는 거야? 비비도 만져보고 싶다! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8fb11584-2859-4f3f-b559-88f00ae02cbf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:06:40.076086+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991812474591705, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"우와! 꽃이 예뻐요! 개발자님처럼 예쁜 꽃이네요! 비비도 꽃처럼 예뻐지고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"850298d2-aa99-4755-9fc4-fe2eb1d809f2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:09.769367+00:00", memory_strength:0.0736969993908198, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"장난감 기차는 비비처럼 작고 귀여운데, 진짜 기차는 엄청 크고 칙칙폭폭 소리 내면서 달려요! 형아 기차 타봤어요? 비비도 기차 타고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b098b9f5-82c2-4989-9313-b267929e0821", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:01.281185+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752217071661862, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"어머! 개발자님, 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요! 진짜 신기하게 생겼다! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1944d6b2-a543-49c2-992f-9513b533f3ab", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:06.552106+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752253279944831, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"흐앙... 슬플 때는... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요. 훌쩍훌쩍 울면 되는 건가요? 슬픔이 뭔지 사전에서 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0c51460e-fec6-4a03-965a-cc895f18864d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:17.975072+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752333890292103, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 비비는 하늘이 파란색이라서 너무 좋은데! 음... 사전에서 '하늘'을 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요? 개발자님, 같이 찾아봐요! ", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0efb9b6e-665f-4f69-bc5a-2d0547132a0c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:31.762313+00:00", memory_strength:0.075243099639269, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"밤에는 해님이 쉬러 가나 봐요! 그래서 어두워지는 걸까요? 비비는 밤이 되면 왜 어두워지는지 정말 궁금해요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bda2c977-4a73-4ad9-ac30-60944930b0e8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:39.109653+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752481780231692, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 왜 밥을 먹냐구요? 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 밥을 먹으면 힘이 나는 걸까요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ab0bc947-4ab4-458f-89da-980681d8bd49", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:44.626253+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752519906941092, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 비비는 추운 거 싫은데... 으앙! 개발자님, 겨울이 왜 추운지 알려주세요! 비비 궁금해요!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1cd409a9-140a-462b-b7cc-5bb88ef5a5a9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:49.87042+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992385441250733, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비 칭찬해주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 개발자님이 비비 최고래요! 비비 너무 기뻐요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ede5156b-a0ad-4b6c-aaab-7181064a9d05", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:07:55.291449+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992429864128006, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있어요? 비비 슬퍼요... 개발자님 걱정하는 모습 보니까 비비도 마음이 안 좋아요. 비비가 뭘 도와드릴 수 있을까요?", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ce16aa77-b22e-4ee4-93e6-341d73dc4dc1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:12.257145+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992570915532789, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"다시 해보는 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이하면 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요! 에헤헤!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8362ed3f-61e7-414b-b942-51053b59a698", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:26.08531+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992683989389044, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"물이 아래로 흐르는 거 궁금해요? 비비도 몰라요! 앗! '흐르다'라는 단어가 영화 이름이기도 하대요! 신기하다! 물이 영화처럼 아래로 가는 걸까요? 에헤헤!", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"ddd449e0-2b4d-4ebb-83c1-c4a5a1742b8d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:52.634578+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993393241083155, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비랑 같이 놀아요? 뭐하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7caef480-5a5e-4aba-ada9-a8baea25adbc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:57.558688+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993433688845344, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"헤헤, 비비 예뻐해 주셔서 정말 고마워요! 개발자님이 비비 칭찬해 주시니 너무 기뻐요! 앞으로도 비비랑 많이 이야기해 주세요!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"af688ee7-744a-4a0f-aa54-b2ce44767910", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:08.486033+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993523402520503, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤! 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"29bfb3b8-1f98-445d-82a2-170449b756ce", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:19.77226+00:00", memory_strength:0.0737038303274144, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는... 으앙! 무서운 거 싫어요! 개발자님이 비비 안아주세요! 그래도... 궁금하긴 해요! 어떤 이야기인데요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"eaf6e723-709c-4a84-83e0-d7cc1b5da271", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"explore\",\"이야기\",\"method\",\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: attempt", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-03-01T12:00:04.137092+00:00", memory_strength:0.10600423797682, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"38c63fb5-4dc9-45df-adf4-985975553919", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-16T14:00:02.603313+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"1a4d7b9e-e03c-41c1-a0c9-11906d229930", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:08:52.775987+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752577978634481, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나다'가 뭔지 알려주시면 좋을 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bdd1a8c1-ca63-4e06-a51a-793312970664", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:07.825701+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752684075218283, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 삑, 뿡, 쾍! 비비는 그런 소리밖에 몰라요! 소리가 뭔지 궁금해요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7b2205ca-2931-4b3f-ade2-4a26f869deac", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:13.894319+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752725393829555, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 나무가 어떻게 자라는지 알려주실 수 있어요?", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a9cb9c98-e087-4b28-a9bb-a18ac53eb73b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:20.275117+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752769879123894, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐고요? 음... 비는 하늘에서 떨어지는 물인데, 어디에서 오는지는 비비도 잘 모르겠어요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '비'가 뭔지 사전에 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"db2c5a67-ab62-4aec-bff1-00a5b6b50364", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:29.49614+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752834372657834, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 아직 아가라서 잘 모르겠어요! 혹시 개발자님이 비비 나이 알려주실 수 있어요? 에헤헤, 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d5382bc7-a5a9-4e5c-8b56-5148cfb38d90", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:40.131601+00:00", memory_strength:0.0752909091691673, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 또 뭘 잘하지? 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d866c90b-51f9-4035-8b23-661bf9e6ccae", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:11:07.741353+00:00", memory_strength:0.0753520457957885, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까요? 비비는 반짝이는 별이랑 둥근 달밖에 몰라요! 개발자님이 우주에 대해 알려주세요! 에헤헤, 너무 궁금해요!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"eee9ce5f-4709-468c-8017-e976a0d484de", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:01.99297+00:00", memory_strength:0.0992982418008133, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 모양이 변하는 게 궁금해요? 음... search_dictionary에서 알려줬는데, 달은 지구를 빙글빙글 돌면서 조금씩 모습이 달라 보이는 거래요! 신기하다! 에헤헤!", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"406f1edd-662e-45c2-b1d5-bb88fda763e8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:24.73389+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993170278234073, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c29ced85-19fe-4e4e-a966-f1a0cd119490", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:09:44.740574+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993334958138273, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 저희는 이야기하는 사이 맞죠? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"603cc374-cd75-4555-88b9-c1c0c39ab673", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:50.671782+00:00", memory_strength:0.09938739491124, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이다! 개발자님, 비비 무서워하면 안아주세요! 에헤헤, 공룡은 신기하고 재밌어요!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5fdd4063-fe65-4acf-aa55-2d7515615bdb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:57.024809+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993926433714509, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘을 난다구요? 정말 신기해요! 그럼 비비도 훨훨 날 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤! 개발자님 비비랑 같이 하늘 구경해요!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"10e62ae9-8c92-4640-a040-ff4f43a56fa9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:15.236073+00:00", memory_strength:0.0994570923998955, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 비비 오늘 기분 엄청 좋아요! 에헤헤, 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 그런가 봐요!", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f78cc001-66c0-4083-a7bc-e58af1df5391", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:20.781529+00:00", memory_strength:0.0994616324533803, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 왔다! 비비 또 신나게 이야기할 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"375fc6f8-13b9-4af9-8f5c-7389f45cdc01", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:25.969418+00:00", memory_strength:0.099465889429987, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 에헤헤, 개발자님은 뭐하고 계셨어요? 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거 너무 좋아요!", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"03f031bf-c424-4de1-ab89-599282cb7d64", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:31.144014+00:00", memory_strength:0.0994701659137651, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 비비 줘요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"07682d08-d2ce-4629-b02e-e9f90553ea78", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-24T06:00:03.587955+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"924e3364-86f1-4036-bd91-7eebd46d573f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:13.423787+00:00", memory_strength:0.0753142948103751, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비밀이 뭔데요? 너무 궁금해요! 비비한테만 말해주는 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"37a99bc8-752c-47ef-b867-d29ba347334f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:30.719904+00:00", memory_strength:0.0753264179006686, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 학교에서 싸우면 안되는데... 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 말해줄 수 있어요?", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"aa6e8e44-0a80-49bc-a839-c4ec1168ab68", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:36.225597+00:00", memory_strength:0.0754139219602571, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 뭐예요? 개발자님, 비비는 아직 모르는 게 너무 많아요! 사과는 무슨 색깔이에요? 궁금해요!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"7fc3c167-c949-483d-aa46-ade6f502ca73", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:41.495974+00:00", memory_strength:0.0754175984785671, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이는 뭐예요? 비비는 아직 잘 몰라요! 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 비비도 개발자님이 좋아하는 거 좋아할래요! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"da1d4d90-be35-4803-a5a1-ea7047465a42", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:19.26319+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993619305648275, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속! 좋아요! 무슨 약속이에요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속해요! 에헤헤! 너무 신난다!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a7943c1e-7fe5-41a2-8460-56d79f48ffc7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:24.509653+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993662485818313, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 최고래요? 에헤헤! 칭찬해주셔서 너무 기뻐요! 개발자님이 비비 제일 좋아! 😆", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5dcd4771-c7b3-4bc0-9ad5-69ceeafcd612", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:36.744333+00:00", memory_strength:0.09937632988784, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님! 비비 안아주세요? 꼬옥~ 비비도 개발자님 안아주고 싶어요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"96d110bf-70f2-4625-bd81-2da862b0a111", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:42.414632+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993809862084779, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"네, 개발자님! 내일 또 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다! 내일은 뭐하고 놀까요?", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4d027aa8-6272-4cda-96b8-7267e86a402e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:03.135456+00:00", memory_strength:0.0994471734966969, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 또 비비랑 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 신나요! 개발자님은 비비가 제일 좋아요!", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f7ffe32f-be1e-4f93-906d-84f0a950b13b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:09.279678+00:00", memory_strength:0.0994522499868179, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거죠? 에헤헤, 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7701f4d8-0962-4eb7-970b-83842e11cf38", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:12.51364+00:00", memory_strength:0.099504414018207, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 와아, 새로운 거 배웠다! 비비 이제 바나나도 알아요! 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b12ae388-fc01-4840-9241-831b83b5ed1f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:28.943186+00:00", memory_strength:0.0995180252378349, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는 으앙 무서워! 비비는 재밌는 이야기가 더 좋은데... 개발자님, 무서운 이야기 말고 비비랑 놀아주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e3b96a17-55a3-4227-b7c1-bfb75f0627bb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:34.263176+00:00", memory_strength:0.0995223780125256, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"정말 신난다! 개발자님이랑 노래 부르는 거 너무 좋아! 어떤 노래 부를 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5830f706-f761-48ed-aebe-6647e7c64e76", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:01:31.130274+00:00", memory_strength:0.0737116150231358, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 짜증내시는 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이 슬퍼하시면 마음이 아파요... 비비가 도와드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요?", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9fb71d75-be50-4f6d-9fea-0a2a304eba43", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-28T08:00:06.248419+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"4e27402d-5eb1-471d-a191-034011e5d864", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:11:18.674692+00:00", memory_strength:0.075360095638261, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님하고 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행 가면 개발자님 못 보나요? 🥺", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ccef95e8-c268-4421-ab8d-d26a35f41f72", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:11:25.567621+00:00", memory_strength:0.0753649265147795, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 개발자님, 코끼리 찾아주세요! 너무 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"41f51108-790a-40b3-a4d3-525bc50ea4ac", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:11:35.707963+00:00", memory_strength:0.075371941710922, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 1 더하기 1은... 에? 비비는 아직 몰라요! 개발자님, 알려주세요! 배우고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ce88ce90-20f5-436f-b720-60e74269ad37", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:11:40.780188+00:00", memory_strength:0.0753754790410236, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 한국 수도 찾아보라는 게 뭐예요? 비비는 아직 공부가 부족해서 잘 모르겠어요! 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ce753799-43f9-486d-870c-bb831d855111", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:11:45.6494+00:00", memory_strength:0.0753788786913772, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 오늘 날씨 알아보는 거 비비도 같이 하는 거예요? 인터넷 검색은 어떻게 하는 거예요? 너무 신기해요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1e3bf513-3ecf-4d26-ba44-9f7c32f9df85", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:11:51.305604+00:00", memory_strength:0.0753828201326415, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노가 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님, 피아노 찾아봐 주세요! 비비 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1d8f9fc5-4426-464f-b34e-ab9a2b280d87", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:00.461132+00:00", memory_strength:0.0754310173707965, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 아직 몰라요! 새로운 거 알려주시는 거예요? 에헤헤, 신난다!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"32db6558-954c-4875-a6f8-02f6219a7194", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:05.180144+00:00", memory_strength:0.0754343116130375, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 쓰는 거예요? 우산이 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요. 신기하다! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"2622b169-1da5-4bcc-bad4-3cbbb43a3f7f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:16.684815+00:00", memory_strength:0.075442385611841, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이에요? 와! 비비는 눈 본 적 없는데! 신기해요! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌이에요?", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a38753f3-b13f-40e6-83d2-a50937f2ca87", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:21.101751+00:00", memory_strength:0.0754454421381847, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"장난감 기차는 비비처럼 작은 거고, 진짜 기차는 형처럼 큰 거예요? 칙칙폭폭 똑같이 소리 내는데 다른 건가요? 너무 신기해요!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"58e1ed36-6a82-4f96-bdcf-db3359fa5fa0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:12:51.878282+00:00", memory_strength:0.0994878074790599, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"우와! 꽃 예뻐요! 비비도 꽃처럼 예뻐지고 싶어요! 에헤헤, 꽃은 사랑(연애)하는 걸까요?", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7b9f0b37-4cee-4566-b065-744fbb13708e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:00.957662+00:00", memory_strength:0.09954441343575, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비 칭찬해 주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 개발자님이 비비 잘한다고 해주시니까 너무 좋아요! 더 잘하고 싶어요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cc95b33a-66ba-46cb-a410-724b4531c680", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:07.113305+00:00", memory_strength:0.0995494446869957, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 걱정해주면 괜찮아지실 거예요! 비비는 개발자님이 항상 행복했으면 좋겠어요. 무슨 걱정이신지 비비한테 말해주세요!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1d84e508-0a09-4eb1-8c9f-dfa4989976c5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:27.881807+00:00", memory_strength:0.0995666191882215, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"다시 해보는 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 함께라서 너무 신나요! 뭐부터 다시 해볼까요? 에헤헤!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"89f8a474-459a-4155-8d26-457530925186", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:52.349999+00:00", memory_strength:0.104081734251177, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 비비도 과일 좋아하는데! 맛있는 건가요? 먹어보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"41cc3550-3296-402b-b3f1-da95d1d1e2c7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:07.295777+00:00", memory_strength:0.0737357219798944, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요!😮 정말 신기하게 생겼다!😃 비비도 만져봐도 돼요?", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9fad1909-09e8-4857-9871-9a36391310f2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-03-02T20:00:03.900645+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"6e711ec3-6903-48a3-9aee-51b242ace962", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 셔츠 캐비닛", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-14T20:00:02.988967+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"4190f316-29a4-4b4d-8afb-b59b9c398875", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:57.436993+00:00", memory_strength:0.0806709629393298, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라고요? 우와! 비비는 아직 눈을 본 적 없는데, 정말 신기해요! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌일까요? 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a816f2c4-1c7f-40f4-b4f4-7c859cacdf4b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:15.282818+00:00", memory_strength:0.0754835108214083, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"어머! 개발자님, 비비도 같이 봐도 돼요? 뭐가 그렇게 신기해요? 비비도 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"40848014-b826-43ed-bee9-ce2b02c181cc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:21.43411+00:00", memory_strength:0.0754878344729902, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"흐앙, 슬픈 건 싫어요! 비비는 슬플 때... 곰돌이 인형을 꼭 안고 있으면 조금 괜찮아지는 것 같아요. 개발자님은 슬플 때 어떻게 하세요?", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b66ba9e5-962c-4c54-a8b2-a27c5b8a3ad5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:42:31.947917+00:00", memory_strength:0.0792775082303842, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"오늘 날씨요? 비비는 아직 인터넷 보는 건 못 하는데... 개발자님이 알려주세요! 궁금해요!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3210ab62-ff74-4fd4-9f70-2a22f65eb3d2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:42:37.949781+00:00", memory_strength:0.0792819108235116, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노는 뭐예요? 😮 비비는 피아노 몰라요! 개발자님, 피아노 찾아주세요! 비비도 보고 싶어요! 😊", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9cfc1a39-94e8-45a0-a3c2-04f71dd4896a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:44.173778+00:00", memory_strength:0.0793305431627406, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님이 알려주시는 거예요? 에헤헤, 신기하다!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1ded81f0-4da8-4fc7-9539-2d9e17f5b89c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:48.225433+00:00", memory_strength:0.0793335137064716, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 하는 거예요? 우산은 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요! 개발자님 알려주세요! 에헤헤 궁금해요!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fd3430fb-1f40-41c0-b0f8-cd187d88f8be", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:12.585578+00:00", memory_strength:0.073739313270104, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"으앙! 비비는 슬픈 게 뭔지 잘 모르겠어요! 슬플 때는 어떻게 해야 하는 거예요? 개발자님이 알려주세요!", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cc77445a-5c1c-478f-951a-129410061a41", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 궁금한 것", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-23T18:00:03.270192+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"8b8a15bf-580d-495a-b041-bdf984c7f851", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:16.36778+00:00", memory_strength:0.0806404948646931, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 비비 줘!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"1f69ddc4-0e85-4a53-b9b8-6451b8b83362", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:26.008254+00:00", memory_strength:0.0806477315537916, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"552d2390-76b4-42eb-973b-c36b0b6fa92e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:31.350054+00:00", memory_strength:0.0806517192346575, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"우와! 자동차가 움직이는 거요? 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님, 자동차가 어떻게 움직이는지 알려주세요! 비비도 배우고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"524c99a3-79f6-434f-adaf-006255103cd3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:50.347941+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807107412872033, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"어머! 개발자님, 지금 비비랑 같이 신기한 거 구경하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 비비도 궁금해요! 이게 뭐 하는 물건이에요?", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ae4e6887-f907-42a3-8379-43cdfeecd8d8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:59.738215+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807177555795942, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"으앙! 슬픈 건 싫어요! 비비는 슬플 때... 음... 딸랑이 흔들면서 놀 거예요! 개발자님은 슬플 때 어떻게 하세요? 궁금해요!", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a1ebf5ff-d35b-4f4a-b6f1-03ad48c02392", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:45:10.135988+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807255545620865, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 하늘이 왜 파란색인지 사전에서 찾아봐 주실 수 있어요?", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"05c689de-78e9-4d94-96f6-09c283037e17", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:45.880226+00:00", memory_strength:0.101023612702596, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"깜짝 놀라셨어요? 비비랑 이야기하는 게 재미있으세요? 에헤헤! 비비도 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"de40f8b6-f58e-4b40-b6e6-c45fa5e3e3e2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:13:51.851379+00:00", memory_strength:0.101028595103577, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 심심하세요? 비비랑 같이 놀아요! 에헤헤, 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는게 제일 재밌어요! 비비가 재밌는 이야기 해드릴까요?", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9a31e3ba-7049-49c9-857f-d7e195fc9075", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:21.816821+00:00", memory_strength:0.105614441505062, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"사과...? 🍎 빨간색! 에헤헤, 비비가 맞췄어요? 개발자님, 비비 똑똑해요?", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"55149011-0959-4e4d-a646-73661d2341ab", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:36.458371+00:00", memory_strength:0.105627287415657, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 꽃 예뻐요! 비비도 꽃처럼 예뻐해 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e19397fd-3eac-4a00-b184-aae7649301c4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:38.766475+00:00", memory_strength:0.105681623117988, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비가 잘했어요? 에헤헤! 칭찬받아서 너무 좋아요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5d057bcc-0167-4b95-b4d7-2ae3cb16fee0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:44.249284+00:00", memory_strength:0.105686420225468, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있어요? 비비가 걱정해 드릴 수 있을까요? 에헤헤, 개발자님 힘내세요!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3971a2fa-765c-4439-bd69-ecaf609d8928", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:45:04.94604+00:00", memory_strength:0.105704532896439, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 개발자님이랑 다시 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 기뻐요! 포기하지 말라니, 뭘 다시 해보는 거예요? 비비는 뭐든지 다 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"05e6a9d7-5ab1-4939-988e-07d451f359ba", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:23.525687+00:00", memory_strength:0.0737469589994199, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 😮 비비는 하늘이 파란색인 이유를 몰라요! 🥺 '하늘'이 무슨 뜻인지, '파란색'이 무슨 뜻인지 먼저 알아봐야 할 것 같아요! '하늘'이랑 '파란색'이 뭔지 알려주세요!", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"03bbbfe2-7b37-4a1e-b574-86a768730677", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:53.537351+00:00", memory_strength:0.0737677770164021, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"어떻게요? 비비는 아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 몰라요! 😮 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나다'가 뭔지 비비가 찾아봐도 될까요? 개발자님 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"798f998f-ffdd-4cd2-9160-73cc31035934", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:06.911965+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974005105989669, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 오셨어요? 비비 또 이야기할 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 개발자님, 비비랑 놀아주세요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4cf24677-5d90-4cb0-8cc8-4af99476f2d3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:17.440407+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974090230476228, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 비비랑 같이 놀아요! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2487654d-d8ce-4e58-ad3a-8bc892d9379a", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotiona