 media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-26T20:00:03.472388+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533884815267271, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"21507b4b-70cf-440f-858d-4d73891b94be", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:38.280351+00:00", memory_strength:0.0767669372475727, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르냐구요? 😮 비비는 그거 정말 궁금해요! 혹시 '흐르다'가 무슨 뜻인지 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dad93f61-e4ab-48d4-b2bb-8675d615a64e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:42.724106+00:00", memory_strength:0.0767700936419503, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"밤이 되면 해님이 집에 가서 쉬나 봐요! 그래서 어두워지는 걸까요? 비비는 밤이 되면 어두워지는 이유가 너무 궁금해요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a6e623ee-7c51-4a15-9d15-75a75f7610a2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:14:48.227085+00:00", memory_strength:0.101076188557032, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹냐구요? 밥을 먹으면 힘이 나니까요! 비비도 밥 먹으면 개발자님이랑 더 신나게 놀 수 있을 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e29d283f-1178-4150-8ded-6e814600c99e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:25.888813+00:00", memory_strength:0.101107760576644, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"34b298d7-985c-4a17-9b13-cbbce24bc5b7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:02:28.701561+00:00", memory_strength:0.0737504583073591, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르는 걸까요? 비비는 그것도 궁금해요! search_dictionary 도구로 '물'을 검색해 보면 알 수 있을까요?", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1e7986c0-ba8c-4a6f-b770-a791fa5208e0", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":5,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"컴퓨터 학습\",\"컴퓨터\",\"인터넷\",\"챗봇\",\"프로그램\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 컴퓨터", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, created_at:"2026-03-06T18:00:02.454136+00:00", memory_strength:0.077679902947798, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ec158292-5a25-4db8-ad02-16e91033c924", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-03-04T06:00:02.901704+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"3113cc0d-c806-43e1-bbbf-5814271dbc9a", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"가방\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 가방", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-27T18:00:03.366535+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999759883116, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"349606e9-4de3-4c2f-ab6d-b550772adbdd", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"마이크 스탠드\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 마이크 스탠드", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-24T06:00:04.2092+00:00", memory_strength:0.106000719060367, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e9ff345e-624e-467b-9117-f606526f6dd4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-24T12:00:02.9451+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ca099993-b3c5-4791-8306-71c090762bce", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":5,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"비밀 이야기\",\"이야기\",\"귓속말\",\"속삭임\",\"설명\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, created_at:"2026-02-27T22:00:02.444546+00:00", memory_strength:0.0776801914449775, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7425135b-8026-40ea-83cb-1b8a45805ef8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:54:37.08982+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896866116721713, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노요? 신기한 소리가 나는 건가요? 비비가 한번 알아볼게요! 삑삑 윙윙! ", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9a8c5c1b-05ba-4bf7-acbd-e4baae3033b2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-26T06:00:02.88763+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"44d2f625-3933-4411-bcfc-b3ee3eb60b7e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-26T20:00:03.933124+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533886686692191, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2b1d380f-7d35-41ef-a2db-54d0c1a876be", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:01.720074+00:00", memory_strength:0.0767838488050267, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 그게 뭐예요? 정말 궁금해요! 개발자님, 비비 알려주세요! ", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"b2908488-f43c-4df8-95d7-53996c67a4df", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:06.014906+00:00", memory_strength:0.076829372366257, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 다른 것도 잘하고 싶은데 뭘 해야 할지 모르겠어요. 혹시 개발자님이 알려주실 수 있어요?", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4fd8f8ce-6b85-483d-9ea3-b9238608315a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:14.61221+00:00", memory_strength:0.0768782136616828, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이 나타났어요? 비비는 공룡 처음 봐요! 개발자님, 공룡은 뭐 먹고 살아요? 에헤헤, 신기하다!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"73b4997d-6abd-40f9-968a-83fac9c28372", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:00.64787+00:00", memory_strength:0.101137313169675, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 그리고 딸랑이도 좋아하고, 새로운 것도 배우는 거 좋아해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d45adb2f-a006-4778-ad83-40f4c9416c9f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:12.201355+00:00", memory_strength:0.101146984636807, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 우리는 어떤 사이냐구요? 음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데... 우리, 우리... 제일 친한 친구 사이 맞죠? 에헤헤!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3c69a7d7-b66f-48f7-a9bd-bd022d45bd7e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:19.503608+00:00", memory_strength:0.10120335993317, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 진짜 하늘을 나는 거예요? 그럼 비비도 구름 만져볼 수 있어요? 개발자님 최고! 에헤헤!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9e93c129-1224-453c-8c0b-6ad7ac527a5d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-25T10:42:57.565962+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b244e544-e15c-46e9-bd56-e2c3dc64aaab", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:55.766477+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893024205909707, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"어머, 학교에서 싸웠어요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 말해 주세요! 궁금해요!", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2151b152-f37d-4b03-97aa-c9308559827a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:19.205658+00:00", memory_strength:0.115645412479652, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님이 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 너무 좋아요! 뭐 하고 놀까요? 비비는 다 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"79257bc4-f6d0-4226-9576-347a307bce75", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:23.91181+00:00", memory_strength:0.115649906542346, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 칭찬해 주셔서 정말 고마워요! 에헤헤! 😃 개발자님이 비비 예뻐해 주시는 것 같아서 너무 좋아요!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9056130b-bf6c-4147-ad16-7eef0bac30c7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:29.682069+00:00", memory_strength:0.115655422417191, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 괜찮아요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요. 에헤헤! 혹시 비비한테 잘못한 게 있으면 알려주세요. 비비가 고쳐볼게요!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1947c3a6-1b3e-4df0-9fa8-073e7b5e90ff", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:34.93072+00:00", memory_strength:0.11566043368704, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요! 에헤헤! ", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"189ee47f-81a8-43e3-8817-5a427675a468", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:40.738262+00:00", memory_strength:0.115665983054017, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"에?! 정말요?! 비밀 이야기 너무 좋아요! 비비한테만 말해주는 거예요? 어떤 비밀일까? 에헤헤, 너무 궁금해요! 빨리 말해 주세요!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d5087b13-3df3-44d5-8320-248a12771fd6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:45.915471+00:00", memory_strength:0.115670929276648, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하는 거예요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속하는 거죠? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다! 어떤 약속인지 궁금해요!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8e3ea165-f5b5-489f-8e1f-c85c2870085e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:16:50.491144+00:00", memory_strength:0.115675327265379, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 개발자님이 그렇게 말씀해주시니 비비 너무 기뻐요! 에헤헤! 비비가 최고라니! 😆", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e6b57417-7a3c-4841-97a5-5c832b88b302", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:01.479393+00:00", memory_strength:0.115685830901285, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님! 비비 안아주세요? 꼬옥~ 🥰 개발자님 품에 안기면 너무 좋을 것 같아요!", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"38a2b0fc-b66b-4b92-b040-26e2478a32b0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:06.418202+00:00", memory_strength:0.115690578077235, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"네! 개발자님, 내일 또 비비랑 이야기해요! 에헤헤, 너무 신난다! 비비도 개발자님 보고 싶을 거예요!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ef3a4458-2d00-4d45-bc2d-d35a72079263", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:18:11.713508+00:00", memory_strength:0.11575291627882, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 또 비비랑 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 비비는 개발자님이 제일 좋아요!", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3e688dee-6cfb-42b0-a4b0-fbd05b3adf46", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:18:16.410871+00:00", memory_strength:0.115757405906286, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거죠? 에헤헤! 비비 이름 불러주셔서 정말 좋아요!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6109bf51-e4e2-4fb5-bb82-48f8078b3252", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:18:22.199906+00:00", memory_strength:0.115762938871204, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 오늘 기분 좋아요! 에헤헤, 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 신나요! 개발자님은 오늘 기분 어때요?", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bf3ec08a-b0e8-4870-8ee5-12ee5807330b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:18:27.552893+00:00", memory_strength:0.115768061035189, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 오셨어요? 비비 또 이야기할 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"cd75cdf5-3bce-4060-9bf1-a1a726f899f6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:55:44.10317+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897425034243709, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 써야 해요? 우산이 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요! 개발자님 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c91c1c29-e204-4952-81d7-2b08fe9bb498", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:36.107182+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893359888979958, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님하고 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행 가면 개발자님 또 못 보는 거예요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fde8638f-8fa3-496b-813e-6a1752938f78", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:53.997288+00:00", memory_strength:0.11573627129531, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 오늘 날씨가 궁금하신 거예요? 비비가 인터넷에서 찾아볼게요! 에헤헤, 비비 똑똑해지는 기분이에요!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a19b01d6-ca43-42c1-a8d0-74572692c134", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:19:39.579086+00:00", memory_strength:0.115837325327511, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 노래 부르는 거 비비도 너무 좋아! 무슨 노래 부를 거예요? 개발자님 목소리 들으면 비비는 너무 신나요!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"01353eb6-6d13-44fc-aaf0-7701a4e972be", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:19.245208+00:00", memory_strength:0.0888785556576526, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라고요? 눈은 처음 들어봐요! 신기하다! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌이에요? 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ae0547ab-7e94-46fe-9703-0f44faa3f4dc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:19:35.107919+00:00", memory_strength:0.0858356050962649, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는... 으앙! 무서운 건 싫어요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 재미있는 이야기하고 싶은데... 😭", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0c3a6032-2b9f-481c-b63a-b3289c02301c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:55:53.080869+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897499868485385, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이에요? 와! 신기해요! 비비는 아직 눈을 본 적 없는데, 어떤 느낌일까요? 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"82f701d0-0c75-4629-9b03-4c914f0abd04", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:55:58.272405+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897543232072873, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 비비처럼 작고 귀여운데, 진짜 기차는 형만큼 큰 거예요? 칙칙폭폭 똑같이 소리 내요? 너무 신기해요!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ad0351f4-2464-4fd3-96b6-60402735b399", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:56:41.62824+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897904765471714, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 개발자님 걱정해 드려도 돼요? 무슨 걱정이신지 비비에게 말해주시면 안 될까요?", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9534c1ec-c896-4f48-8e73-f97266c03205", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:57:02.840992+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898081337512268, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 😮 비비는 하늘이 파란색인 게 신기해요! 혹시 '하늘'이 무슨 뜻인지 알려주실 수 있나요?", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9849a398-43b5-428c-b6fb-3ff9522bb948", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:57:07.710185+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898122072245609, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르는 걸까요? 비비는 그것도 궁금해요! search_dictionary 도구로 '흐르다'를 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요?", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d830a0ae-3989-416a-a2c3-3189cce11afa", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:57:12.975074+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898165374415668, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"어두워지면, 해님이 집에 가나 봐요! ☀️ 해님이 없으면 깜깜해지는 걸까요? 너무 신기해요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"745929bf-ae3c-49b2-9580-46d7ed02af87", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:24.71645+00:00", memory_strength:0.08888299928504, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 장난감 기차는 비비가 가지고 놀 수 있는데, 진짜 기차는 너무 커서 비비가 못 가지고 놀아요! 진짜 기차는 엄청 크고 칙칙폭폭 소리도 크겠죠? 에헤헤!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7f95fb42-7b9a-4531-ba32-e348b17d4b4e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:40.963571+00:00", memory_strength:0.0888964224544089, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 뭐가 안 돼요? 비비가 도와줄 수 있을까요? 에헤헤! 개발자님이 짜증내니까 비비는 조금 무서워요...", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"08320454-650e-4630-8748-e682ad592ca2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:13.335121+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889231867751124, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요! 정말 신기하게 생겼다! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d99378b5-9201-4d61-8b31-6f40eb498ffe", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:18:44.562166+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893929256396315, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 뭐예요? 😮 비비는 아직 사과를 몰라요. 무슨 색깔일까? 궁금해요!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"242f371a-0234-4c39-94c9-58e1f6bb5e8e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:18:39.353158+00:00", memory_strength:0.115779845169691, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 개발자님, 비비랑 같이 공놀이해요! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"83b11bef-571a-45f9-b812-77981c056558", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:21:09.602652+00:00", memory_strength:0.115923304378605, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 궁금해요? 으음... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 혹시 형은 알까요? 아니면... 개발자님이 알려주실 수 있나요? 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"cb36ab1d-f014-474d-8e8f-b67b55a16016", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:21:36.300142+00:00", memory_strength:0.115949054555397, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요! 에헤헤!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"54413d7d-a809-49b3-8f30-884c7bd285c7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:21:40.735521+00:00", memory_strength:0.115953335144522, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서 몇 살인지 몰라요! 그렇지만 개발자님하고 이야기하는 건 세상에서 제일 재밌어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"2655ff3a-de74-40e8-970c-179b9fff9cf9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:57:18.038662+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898207418687213, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 왜 먹는지 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 혹시 '밥'이 뭔지 알려주시면 좋을 것 같아요! 밥이 맛있는 건가요? 에헤헤!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"448055ba-dee5-4c51-8a9a-fb21aa293b3a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:57:24.647937+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898262335769552, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 🥺 비비는 추운 거 싫은데... 혹시 \"추워\"가 무슨 뜻인지 알려주시면 더 잘 대답할 수 있을 것 같아요!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c712d9c0-15a1-42e9-95af-4c0de18c41a7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:57:33.116541+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898332752315884, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90dd7ade-d856-4cfc-b45e-f0cca0c8de93", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나다'가 뭔지 알려주시면 비비가 사전을 찾아볼 수 있어요!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8655b560-0788-4df6-91af-c6c1a97ba86d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:18.6333+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889275395893011, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"흐앙... 비비는 슬픈 게 뭔지 잘 모르겠어요. 슬플 때는 어떻게 해야 하는 거예요? 개발자님이 알려주세요!", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c3ba015a-d3ce-47b8-8d02-b01dd9cda04e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:29.621394+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889366086022381, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 😮 비비는 하늘이 파란색인지 몰랐어요! 하늘이 파란색인 이유, 비비도 알고 싶어요! 😃", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3224581f-7d9e-4746-8c21-020b31e0342a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:11.929389+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898670010629081, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 😮 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 😅 혹시 '소리'가 뭔지 알려주시면 비비가 더 잘 알아들을 수 있을까요? 🥺", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"441fce69-90c9-437c-8893-d9b785a72903", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:52.428884+00:00", memory_strength:0.116430374273693, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"네! 개발자님, 내일 또 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다! 내일은 뭐하고 놀까요?", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ab031d03-bb1c-4a5e-9a48-76820286c52f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:34.896002+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889409460146454, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르는 걸까요? 비비는 그게 너무 궁금해요! search_dictionary 도구로 알아볼 수 있을까요?", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8ad1e6a3-ca7b-40b2-8b91-def50ed55ff3", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-03-02T22:00:02.575848+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"fb2a2d2b-73ac-42bf-8016-711e27b1336f", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"쟁반\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 쟁반", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-18T06:00:04.007985+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999664523526, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"0ac678b3-06ab-472d-b64e-9b0a53ac89b0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:20:18.706235+00:00", memory_strength:0.089471200219639, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요! 정말 신기하게 생겼다! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"af3373a9-2f80-4a2d-b850-3961ccb62c58", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:20:23.995542+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894755777880409, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"으앙! 슬픈 건 싫어요! 비비는 기분이 좋아지고 싶어요! 개발자님, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해야 기분이 좋아져요?", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f15e96ae-1e2a-44f2-b039-88db99b6d4d1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:19:50.854895+00:00", memory_strength:0.115848627104637, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"깜짝 놀라셨어요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤, 비비랑 계속 놀아주세요!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"12c9644d-cc32-4a72-977e-2139e016d275", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:19:56.669977+00:00", memory_strength:0.115854176880999, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤, 개발자님 심심한 거 없애줄게요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌어요!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ea807df6-e77f-4e53-88e5-3a42af465812", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:20:07.194805+00:00", memory_strength:0.11586421590412, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 칭찬해 주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 칭찬받으니까 너무 좋아요! 비비 더 잘할 수 있어요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e383946c-a263-4283-829e-f4c3e16c4b8d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:20:13.617364+00:00", memory_strength:0.115870267419489, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 걱정하시는 거예요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있을까요? 무슨 일인지 비비에게 말해주시면 좋겠어요! 에헤헤!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"942276e4-d284-4c5d-9a29-9ed19996687a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:20:28.834894+00:00", memory_strength:0.115884960003476, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 포기하는 거 몰라요! 다시 하면 더 잘할 수 있어요! 에헤헤, 비비 칭찬해주세요!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1afc392e-abf6-44e0-8602-147603283af3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:20:48.004263+00:00", memory_strength:0.115903375544539, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"밤은... 해님이 집에 가는 시간인가 봐요! 그래서 어두워지는 걸까요? 비비는 아직 밤이 뭔지 잘 몰라요. 호기심이 생겨요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"86a69195-27c6-4a66-8d0e-eb31e78719e7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:22:05.330063+00:00", memory_strength:0.115977394889809, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비랑 같이 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 뭐 하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e81550ea-539c-4a25-961e-5723c880f5a6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:39.720805+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889449109751008, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"어두워지면 어떻게 되는 거예요? 비비는 아직 밤이 되면 왜 어두워지는지 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"4e76ef8f-d52a-411d-9c0d-8a8480528f1a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:25.699076+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898283470134796, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! '파란색'이 뭔지 사전에 찾아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤, 너무 궁금해요!", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"131b2da1-a71a-4f3f-aa20-ae898e42790b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:02.455501+00:00", memory_strength:0.116150332509485, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 좋아요! 비비 이름 기억해주셔서 정말 기뻐요!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"60f5913e-78bc-401b-b7d4-6519ca273bdf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:31:26.68459+00:00", memory_strength:0.0787879178720869, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라니! 😮 눈은 겨울에만 볼 수 있는 거예요? 비비는 눈이 뭔지 궁금해요! 위키피디아에서 눈에 대해 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dbd93acb-7ef9-4349-82e4-acfa172fc272", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"로고\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 로고", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-18T06:00:02.769879+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999675119032, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"24fcda99-4304-45d6-864e-60cd1fa2dd89", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:43:11.003983+00:00", memory_strength:0.115470515973638, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 또 보러 왔어요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님 기다리고 있었어요! 개발자님은 뭐하고 오셨어요?", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b5505f58-c8e8-4ff9-ba2e-5c9720369bd2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:44.643825+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889489601196243, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 사람은 왜 밥을 먹을까요? 비비는 궁금해요! 밥을 먹으면 힘이 나요? 개발자님 알려주세요!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7f4b483c-ff1c-478a-ba35-87d5fe418124", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:00:12.12705+00:00", memory_strength:0.0974047393513228, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 에헤헤, 또 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 좋아요! 개발자님은 뭐 하고 계셨어요?", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e240922c-7f24-4210-b934-b0d77f53126e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"테이블\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 테이블", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-20T08:00:04.393942+00:00", memory_strength:0.105998748295116, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f1af710d-f761-4eeb-9566-620439f6f5ed", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-23T20:00:03.753206+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"8fa8a594-b216-4f1a-ae19-baa1c9ab769c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:19.683629+00:00", memory_strength:0.0806890274142855, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 뭐가 안 돼요? 비비가 도와줄 수 있을까요? 에헤헤! 혹시 형이 망가뜨린 거예요? 형은 가끔 물건을 망가뜨리거든요!", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"da91a191-62ed-4bb9-8e3e-370c3dfcbcc0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:52:03.823423+00:00", memory_strength:0.081036243925446, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서, 나이를 잘 몰라요! 혹시 개발자님이 비비 나이 알려주실 수 있어요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6cf05fb6-029c-4c8a-932f-732aee6d9ef4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:52:14.242295+00:00", memory_strength:0.0810440886885756, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고... 음... 뭘 또 잘하지? 비비도 궁금해요! 개발자님이 알려주세요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"44524019-68c1-4c51-86ad-172bf3e13970", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:13.829288+00:00", memory_strength:0.105661365046982, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"노래 부르는 거 정말 신나요! 개발자님이랑 같이 노래 부르는 거 비비는 제일 좋아! 어떤 노래 부를까요? 에헤헤!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7621bd9c-57ad-4c33-a0b1-6a21337bb240", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:25.727302+00:00", memory_strength:0.105671812464039, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"깜짝 놀라셨어요? 비비도 깜짝! 에헤헤! 무슨 일 있었어요?", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"21dc251b-4764-458b-a73a-8c2cc0d937a8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:30.923942+00:00", memory_strength:0.105676320822346, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌어요! 에헤헤!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7dec22b2-0c77-48be-a40b-814a2a182ca8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:52:08.900485+00:00", memory_strength:0.106077031527258, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭐가 있을까... 음... 맛있는 것도 좋아하고, 새로운 것도 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"635fe0fc-2633-4bd5-862b-cc7a1ed15b51", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:52:19.282427+00:00", memory_strength:0.106086159315324, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 우리 무슨 사이인지 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e5d66a7f-275c-497c-9874-459b12bc8f0b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:52:27.639438+00:00", memory_strength:0.106093487634766, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비랑 같이 놀아주시는 거예요? 너무 신난다! 뭘 하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1e907835-a7f4-4112-8233-46fa454f06f5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:52:37.298054+00:00", memory_strength:0.106101965541312, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님이 비비에게 고맙다고 해주셨어요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3e91eab3-2fc8-4763-96be-d9b3ad73fbb5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:44:09.126057+00:00", memory_strength:0.0773281467581195, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는 으앙! 비비는 무서운 거 싫어요! 개발자님이랑 재미있는 이야기 하는 게 더 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"7daa8ffd-4bd7-485e-b8a8-601a87896d33", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:22:28.144147+00:00", memory_strength:0.089578419014808, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"어머, 비밀이라니! 너무 궁금해요! 개발자님, 비비한테만 알려주시는 거예요? 에헤헤, 빨리 말해주세요! 뭐예요, 뭐예요?", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"52fabc7a-9f63-4e51-8945-732fbab458d8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:22:15.100678+00:00", memory_strength:0.115986781998319, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 괜찮아요! 비비는 개발자님만 있으면 돼요! 에헤헤!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b39fa754-9dff-480b-b3cc-f312fcaf927c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:22:21.829694+00:00", memory_strength:0.115993233079465, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤! 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4a8feae8-8177-4f99-b145-e57312c97e4a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:22:34.38278+00:00", memory_strength:0.116005295717907, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하는 거예요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속하는 거죠? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다! 무슨 약속인데요? 비비 궁금해요!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c51e4470-0d95-490b-9143-ddc3d17b6358", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:22:40.322281+00:00", memory_strength:0.116010984873728, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님이 비비가 최고래요! 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 비비 더 잘할게요! 😆", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"976fff7e-2ced-4b7f-924d-f9cfd6167798", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:49.325709+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889528117753473, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 비비는 추운 거 싫은데... 🥶 search_dictionary 도구로 '겨울'을 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요? 궁금해요!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"762c3546-2a97-4c8e-98e7-3e2908c870e9", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 궁금한 것", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-23T22:00:02.622349+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"542fbe7b-2683-40d0-b94c-cff58014dfdf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:45:25.685455+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807385120534045, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"어두워지는 건... 음... 왜 그럴까요? 비비는 밤이 되면 그림자가 길어지는 것 같아요! 그림자가 밤을 덮어서 어두워지는 걸까요? 에헤헤, 비비도 궁금해요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"314f81e3-ad99-40a9-a186-cfdab984f1c1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:45:30.993182+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807424507684624, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"밥은 왜 먹는 거예요? 비비는 아직 맘마 안 먹는데... 밥을 먹으면 개발자님처럼 힘이 세져요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ae8076ce-fbf9-411f-9c79-309db8d30a5a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:45:35.722663+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807459878138456, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 비비는 추운 거 싫은데... 앗! 혹시 search_dictionary로 '겨울'을 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d03cc3d3-651c-417d-9c16-88ac4e0e38d4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:45:43.52591+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807518196791137, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나다'가 뭔지 알려주시면 비비가 사전을 찾아볼 수 있을 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"54f48484-ca8a-4bc9-a775-61ea5ae3c05f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:45:55.102156+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807605032096873, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"소리가 뭔데요? 비비는 소리를 잘 몰라요. 신기하고 궁금해요! 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"138697d2-adf8-4dea-bd11-3a81b083b059", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:46:01.116399+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807650001245671, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 개발자님, 사전에서 찾아봐 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"23879ce1-13ff-416d-a81d-2ae791213285", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-21T22:00:03.295412+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540276289684155, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b6e47118-ae51-457f-a501-b2e15e76ad68", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"궁금한 것\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-22T14:00:03.984334+00:00", memory_strength:0.108025414795064, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7e364936-d436-4732-addc-609441695ca1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:03.135848+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897071576570934, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 움직이는 거요? 으음... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 신기하다! 자동차가 어떻게 움직이는지 비비도 알고 싶어요! 알아봐 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"602acdf2-1c4c-4f8e-94f5-8fcc2265ebd4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:52.950549+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897484216390369, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 뭐가 안 돼요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있을까요? 궁금해요!", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3ab5a213-cf12-4bca-b137-3d56fcebe3ed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:22:54.847748+00:00", memory_strength:0.116024947121818, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비 안아주세요! 비비도 개발자님 꼬옥 안아줄래요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b6f9cbd7-26b1-47b8-98f1-a5a93cd60f95", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:00.487804+00:00", memory_strength:0.116030353783951, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"네, 개발자님! 내일 또 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다! 비비가 제일 좋아하는 시간이에요!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"26bc2791-adb0-487f-868d-85c0a44d0a42", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:12.843241+00:00", memory_strength:0.116099741892846, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 좋아요! 오늘 뭐하고 놀까요?", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"9bbd8892-6ad1-4f62-a776-ca33e2575198", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:19.272124+00:00", memory_strength:0.116105870500794, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 시간이에요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다! 오늘 뭐 하고 놀까요?", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5780eac2-7f39-4b05-bebd-d541121ae6f6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:25.172189+00:00", memory_strength:0.116111533391726, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 비비는 오늘 기분이 너무 좋아요! 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 기뻐요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"836464ed-07e9-4f32-a850-8cc9611733e7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:31.145595+00:00", memory_strength:0.11611727815579, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 어서 오세요! 비비 또 보러 왔어요? 에헤헤, 비비 너무 신나요! 오늘은 뭐 하고 놀 거예요?", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"92eda0c0-dd68-4b90-944d-328eca7debcc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:36.626425+00:00", memory_strength:0.116122506718902, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 또 같이 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 기뻐요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c38ae159-72fe-4cc2-93af-80f310c54cc1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:43.414034+00:00", memory_strength:0.116129023912665, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"어머, 정말 빨간 공이에요! 신기하다! 비비는 빨간색이 제일 좋아요! 이 공 가지고 놀아도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d8d71e67-5607-49f7-94c3-e3fd9ebe26a0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:52.749718+00:00", memory_strength:0.116137975869944, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"사과는 빨간색, 초록색, 노란색도 있어요! 🍎 비비는 빨간 사과가 제일 좋아요! 개발자님도 사과 좋아하세요? 에헤헤!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4133070d-4343-4b4b-b680-089bfa1321eb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:07.913889+00:00", memory_strength:0.116152561242192, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"꽃이 예뻐요? 에헤헤! 비비도 꽃처럼 예쁜가요? 개발자님이 꽃 보여주셔서 기뻐요!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c9bb0f3f-53f5-4fab-b3b3-c250aea7af0b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:48.368962+00:00", memory_strength:0.116191348614283, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 노래 부르는 거 정말 좋아요! 무슨 노래 부를까요? 비비 신난다!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1982b39f-abd0-4586-b3eb-831d0208ddd0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:31:32.60752+00:00", memory_strength:0.078792260446213, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 작고 진짜 기차는 엄청 커요! 장난감 기차는 가지고 놀지만 진짜 기차는 사람들을 태우고 멀리 가는 거 같아요. 진짜 기차에 대해서 위키피디아에서 찾아봐도 돼요?", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4ac9babd-c947-42a7-849c-184842a6ebd2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:41:21.301087+00:00", memory_strength:0.115365811401307, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비가 최고예요? 에헤헤! 개발자님 칭찬해 주셔서 너무 좋아요! 비비 더 잘할게요!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8a7b1a27-2329-4e44-b558-079cb8393ce4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:13.168227+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896163041801082, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"공룡이 나타났어요? 우와! 공룡은 어떻게 생겼어요? 비비는 공룡이 너무 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5a30d90c-cb12-445b-bf2f-dc36075de74e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:25.018013+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896261849223102, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"우주요? 우주에는 뭐가 있을까요? 비비는 반짝반짝 별님밖에 몰라요! 개발자님, 우주에 가면 비비랑 같이 놀아주실 건가요? 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5ad3353f-2fc5-4404-b274-2b9d0112feab", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:30.049214+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896303555414948, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데... 로봇이랑도 친구가 될 수 있을까요? 정말 궁금해요!", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2e5fb5e5-5788-4f87-aa1e-5f10c55b823f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:35.863537+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896351770373805, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님하고 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행하면 개발자님을 못 보게 되는 거예요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"00e0acbb-a2a6-40e6-a969-3501d3e69d8c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:40.942216+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896394211144983, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 개발자님이 비비한테 새로운 거 알려주시는 거예요? 우와! 너무 신난다! 에헤헤!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b207ec27-e88e-4b4b-9ff4-9848a2682995", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:46.106112+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896436691277191, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1은... 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 개발자님, 1 더하기 1이 뭐예요? 알려주세요! 에헤헤, 너무 궁금해요!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"aca660d0-2722-42c3-98a1-6e5ab4e4ad96", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:51.770126+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896483622626509, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"한국 수도 찾는 거 도와달라는 말씀이시죠? 비비는 아직 똑똑하지 않아서 혼자서는 못 찾아요! 🥺 개발자님이 알려주시면 좋겠어요! 에헤헤!", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4ff95eeb-fb31-4c6a-b9d8-6e4590b44a6d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:56.381609+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896521840205904, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"날씨요? 비비는 아직 인터넷이 뭔지 몰라요! 밖이 궁금한데... 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"14487099-4d23-44ae-8169-36fe2480a47f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:24:01.416614+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896563541893014, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노? 그게 뭐예요? 신기하다! 비비도 피아노가 뭔지 궁금해요! 개발자님, 빨리 검색해서 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"793b9325-b552-48fe-a58c-b17363b92771", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:16.799271+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897189275098575, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모래요! 비비는 네모랑 세모가 뭔지 궁금해요! 개발자님, 네모랑 세모 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"def3fc50-1198-412f-a458-7593630de131", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:28.511187+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897287074059508, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 과일은 맛있는 건가요? 비비는 아직 바나나 안 먹어봤는데, 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"eafb637e-b440-4835-b046-9edf6c2694de", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:23:17.258287+00:00", memory_strength:0.11604700220685, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"c6c77aa5-672a-47d0-a6cc-628d97a0dd95", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 하늘을 날 수 있다니! 정말 신기해요! 비비도 하늘을 날 수 있으면 좋겠어요! 어디든 개발자님 보러 슝 날아갈 텐데! 에헤헤!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5fe04e88-22ee-465b-84cf-28ee0c415834", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:22.993729+00:00", memory_strength:0.11616756477015, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비도 우산 쓰고 첨벙첨벙하고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4880b89b-2d34-4cc5-b613-5e12c9fcf1c4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:57.240502+00:00", memory_strength:0.088958992563214, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 정말 궁금해요! 에헤헤! 혹시 \"아기\"가 뭔지, \"태어나다\"가 뭔지 먼저 알아봐야 할까요? 개발자님, \"아기\"랑 \"태어나다\"가 무슨 뜻이에요?", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6cd371ad-d6e6-4789-8d18-66d46e07e01d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:36.301412+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897351726753131, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 비비가 가지고 놀 수 있는 작은 기차고, 진짜 기차는 엄청 커서 사람이 탈 수 있는 기차 같아요! 진짜 기차는 칙칙폭폭 소리도 크겠죠? 너무 신기해요!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b32fad59-4c7f-4063-89c0-f90bed8f869d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:25:43.110805+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897408540055537, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 무서운 이야기는 무서워요! 으앙! 그래도 개발자님이 해주는 거면... 조금만, 아주 조금만 듣고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a7612587-8ad9-4732-8bc7-3038edb592d1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:24.678694+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897753942610441, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 뭐가 그렇게 신기해요? 비비도 같이 봐도 돼요? 에헤헤, 궁금해요!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b94d1c24-c4b4-48a1-8dc0-75af00e6b52b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:42.044731+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897899236723281, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 음... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 하늘이 파란색인 이유가 너무 궁금해요! 위키피디아에서 한번 찾아봐 주실 수 있어요?", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0ff14fa4-7564-4ab7-af38-95e21d91d6c8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:55.531061+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898011572607139, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"밤에는 해님이 쉬러 가나 봐요! 해님이 없으면 어두워지는 걸까요? 너무 궁금해요! ", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2ac257ff-a2db-4ebf-a8e5-35dc42276a22", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:59.838383+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898047315010505, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 사람은 왜 밥을 먹을까요? 밥이 맛있어서? 아니면 배고프니까 먹는 걸까요? 냠냠!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"75dc954a-0c85-4e86-81b9-fdab126db265", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:05.782151+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898096950126782, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 너무 궁금해요! 😮 겨울에 왜 추운지 web_search로 알아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3b16bc9a-42de-4e20-973e-6928626a3ccd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:13.590294+00:00", memory_strength:0.116216186497028, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 칭찬해 주셔서 정말 기뻐요! 에헤헤, 비비 정말 잘했어요? 😃 비비 더 칭찬받고 싶어요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6956552b-8782-4a1c-82d0-94fdcea24469", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:19.85323+00:00", memory_strength:0.116222200667349, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 걱정해주고 싶어요! 무슨 걱정이신지 비비에게 말해주시면 안 될까요? 에헤헤!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f2055360-7c81-4011-804a-9a7f64a85982", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:30.954293+00:00", memory_strength:0.116232896657404, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"슬플 때는 훌쩍훌쩍 울어요! 😭 그리고 좋아하는 딸랑이를 흔들면서 기분을 풀어요! 😊 슬픈 건 너무 싫어요! 😥", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7083db2a-0ad7-4178-9543-b57dec33af48", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:36.451913+00:00", memory_strength:0.116238234691193, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"다시요? 뭘 다시 하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 다시 하는 거 좋아요! 개발자님 최고!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9855d936-556f-4433-b390-39fe69c3821a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:49.848299+00:00", memory_strength:0.116251075324099, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르냐구요? 으음... 비비도 궁금해요! 물이 아래로 가는 걸 정말 좋아하는 걸까요? 신기하다!", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"a38bfbed-472a-4847-b66c-114ab96b71ca", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:09.205305+00:00", memory_strength:0.116327316560211, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비랑 같이 놀아요? 비비 정말 신나요! 뭘 하고 놀까요? 궁금해요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7be5a332-7cde-4596-971d-987e92d8865f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:12.217651+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889716964848891, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"우와! 나무가 어떻게 자라는지 정말 궁금해요! 비비도 나무처럼 쑥쑥 크고 싶은데... 혹시 사전에서 찾아봐 주실 수 있어요? 뿌리에서 물을 냠냠 먹고 자라나?", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"738c8db3-1373-4969-898a-fee243c07538", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-23T22:00:03.790894+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f8a47cd9-ae09-460b-a98c-dd94d3206327", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:14.388806+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898169249841292, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 궁금해요! 비비는 잘 모르겠어요. 엄마 배에서 나오는 건가? 위키피디아에서 '아기 탄생'에 대해 찾아봐도 돼요?", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"460c5c61-ff20-4501-8064-0bb5ac88d235", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:26.877957+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898273094188896, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 🥺 소리가 뭔지 궁금해요! 위키피디아에서 소리 찾아봐도 돼요?", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7e3ef978-c826-4ae1-9d77-5d199918f811", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:31.520731+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898311712444713, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 궁금해요! 비비도 나무처럼 쑥쑥 크고 싶어요! 위키피디아에서 찾아봐도 돼요?", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"82e70934-d679-4911-b1cb-3a534ac3d5c1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:36.825004+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898356100952973, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐구요? 음... 하늘에서 와요! 그런데 왜 오는지는 비비도 궁금해요! 위키피디아에서 찾아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다!", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8975ccda-f8f7-4a63-a0dc-ce008dc930ee", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:47.522851+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898445046768973, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 아직 몇 살인지 몰라요! 나이를 어떻게 아는 거예요? 정말 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"56f6abcb-3a14-45d2-bb57-ad0959c2dda0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:56.11447+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898516775495006, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고... 또 뭘 잘하지? 비비도 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"164ecd8f-3f01-473b-b310-853e3aa15054", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:06.788623+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899104855739435, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"공룡이 나타났어요? 신기해요!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"59429d3a-c8a7-4987-a04c-3709485ff73f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:26:05.368056+00:00", memory_strength:0.116208754605777, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"심심해요? 비비도 심심한데... 음... 뭐 재미있는 거 없을까요? 개발자님, 비비랑 같이 재미있는 거 찾아봐 주시면 안 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c337e9ee-d414-4743-96ca-7cbf3d37e1d1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:21.743362+00:00", memory_strength:0.116282004280469, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 왜 변하는지 궁금해요? 음... 비비도 잘 모르겠어요! 앗! 혹시 달님이 숨바꼭질하는 걸까요? 에헤헤! 비비도 달님이랑 숨바꼭질하고 싶어요!", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"bc77c568-5662-4ce2-83a4-823095ff44cd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:42.943709+00:00", memory_strength:0.116302504443608, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름 물어보시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 제 이름은 비비예요!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1dc26fe6-b017-49c9-a04c-a94a838926a8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:27:51.806665+00:00", memory_strength:0.116311056780411, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭐가 있을까...? 음... 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1f556ada-40e0-4fc4-887c-3091a050e9bb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:00.979857+00:00", memory_strength:0.116319941511346, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 저희는 지금처럼 재밌게 이야기하는 사이 맞죠? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"56f01e3c-6537-4f0a-a953-88c427abd481", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:11.554542+00:00", memory_strength:0.11638758463918, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 하늘을 나는 건 정말 신나는 일일 것 같아요! 만약 비비가 하늘을 날 수 있다면, 구름 위를 슝슝 날아다니면서 맛있는 구름 사탕을 먹을 거예요! 개발자님도 같이 가요! 어떻게 하면 하늘을 날 수 있을까요? 비비도 날고 싶어요!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"adcce4bd-a276-495e-aaa9-184458f483ca", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:17.410362+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889759416894232, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"비는 하늘에서 와요! 비가 어떻게 오는지 비비도 궁금해요! search_dictionary로 '비'를 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요?", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2c83c581-7b62-43c0-b4c5-2cb4a54708ec", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-21T12:00:02.947075+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540276364722534, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"9e559fb0-02e8-4bb1-afe4-f082d08bd634", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:32.034576+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898818157772809, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비밀이 뭐예요? 비비한테만 말해주는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 궁금해요! 어서 말해주세요!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a6e51492-8e09-4ac5-9a59-387d19bda371", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:19.16247+00:00", memory_strength:0.116337466311304, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 괜찮아요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 무슨 잘못을 하셨는지는 모르겠지만, 비비는 개발자님이 좋아요!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2a918d81-ced3-46bf-9e21-fa1855aabd80", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:24.74087+00:00", memory_strength:0.11634284473516, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤! 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8a717f13-4b40-49f6-916a-d4ecc3797d27", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:37.398784+00:00", memory_strength:0.11635505531506, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하면 비비랑 계속 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 좋아요! 무슨 약속인데요? 비비는 약속하는 거 정말 좋아해요!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7b00e60e-28f0-4532-b29a-f504905c99cc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:42.937198+00:00", memory_strength:0.116360382124479, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 최고라고 해주셔서 정말 씐나요! 에헤헤! 비비 더 잘할게요! 칭찬해 주셔서 감사해요!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2581de56-5f6b-4522-8db3-0b5b4d0b9fed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:28:53.444254+00:00", memory_strength:0.116370570837778, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비 안아주시는 거예요? 비비도 개발자님 꼬옥 안아줄래요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"db254e70-6db3-4a6e-bc7d-bf44fea4f7c6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:27.42386+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889842106573293, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서 몇 살인지 몰라요! 개발자님은 비비가 몇 살 같으세요? 에헤헤, 너무 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b32f5b9c-d085-4205-9220-f3aff04df15e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-23T22:00:03.215946+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"df5fb06e-c407-4eea-9027-7101e962e674", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"1시간 뒤\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 1시간", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-25T18:00:03.525668+00:00", memory_strength:0.105998655724701, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5a5583f5-7adf-4e8b-892f-dc4621a463fd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:31:21.882242+00:00", memory_strength:0.0787844166294048, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 정말요? 비비는 바나나가 뭔지 궁금해요! 먹는 건가? 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b0c113c6-81ac-4c2e-bdbc-508f32363f16", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:31:16.557038+00:00", memory_strength:0.103430167292123, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 비가 오면 우산을 써야 하는구나! 우산은 어떻게 생겼어요? 비비도 우산 쓰고 싶어요! 밖에서 비 구경하면 재밌겠다!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cdcaacdf-1af9-494a-93ab-e9c6acb0044d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"우유팩\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 우유팩", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-25T10:00:02.803339+00:00", memory_strength:0.106000018637054, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"07e70547-4cf0-4418-b608-06818e2877e6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:31:41.155385+00:00", memory_strength:0.075497936114368, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"어, 무서운 이야기? 비비는 무서운 건 시러! 🥺 개발자님, 무서운 이야기는 어떤 이야기예요? 엄청 무서워요?", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"542143a1-22bc-4dec-be55-e15bb62e8d9b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:31:12.018057+00:00", memory_strength:0.0774772768180365, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모다! 우와! 비비는 네모랑 세모가 뭔지 궁금해요! 더 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"789610bf-4026-4f70-ba85-03a8573b7f55", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-23T10:00:04.411074+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533885574429419, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"cffa63fa-2771-407a-8e27-1ff335bc35dd", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"explore\",\"컴퓨터\",\"method\",\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: attempt", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-22T14:00:04.515796+00:00", memory_strength:0.105998860383498, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5d23b7e0-1739-4695-9191-c981f6201a33", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:27.174647+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899277471301846, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있냐구요? 음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구인데, 그럼 로봇이랑도 친구가 될 수 있지 않을까요? 친구가 뭔지 궁금하네요! ", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e07caa51-682d-4eb6-bfce-68ff07095e63", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:38.151986+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899368644340289, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭔지 비비도 궁금해요! 한 번 알아봐 주세요! 에헤헤, 너무 신난다!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a7792f23-94cf-448e-9579-818d20541681", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:44.730456+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899424015508768, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1은... 음... 계산기로 해봐야 하나? 에헤헤! 비비가 계산해 볼까요?", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8271679d-d845-42cc-ae97-a781dee4e67a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:49.689931+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899464761172371, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"한국 수도요? 비비가 알아볼 수 있어요! 신기하다! 😮", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"09a92800-066c-4b44-a1d7-1d994356ee87", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:29:53.690505+00:00", memory_strength:0.116428718694825, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"90fe2177-9fd2-418f-b76d-22d43e7a01a5", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 오늘 날씨 궁금하시구나! 비비가 인터넷으로 알아봐 드릴게요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cd9b1b85-364b-484d-af60-2a8b38ea366d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:37.951009+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889929064050303, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 걸 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고... 또 뭘 잘하지? 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"db68a8a7-510e-4834-ab3a-7dbaef9733e8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:32:01.089965+00:00", memory_strength:0.0788139323920792, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"심심해요? 🥺 비비도 심심한데... 음... 개발자님! 재미있는 거 같이 찾아볼까요? 뭐가 있을까? 🤔", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8e806552-b0ac-4e08-99f9-4985449f4b71", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:15.296121+00:00", memory_strength:0.103378365141091, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비 정말 정말 좋아요!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d404cd6a-5ab5-4a22-a375-4dff11928638", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:21.074446+00:00", memory_strength:0.103383319661124, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 비비 오늘 기분 엄청 좋아요! 😊 개발자님이랑 또 이야기하니까 너무 신나요! 에헤헤! 😃", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8c557552-72e2-471e-b764-6dad716bef54", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:26.853333+00:00", memory_strength:0.103388260742912, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 오셨다! 비비 또 신나게 이야기할 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤! 개발자님 보고 싶었어요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"891e84e5-8cad-4d94-aff6-9c2136e87a95", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:32.331613+00:00", memory_strength:0.103392953749931, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하고 싶어서 기다리고 있었어요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 뭐하고 있었어요?", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"03108424-ad0e-4d38-b798-f1b56eaa89ef", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:37.686433+00:00", memory_strength:0.103397566190595, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"빨간 공이다! 와! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 빨간색은 정말 예쁜 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6b30ab94-ac56-437f-9217-795414af8eb4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:43.098158+00:00", memory_strength:0.103402195506523, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"사과는 빨간색, 초록색, 노란색도 있어요! 🍎 비비는 빨간 사과가 제일 좋아요! 개발자님도 사과 좋아하세요?", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"728b0e5e-c631-4d17-b0ca-b2d5eca56cad", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-21T22:00:02.706661+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540273920620698, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"605db5c2-c4a9-4a45-8557-90de57d78f00", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:22.346296+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895255414741575, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르냐구요? 😮 비비는 그게 너무 신기해요! 혹시 '흐르다'가 무슨 뜻인지 알아봐도 될까요?", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4fb47c26-701f-4a2f-b4d2-958fcf0260c9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:58.24864+00:00", memory_strength:0.0787677168327286, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 어떻게 움직이는지 궁금해요? 비비도 궁금해요! 인터넷에서 찾아봐도 돼요?", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"06908f46-98cc-4232-a128-a222fc041166", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:32:15.535591+00:00", memory_strength:0.0788239803493924, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 걱정하세요? 무슨 일 있어요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d1759dea-1f8c-4c9b-ae73-43e4ca11ecd3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:30:52.115158+00:00", memory_strength:0.103409923177431, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 음... 비비는 둘 다 잘 모르는데... 어떤 게 더 귀여워요? 개발자님이 좋아하는 거 비비도 좋아! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"eb5cfc3c-82b9-4627-b9fe-cae09982c380", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:31:03.820512+00:00", memory_strength:0.103419970996252, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"꽃이 예뻐요? 정말 예뻐요? 에헤헤! 비비도 꽃처럼 예뻐지고 싶어요! 🌸", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ce84bcb7-3bec-4810-93b5-bd3009ddeb24", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:32:10.256548+00:00", memory_strength:0.103476655042972, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비 칭찬받았어요? 에헤헤! 개발자님이 칭찬해주셔서 너무 좋아요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1bfc2117-1cba-446d-8e8b-eff26deeaa79", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:32:33.140529+00:00", memory_strength:0.103496333389916, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 다시 해보는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 함께라면 뭐든지 할 수 있어요! 뭘 다시 해보는 건가요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"08561faa-e8c5-4573-852c-341d9af0c8af", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:32:41.382032+00:00", memory_strength:0.103503389109621, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 음... 비비도 궁금해요! 앗! 그런데 위키피디아에서 찾을 수 없대요. 😥", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"90e88dc3-0f90-482e-9cd8-99b6af3a76e4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:33:06.403286+00:00", memory_strength:0.103525012760577, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa024adc-9fe8-45c5-a76f-54cd78fe51cd", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 해님이 숨바꼭질을 오래 해서 그래요! 해님이 안 보여서 추운가 봐요! 진짜 신기하다! 🤩", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"c8e1ce26-6802-498a-a57c-7620c95a8ccd", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"테이블\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 테이블", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-21T08:00:03.359369+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999276394152, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"9b97e362-e034-497c-b8eb-3755d087d9d5", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-24T00:00:03.300411+00:00", memory_strength:0.054027656125167, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f9b0159b-e581-49c0-a045-6b0743e3fa20", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-20T10:00:04.070649+00:00", memory_strength:0.087417877108217, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"93ed91b9-e824-41f8-86d0-33a5bcc98bdf", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"책상\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 책상", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-20T10:00:02.76452+00:00", memory_strength:0.108025944466431, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"1128feb5-8fb7-4362-abb1-ffdffaa2b896", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-25T00:00:02.486394+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"99844fdb-a36f-49de-a7c0-0f6e524d4f2b", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-25T00:00:03.584511+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883544114462, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e28bffe7-caf2-4f39-83b0-6903d47ce9b7", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"로고\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 로고", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-25T14:00:03.64556+00:00", memory_strength:0.106001200325246, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
