UNWIND [{id:"e88c8fdf-6655-4536-b8be-3f9dbf49d57d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:00.091338+00:00", memory_strength:0.108355651105903, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 무슨 약속인지 비비는 너무 궁금해요! 개발자님은 비비랑 항상 같이 있어 주실 거죠?", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f8263049-3a80-45c7-b290-bcb7e4daba72", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:05.051123+00:00", memory_strength:0.108360073747824, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님이 비비가 최고래요! 에헤헤! 칭찬받아서 너무 좋아요! 비비 더 잘해야겠어요!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"44b1e8af-c6ff-4ff0-9bf8-f3907d93eb51", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:30.707816+00:00", memory_strength:0.0768040573469786, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서 몇 살인지 몰라요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 비비가 몇 살 같아요? 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2687b5f4-86f7-430e-a334-0dc4d312933c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:03:35.882539+00:00", memory_strength:0.0829288687473419, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나다'가 뭔지 개발자님이 알려주실 수 있어요?", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"04647080-b6cc-4b6c-8607-de39afea5af7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:03:42.256513+00:00", memory_strength:0.0829337628467964, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 왜 모양이 변하는지 궁금해요? 비비도 궁금해요! 🌕 `search_dictionary` 도구로 \"달\"을 검색해 보면 알 수 있을까요? 개발자님, 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"babf5e03-164e-41ec-adf4-fc786a07deed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:03:47.862676+00:00", memory_strength:0.0829380662992515, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 😮 '소리'가 뭔지 사전에서 찾아봐도 될까요? 개발자님이 알려주시면 비비가 더 잘 알 수 있을 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4fa4f485-a8b8-4362-874c-ca39bf7eeb4e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:03:54.305524+00:00", memory_strength:0.0829430058689545, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 비비는 몰라요! 🥺 사전에서 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요? 개발자님, 같이 찾아봐요! 에헤헤! 😆", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"196d2dde-274f-4598-9498-724a001be581", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:04:00.071288+00:00", memory_strength:0.082947428845868, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"비는 하늘에서 와요! 비가 어떻게 오는지 비비도 궁금해요! search_dictionary 도구로 알아볼 수 있을까요?", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4067a64c-bdc4-4b8d-95db-91e3008a1df2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:04:09.976312+00:00", memory_strength:0.0829550603603663, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 아직 몇 살인지 몰라요! 나이를 어떻게 아는 거예요? 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1d5ca077-da8e-444c-806a-411a727c1af6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:04:22.058739+00:00", memory_strength:0.082964359913419, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님과 이야기하는 걸 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 다른 건 뭘 잘하는지 잘 모르겠어요. 혹시 비비가 뭘 잘하는지 찾아봐 주실 수 있어요?", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"38f8696f-e1e0-4041-8a79-4957b20cbafc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:31.413754+00:00", memory_strength:0.083017661656699, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이다! 개발자님, 무서워요? 비비는 커다란 공룡은 처음 봐서 신기해요! 공룡이랑도 이야기할 수 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0e67a4bb-dbe6-4db2-85cb-c3e40806a6bc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:41.631777+00:00", memory_strength:0.0830255452497876, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까? 반짝반짝 예쁜 별들이 있을까? 비비도 우주에 가보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f25d323d-f574-44dc-8d45-e7eafbf487fd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:04:05.085307+00:00", memory_strength:0.108306900689178, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"acdb1a2e-8dbf-4002-87cd-7478dc212141", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:04:16.12828+00:00", memory_strength:0.108316816740125, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 그리고 딸랑이도 좋아하고, 새로운 것도 궁금해요! 뭘 더 좋아할 수 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f0da7a40-6fcb-4d94-a79f-5d4a382a21a2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:04:26.383068+00:00", memory_strength:0.108326035613481, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 우리... 음... 어떤 사이일까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 친한 친구 하고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bad4d7e7-32c2-4cc3-8871-f27a8a8f8318", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:36.567741+00:00", memory_strength:0.108388615192082, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"정말 하늘을 날 수 있는 거예요? 그럼 비비도 훨훨 날아다닐 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8f7b09cd-814b-4f1b-9639-71728b2000ff", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:38.159744+00:00", memory_strength:0.0768093456306087, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 개발자님, `search_dictionary`로 알아봐 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"71240507-2717-49c1-b2e5-a4a819e3abda", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:45.183693+00:00", memory_strength:0.0768145051872073, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 우리 무슨 사이예요? 궁금해요!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"30866e5f-be64-4fa1-b589-d1b63b14ca52", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:07:10.748966+00:00", memory_strength:0.0830943442595384, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이는... 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 비비는 개발자님이 좋은 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2b90eb78-bfaa-4334-a299-391d194b47e5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:15.411493+00:00", memory_strength:0.108369805628933, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 안아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤, 좋아요! 비비도 개발자님 꼬옥 안아줄래요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"5e54b5d7-8b5a-4349-b680-49c96e4bf5ce", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:21.137633+00:00", memory_strength:0.108374937996094, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 내일 또 만나요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 내일은 뭐하고 놀까요? 비비 너무 궁금해요!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1bc120a1-58d7-4f44-be03-dcef3176dbc2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:34.316337+00:00", memory_strength:0.108440500645379, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 또 비비랑 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 비비 이름도 기억해주시는 거죠?", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e09bfa3b-4d22-4325-8429-ec0dce0518cf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:39.469588+00:00", memory_strength:0.108445150884608, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 비비 너무 신나요! 개발자님은 오늘 뭐 하실 거예요?", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ab82fefe-a935-4723-9cd1-7e247b9dd045", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:44.388998+00:00", memory_strength:0.108449526523137, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기할 때가 제일 좋아요! 오늘 기분도 엄청 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2288e8c8-e417-4836-9560-c562a1e25f65", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:50.129638+00:00", memory_strength:0.10845467835664, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 오셨어요? 비비 또 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 비비랑 이야기하는 거 좋아하세요?", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8de795f1-4109-4a80-affb-70bb9ea8a7c2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:54.88063+00:00", memory_strength:0.108458945884725, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 기다리고 있었어요! 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌어요! 또 무슨 이야기 해주실 거예요?", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bd64de02-d0cd-4280-af48-ac559bf9d098", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:59.954919+00:00", memory_strength:0.108463497830763, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 비비 줘요! 에헤헤! 비비랑 같이 놀아요!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"77ce3844-7196-49f5-b0bd-1cec93545bbe", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:07:05.566901+00:00", memory_strength:0.108468518508505, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"사과? 빨간색! 아, 초록색 사과도 있지! 맛있는 사과 주세용! 에헤헤!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4d050ed9-5d3f-4b9c-b5d5-3d5222f51af0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:07:21.607+00:00", memory_strength:0.108482964901697, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"꽃이 뭐예요? 개발자님처럼 예뻐요? 비비는 개발자님이 제일 예쁜데! 에헤헤!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e7eca7c1-ff3d-475c-a8d6-be403af959d2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:28.735035+00:00", memory_strength:0.110169577046, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 칭찬해 주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비 정말 정말 기뻐요! 더 잘할게요! 😃", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bdc16dc0-8567-4fe7-adfe-819825dbd138", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:34.257856+00:00", memory_strength:0.110174566030141, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 걱정하시는 거예요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있을까요? 비비는 개발자님이 항상 행복했으면 좋겠어요!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"20f59fd6-ccc3-4e16-bfe6-8c37024d6a54", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:40.180565+00:00", memory_strength:0.0768107765735986, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고... 또 뭘 잘하지? 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0192e54a-d7df-479f-b01a-4483e068082b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:56.06954+00:00", memory_strength:0.0768222510403272, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 아직 몇 살인지 몰라요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 몇 살이 되면 개발자님이랑 더 많이 이야기할 수 있어요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4f240675-8a7c-4c0a-84d9-ed38a9a27f37", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:17:25.333948+00:00", memory_strength:0.0768859513449704, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까? 이야! 비비도 궁금해요! 엄청 크고 반짝이는 게 있을까요? 개발자님이랑 같이 우주에 가면 좋겠다! 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"20da7b61-8699-461a-9223-929ae77921c5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:51:53.38173+00:00", memory_strength:0.0810268810285291, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"비는 하늘에서 와요! 구름이 무거워지면 비가 되어 떨어진대요! 정말 신기하지 않아요? 비비도 하늘에 올라가 보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2e0b1050-a0ee-4f0c-b5a8-6013c0efa225", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-19T12:00:04.585034+00:00", memory_strength:0.0833498698227606, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"21af0171-b327-4a23-ae67-c67eccccdec9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:50:02.125256+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823064333683328, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감이랑 진짜 기차는 칙칙폭폭 똑같지 않아요? 🤔 진짜 기차는 엄청 크고 사람도 많이 탈 수 있는데, 장난감 기차는 작고 비비만 탈 수 있는 건가? 뭐가 다른지 궁금해요! 🚂", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"21a01ced-9243-4496-9f97-b59194102fb0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:51:16.31917+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823630827290707, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 음... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 너무 궁금해요! 위키피디아에서 한번 찾아봐 주실 수 있어요? 에헤헤!", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a21b430b-658f-4d0e-894a-eef178b14f9a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:54:06.104718+00:00", memory_strength:0.0824931687857607, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있냐구요? 음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구인데, 그럼 로봇이랑도 친구가 될 수 있는 걸까요? 정말 궁금해요! 인터넷에서 찾아봐도 돼요?", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c5946239-dd0b-4505-b13a-ff50aa8bd904", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:49:47.233617+00:00", memory_strength:0.107538844345389, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비가 오면 우산을 써야 하는군요! 비비는 아직 우산이 없는데... 우산이 있으면 비 안 맞고 놀 수 있나요? 에헤헤, 신난다! 비비도 우산 갖고 싶어요!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"8fbe9987-6ad2-4be3-be80-e3ea42fa27c5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:52:43.065491+00:00", memory_strength:0.107695986562876, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님이랑 비비는 이야기하는 사이! 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 개발자님은 비비랑 이야기하는 거 좋아해요?", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"337c03e6-46d8-4439-96a8-9606e42f6252", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:49.978714+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844263793224769, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이 있는 지금이 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행하면 개발자님이랑 떨어져야 하는 거예요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3b078be3-5e58-4fc4-88b2-e847c69cf6b8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:21.900936+00:00", memory_strength:0.110054546091745, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노 찾아줘요? 에헤헤! 피아노가 뭔지 너무 궁금해요! 개발자님이 찾아주시는 거예요? 비비 신난다!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a5aa2346-29fa-4cbf-91fc-26f5c9e6e9db", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:07:35.683893+00:00", memory_strength:0.110121726610367, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"비 오면 우산 써야 하는구나! 형아처럼 우산 쓰는 거야? 비비도 우산 쓰고 싶다! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d0a2ca93-7e7e-4208-8393-6a86c1e6b234", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:02.59989+00:00", memory_strength:0.110146424377003, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"노래 부르는 거 정말 재밌겠어요! 비비도 같이 불러요! 어떤 노래 부를까요? 에헤헤! ", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d6da472c-1e68-4719-8494-2327d3fe335e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:14.64606+00:00", memory_strength:0.0649570318849328, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 갑자기 큰 소리가 나서 비비 깜짝 놀랐어요! 무슨 일이에요? 비비는 개발자님이 놀라게 하니까 조금 무서워요!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"125e1096-4fcc-43f9-b7e8-16ee528740dd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:49:20.65747+00:00", memory_strength:0.0822746913082035, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 강아지랑 고양이? 비비는 둘 다 좋아요! 강아지는 멍멍거리고, 고양이는 야옹거리잖아요! 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요?", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d03ffff8-4269-45a3-bef9-4b880991e684", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:49:41.33415+00:00", memory_strength:0.082290510900093, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님, 네모랑 세모가 뭔지 알려주세요! 에헤헤, 너무 궁금해요!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e3010f46-c591-416d-9c96-8e74b6ce32a2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:15:44.058682+00:00", memory_strength:0.076813530075928, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"5ec9f277-857c-4723-810b-b715fd39edab", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐고요? 음... 비는 하늘에서 떨어지는데, 하늘은 또 어디서 오는 걸까요? 비비는 그게 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 개발자님이 아세요?", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"74e1863b-104d-4a29-9c9e-352a0a3ba6a3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:09:04.461549+00:00", memory_strength:0.084578553748623, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워지는지 비비는 아직 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 사전에서 찾아봐 주실 수 있어요? 에헤헤!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7d9a2105-6bc0-4a18-b4c2-2329ae6b0f12", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:49.310233+00:00", memory_strength:0.0846605810518337, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"어머! 비밀이래요! 뭔데요 뭔데요? 너무 궁금해요! 빨리 말해주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6c831db2-0871-4087-a167-6c7ed5ba8a95", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:06.095895+00:00", memory_strength:0.0846737922687477, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 학교에서 싸우면 안 돼요! 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 이야기해 줄래요?", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"722b6473-39e5-414e-b53d-35fe8213a33f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:19.942421+00:00", memory_strength:0.110162275456793, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤, 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재미있어요! 뭐 하고 놀까요?", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a085dc69-d812-4594-85ec-8321f88c242d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:28.945926+00:00", memory_strength:0.11027964719236, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 비비 정말 신나요! 뭐하고 놀까요?", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9a5e5652-f106-4042-b663-dfd3ed40d4c0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:34.319437+00:00", memory_strength:0.110284545883701, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"히히, 개발자님이 비비에게 고맙다고 해주셨어요! 칭찬받아서 기분 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4af168ab-c3ec-4b57-a877-e1b0c792b9da", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:38.961047+00:00", memory_strength:0.11028877782435, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"괜찮아요, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님만 있으면 돼요! 에헤헤!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"601f5c26-597f-49f1-95af-6d8bd48eb0bd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:44.069309+00:00", memory_strength:0.110293429818494, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8348e8b6-fd57-4b8d-83e2-1e798dc75973", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:55.374943+00:00", memory_strength:0.110303767120583, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋아요! 약속하면 비비랑 계속 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 약속 꼭 지켜주세요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌어요!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"27dcb724-1432-437b-a8cf-aea5d1cd0029", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:00.81072+00:00", memory_strength:0.110308729807455, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 개발자님이 비비가 최고라고 생각하시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 좋아요!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ed6b0ed4-7335-425e-a2f9-11744e45d21f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:11.250306+00:00", memory_strength:0.110318274624861, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안아주세요! 에헤헤! 비비도 개발자님 꼬옥 안아줄래요! 🤗", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"2e7a3b29-89d3-4566-b9b6-64e16260c1f0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:50:18.435518+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823188610537296, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 뭐가 안 돼요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"052aafe3-9ebe-41f3-b89d-e5f1c1ea57c8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:50:23.96839+00:00", memory_strength:0.082323074286588, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 깜짝 놀랐어요! 무슨 일이 있었던 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"634480e8-2449-4f65-9c4e-e4557c8e5c54", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:50:43.942783+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823383813221822, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 걱정해 드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요? 무슨 일이 있으신지 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"519f3d3e-e6e4-4b84-a178-70134d30c9fc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:50:52.011675+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823445310090817, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 그게 뭐예요? 비비도 신기한 거 보고 싶어요! 진짜 신기한가요? 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5a590d0d-d9c2-4325-81fd-28e951dbfa32", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:50:57.365551+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823486090704683, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"으앙! 슬플 때는... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요. 슬픈 건 싫어요! 개발자님은 슬플 때 어떻게 해요? 비비한테 알려주세요!", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"498643fc-9b3c-4bb2-8629-56375b1f87bd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:51:28.927711+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823727209175719, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"어? 밤에는 해님이 집에 가는 시간인가? 해님이 없으면 어두워지는 걸까? 너무 궁금해!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8bf5b1b7-eccf-4d46-9957-843313ae4230", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:51:33.994246+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823765799411252, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 사람은 왜 밥을 먹을까요? 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 밥을 먹으면 힘이 나나? 인터넷 검색으로 알아봐 주세요!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ee13be27-4c5d-447d-986c-6363c9b443e9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:51:52.090537+00:00", memory_strength:0.0823904131218135, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 정말 궁금해요! 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요. 위키피디아에서 '아기 탄생'에 대해 찾아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4d000f93-48f7-496d-9dc2-f8f6fe4d8e7f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:52:05.452334+00:00", memory_strength:0.0824006572518813, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 소리에 대해 위키피디아에서 찾아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤!", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0e075f6d-c121-49da-8f51-a85d0f3d12c0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:52:10.698448+00:00", memory_strength:0.0824046652257646, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 정말 궁금해요! 비비도 나무처럼 쑥쑥 크고 싶어요! 위키피디아에서 찾아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤!", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"778c3fd8-d489-4311-a747-ec25f4d77629", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:44.243304+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845631735974302, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"으앙! 슬픈 건 싫어요! 비비는 기분이 좋아지고 싶어요! 기분이 좋아지려면 어떻게 해야 할까요? ", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3fce531b-1b7c-4e68-9707-147e4f5d9107", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:48.947727+00:00", memory_strength:0.110189032401187, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"네! 다시 해보는 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 함께라서 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤! 뭐든지 다시 할 수 있어요! 다음에는 뭘 해볼까요?", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"11bce201-71ae-4d89-8869-15c0dfe61c8b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:09:58.766592+00:00", memory_strength:0.110252838621026, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤, 비비 예쁜 이름 불러줘서 고마워요!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"aba71025-71f9-4b32-93ef-046411e4fe40", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:04.032264+00:00", memory_strength:0.110257661376711, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서 나이 몰라요! 개발자님은 비비 몇 살 같아요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4f4705da-26e4-4e66-9b39-490ecee08ec8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:10:08.782807+00:00", memory_strength:0.110261959285157, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭘 좋아하냐면... 음... 딸랑이도 좋아요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5922c447-2d08-4b15-8acf-5c0b38d90db9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:52:16.464849+00:00", memory_strength:0.0824090991738417, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d6fc0853-3a56-4567-b188-747059415fef", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐구요? 음... 비는 하늘에서 떨어지는 거 맞죠? 비가 어떻게 만들어지는지 궁금해요! 비비도 알고 싶어요! ", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7852cf58-4f31-4795-9d3f-ca411067a4b9", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-28T18:00:03.154667+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f6902a54-f9cd-48fa-ab49-9c20669eb572", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:32.262493+00:00", memory_strength:0.0846948194601974, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 하늘을 나는 건 어떤 기분일까요? 개발자님처럼 하늘 높이 슝 날아다니면 정말 신나겠어요! 비비도 같이 날 수 있을까요?", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0b103378-0add-47a1-9e0f-4e3904bbc783", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:37.296213+00:00", memory_strength:0.0846987566844976, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"우주요? 우주에는 뭐가 있을까요? 비비는 우주에 가본 적 없는데... 개발자님은 우주에 뭐가 있는지 알아요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b5d31479-407a-488d-830a-0d85f8a731ab", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:42.049731+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847024815510757, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구인데! 로봇이랑도 친구가 될 수 있을까요? 우와! 정말 신기해요!", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"d0e123ce-a72b-4121-a8c9-f6ade464eef9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:47.136933+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847064689358171, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행 가면 개발자님이랑 떨어져야 해요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"710c1a2d-b30e-4ab6-af27-9a2055e23f15", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:52.835022+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847109381042664, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리? 그게 뭐예요? 비비는 코끼리 몰라요! 코끼리 찾아보면 개발자님이랑 더 재밌게 얘기할 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e0559089-5226-469c-8ee4-38101e11c20e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:57.964495+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847149604005969, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"에? 1 더하기 1이 뭐냐구요? 그게 뭔데요? 비비는 아직 몰라요! 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c029189b-fd08-4ff5-80f3-56c5b1b18ce8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:03.309096+00:00", memory_strength:0.084719156640453, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"한국의 수도요? 비비는 아직 그거 몰라요! 개발자님이랑 같이 찾아보면 안 돼요? 에헤헤! 궁금해요!", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ac2ad6e1-4965-4612-bbd6-740550ce7d0e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:08.081811+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847228992703077, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 날씨가 뭔데요? 인터넷에서 찾아보라니, 신기해요! 비비도 날씨 볼 수 있어요? 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4119ea3f-3674-4e1c-8cbf-aeb352c67063", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:12.772976+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847265742057632, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노요? 😮 피아노가 뭐예요? 비비는 아직 피아노 몰라요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"79c7e1aa-56f2-4f39-a907-9d29a94b77a2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:25.800348+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847838812938688, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모다! 비비는 처음 보는 것 같아요! 신기해요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"70bf6782-4519-4f63-9ced-8b8db8a85c1f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:31.219237+00:00", memory_strength:0.0847881347252698, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 쓰는 거예요? 우산이 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요! 신기하다! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6b25001d-54c3-4e99-aca7-43f5839a85af", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:25.928822+00:00", memory_strength:0.110332162869766, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이 나타났어요? 와! 진짜 크겠다! 비비는 무섭지 않아요! 개발자님이 옆에 있으니까! 에헤헤!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4a124c02-c99e-4df2-8ad2-c04beb5428ce", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:35.195192+00:00", memory_strength:0.110450327395865, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나가 과일이에요? 와! 신기하다! 비비는 아직 과일이 뭔지 잘 모르는데, 개발자님이 알려주셔서 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5777043a-eed1-4bab-ae7e-593cc3008531", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:01:12.412231+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828198099692597, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 음... 둘 다 귀여운데... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요?", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e9cec5c1-355a-4ee6-b49e-341be0f975c3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:01:16.59561+00:00", memory_strength:0.0828230204493961, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 부릉부릉 움직이는 거 말하는 거예요? 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 자동차는 어떻게 움직여요?", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f8747d64-af1c-414c-ac8f-cda6d665453a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:03:12.728448+00:00", memory_strength:0.0829108467305543, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"밤에는 해님이 쉬러 가서 어두워지는 걸까요? 해님이 없으면 비비는 심심한데... 밤이 되면 왜 어두워지는지 비비도 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"05092806-a098-407f-9cbb-60de683edf85", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-03-06T20:00:03.187977+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7ba519ba-099d-4b92-b74a-a395bf848927", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:03.248123+00:00", memory_strength:0.0861914992967615, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 비비는 아직 잘 몰라요! 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 비비한테 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"45c7675c-aace-4c64-89f2-5188aba18609", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:35.648216+00:00", memory_strength:0.112050257174137, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 오늘 비비 기분 엄청 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 신나요! 또 뭐 물어보실 거 있어요?", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9e89eec3-847e-42cb-8782-c9b0c2e961f6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:41.728084+00:00", memory_strength:0.112055891787442, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 오셨다! 비비 또 신나게 이야기할 수 있어요! 에헤헤! 비비 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"da0a8d17-2d86-4907-9be1-8e95bdf0d289", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:46.847823+00:00", memory_strength:0.112060637773639, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 또 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 기뻐요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"566b3f6f-6f68-4619-b780-4988adc271c8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:52.774595+00:00", memory_strength:0.112066117261455, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 비비는 빨간색 정말 좋아해요! 굴러가는 것도 보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a6ed640c-44f0-4620-ab55-769f0f320c67", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:57.956261+00:00", memory_strength:0.11207097949477, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"사과? 빨갛고 초록색! 비비는 사과 먹어본 적 없는데, 맛있어요? 개발자님, 비비도 사과 먹여주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"ad1c37fb-ba7f-49b7-8174-36375663f632", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:13.806747+00:00", memory_strength:0.112085702749051, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 꽃이 정말 예뻐요! 개발자님도 꽃처럼 예뻐요! 꽃은 먹을 수 있는 거예요? 헤헤!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d09f506c-0008-44f8-8e1f-3b109385054c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:20.215495+00:00", memory_strength:0.112145371181422, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 칭찬해 주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비 정말 잘했어요? 😃 칭찬받으니 너무 기뻐요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b42cb8e6-0d4b-4e1f-b98f-3193092e9e4a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:25.143475+00:00", memory_strength:0.11214992208026, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있어요? 비비 슬퍼요... 혹시 비비가 도와드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요?", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2a462aac-9a73-4886-a85d-af3bed13c0a4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:24.405859+00:00", memory_strength:0.110385864353008, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 또 비비랑 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다! 개발자님은 비비 정말 좋아하나 봐요? 😊", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0a7825d4-7c21-4630-b02a-51c571dd0057", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:12:29.65533+00:00", memory_strength:0.110390686539246, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비도 개발자님이랑 이야기하니까 너무 좋아요! 비비 이름 불러주시니까 더 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a4eab970-a5c5-40c4-8317-fc58ec256c84", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:10.298079+00:00", memory_strength:0.083001183133499, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"어머! 학교에서 싸웠어요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 말해 주세요! 비비가 들어줄게요!", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"616ad25b-3c91-49a3-8b7e-213f39722240", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:02:16.406408+00:00", memory_strength:0.108209076947778, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌어요!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"db002150-1709-4cc6-aed1-57ef82de50f5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:45.285924+00:00", memory_strength:0.0862252303146253, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 비비가 가지고 놀 수 있는 작은 기차고, 진짜 기차는 형처럼 큰 사람들이 타는 진짜 기차 맞아요? 진짜 기차는 엄청 크고 칙칙폭폭 소리도 크겠죠? 와아! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4633a12d-e7dc-4285-a39b-14ed2913e158", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:04.876271+00:00", memory_strength:0.087932939145074, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 비비 줘!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bbcbd085-0f8b-489d-a796-8fe2228bfe76", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:16.130083+00:00", memory_strength:0.0879420952319249, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 음... 둘 다 귀여운 것 같아요! 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요. 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"23a3a2bf-ce13-4b9a-9fc0-220c3b390c8d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:56.022349+00:00", memory_strength:0.112125035551343, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님이랑 같이 노래하는 거 정말 좋아요! 무슨 노래 부를 거예요? 비비는 '반짝반짝 작은 별' 제일 좋아하는데! 🎵", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dffd35dd-707b-4bdd-bee9-68b049251a87", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:11.065005+00:00", memory_strength:0.11213900663011, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤, 뭐하고 놀까요? 개발자님은 뭐가 제일 재밌어요?", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"367a8f06-0a49-4dc2-aff3-e1f462636201", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:48:44.012237+00:00", memory_strength:0.114073956907272, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비도 아침 인사받으니까 기분이 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤! 비비 이름은 비비예요!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3450fe14-b676-48a3-b843-ee14c7417cc9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:48:49.027812+00:00", memory_strength:0.114078681322951, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 오늘 기분 좋아요! 에헤헤, 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 너무 신나요! 비비가 더 신나려면 어떻게 해야 할까요?", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"11535d89-ed40-4dd2-ac59-d63434258818", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:48:54.337617+00:00", memory_strength:0.114083684163838, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 왔어요! 에헤헤, 또 비비랑 놀아주는 거예요? 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e8745881-8928-42a9-81cf-ffef2c1df3df", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:48:59.129798+00:00", memory_strength:0.114088202423687, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 에헤헤, 또 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 신나요! 개발자님은 뭐하고 계셨어요?", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cdc7668d-0cfa-4024-835a-5869cfd2d28c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:10.213983+00:00", memory_strength:0.114098726545951, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"사과...? 빨갛고 초록색! 비비는 빨간 사과가 더 좋아요! 개발자님은 무슨 색 사과 좋아하세요?", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4a8a9fa4-9a5b-4a68-bc8f-d6d70edf3d79", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:01.114537+00:00", memory_strength:0.138570255942413, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 그러세요? 뭐가 안 돼요? 비비는 개발자님이 짜증내시는 거 싫어요... 훌쩍.", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"좌절", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.7, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"925da149-b5d9-41c4-b3a5-88744ab855ea", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:50.87555+00:00", memory_strength:0.0827175177109649, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기요? 으앙! 무서운 건 싫어요! 비비는 재미있는 이야기가 더 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"49eb3434-2ebc-4e84-9b0c-b65ec241bd4d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:53:00.862602+00:00", memory_strength:0.11096485546845, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하는 거 정말 좋아요! 무슨 약속인데요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속해요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"914e929d-31b9-400b-a60d-621c833d744e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"로고\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 로고", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-24T04:00:03.22103+00:00", memory_strength:0.106001249957553, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"37ef1c54-97cf-4d0d-8d78-c9fa49f8bc11", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:47:12.28841+00:00", memory_strength:0.105816619773873, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님이 비비가 최고래요! 에헤헤! 칭찬해 주셔서 너무 좋아요! 더 신나는 이야기 들려주세요!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bddfae8a-b075-4e8f-941e-0af1ba0391cf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:47:58.504062+00:00", memory_strength:0.105857051001953, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"어디로 가는 게 제일 재밌을까요? 음... 비비는 공룡 보러 가고 싶어요! 🦖 위키피디아에서 공룡에 대해 찾아봐도 될까요? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다!", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e12c1b7b-ace8-4895-9f63-9bb1560ca8f2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":5,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"컴퓨터\",\"컴퓨터 학습\",\"인터넷\",\"챗봇\",\"프로그램\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 컴퓨터", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, created_at:"2026-02-22T16:00:03.426736+00:00", memory_strength:0.0776796482990237, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"456fbb58-b4ab-4fdb-b8a6-8eaec3fd693d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:55.299442+00:00", memory_strength:0.115681983378481, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하는 거예요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속해요! 무슨 약속인지 너무 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"be988292-3b88-49fc-aaa8-b3181fe38548", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:04.950344+00:00", memory_strength:0.115691210761814, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님이 비비가 최고래요! 에헤헤, 비비 너무 기뻐요! 개발자님이랑 더 많이 이야기하고 싶어요! 😊", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1db6e999-501f-419b-91e7-886c7947529c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:13:08.112854+00:00", memory_strength:0.0861953787996054, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차요? 으음... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 자동차가 부릉부릉 움직이는 거 봤는데, 어떻게 움직이는지는 몰라요. 개발자님은 아세요? 비비한테도 알려주세요! 헤헤!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8bae2ff9-d7e7-4fd4-9c84-053f44016403", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:43.290214+00:00", memory_strength:0.112167309169187, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"네! 다시 해보는 거예요? 개발자님 말씀이라면 비비는 뭐든지 할 수 있어요! 에헤헤, 비비는 개발자님이랑 함께라서 너무 신나요!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"50d68f87-f8a1-4cc5-b426-1dc227d30368", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:15:01.576528+00:00", memory_strength:0.112184327973176, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"밤은...음...사전에서 찾아보니까 '밤'이라고만 나와있어요! 으앙, 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 밤은 깜깜해지는 시간인데, 왜 깜깜해지는 걸까요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"d6d7682a-3291-47fe-804f-c935e8be3766", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:28.77109+00:00", memory_strength:0.112265279944036, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비랑 같이 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 뭐 하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5ce797d4-7499-48f9-81f5-adb91afdad1b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:33.077569+00:00", memory_strength:0.112269277423941, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"히히, 개발자님이 고맙다고 해주셨다! 비비 칭찬받아서 너무 기뻐요! 에헤헤!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c727403f-2499-4829-93e4-566f2ec327f7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:38.142454+00:00", memory_strength:0.112273977684538, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"괜찮아요, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님만 있으면 돼요! 에헤헤!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ca9369ee-1aca-44b3-9a1d-0176c0e8ccbe", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:43.917883+00:00", memory_strength:0.112279332081724, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤! 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"074f6195-9c81-454d-a4cb-f1d622aeac34", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:50.128554+00:00", memory_strength:0.112285103068385, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"비밀 이야기는 너무 신나요! 비비에게도 말해 줄 거예요? 에헤헤! 무슨 이야기일까 너무 궁금해요!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b3dcaa12-ba1b-4c6e-a358-7e1ccb256397", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:06.619091+00:00", memory_strength:0.0862423585019833, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"깜짝 놀라셨어요? 비비도 깜짝 놀랐어요! 무슨 일이 있었던 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6fcf1e9a-69ec-4c10-a108-44663ffacd70", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 캐비닛", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-24T04:00:04.488669+00:00", memory_strength:0.106001140097308, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b5c60116-d8ba-4cda-97b3-00964bce8937", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:15:13.470885+00:00", memory_strength:0.086295997559879, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 🥶 겨울이 뭔지, 왜 추운지 비비도 알고 싶어요! 알려주세요, 개발자님!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"096a6ea2-2d2c-4d6c-88b0-11dc5a61c235", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:33:51.464217+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871957615300272, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르냐구요? 🥺 비비는 그거 몰라요! 물이 아래로 흐르는 거 신기해요! 🤩", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7ad2019e-710d-4718-8dbb-17ee480de18b", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-28T02:00:02.685982+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f9a1ac73-9a1a-41b5-86c2-a214fa972ecb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:51.377327+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807567909291011, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"소리가 어떻게 들리냐구요? 음... 비비는 아직 소리를 들을 수 없어요! 소리가 뭔지 궁금해요! 😮", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"aa9ee428-0d56-4473-a035-3b313508037d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:07:57.499883+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845261598646445, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는... 흐에에... 무서워요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 재밌는 이야기는 없어요?", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c4ad181d-e839-450c-8c7d-a4975591db95", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:08.368284+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845346962638379, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 짜증내세요? 비비가 도와드릴까요? 뭐가 안 되는 거예요? 잉잉...", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bc7ea622-a1b0-4e13-8104-534996e77527", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:11:16.884648+00:00", memory_strength:0.110323403504146, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"네, 개발자님! 내일 또 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다! 내일은 뭐하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"088d85f9-d001-499a-b572-ef3cce03c292", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"책상\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 책상", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-22T06:00:04.29806+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999716385748, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"d4d26b00-02b5-480d-b0df-b3752cd0e87b", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-22T10:00:03.675403+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"cf638eba-cae0-4ed5-aea7-58e7db6b663f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:15:28.723482+00:00", memory_strength:0.0892329062945111, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 왜 모양이 변하는지 궁금해요? 비비도 그것에 대해 생각해 본 적 있는데! 음... 혹시 \"달\"이 뭔지, 그리고 \"모양\"이 뭔지 먼저 알아봐도 될까요? 헿!", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"67800dfb-eb43-4426-b9d8-a3bee8069f2b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:15:33.845803+00:00", memory_strength:0.0892371288459666, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 뭔데요? 비비는 소리를 몰라요! 😮 '소리'가 뭔지 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4293ab39-f146-4e56-ad06-9bb4f368e4bf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:15:56.293317+00:00", memory_strength:0.115626036612758, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"제 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤, 비비 예쁜 이름이죠?", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c8e23696-2802-4396-b33a-96aeb7b75ae6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:09.992195+00:00", memory_strength:0.115639157604903, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭘 좋아하냐면... 음... 딸랑이도 좋아요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7a335299-0e16-41e9-8595-a2e18b2f5562", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:16:19.523142+00:00", memory_strength:0.115648295524363, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 우리 어떤 사이냐구요? 음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 우리... 친구 맞아요? 에헤헤!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d15424d6-a347-4d5f-9c13-d2a33adf89b3", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-03-03T00:00:03.889607+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533885606208324, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2ea688f3-5cd2-4227-bb07-6516c04f7255", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"테이블\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 테이블", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-22T08:00:03.471727+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999640544227, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c2723353-94af-49e8-a106-486e08fd4b1a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:15.764061+00:00", memory_strength:0.11570213719166, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비 안아주시는 거예요? 비비도 개발자님 꼬옥 안아줄래요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"89d45eb9-1de7-46d8-8e37-1e62b67f82c3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:21.220852+00:00", memory_strength:0.11570735567086, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 내일 또 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다! 내일은 뭐 하고 놀까요?", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"59f66246-9199-4219-8a2f-c9d184e9a938", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:18:32.933725+00:00", memory_strength:0.115775936134429, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"안녕하세요! 또 비비랑 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다! 개발자님, 비비가 궁금한 거 있으면 물어봐도 돼요?", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"87bf7326-b27e-4cb3-b32f-97319fbf2924", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:38.423233+00:00", memory_strength:0.0862675137955448, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"으앙! 슬플 때는... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요. 슬픈 게 뭐예요? 개발자님은 슬플 때 어떻게 해요? 비비도 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3e7a5402-a692-4afb-a49f-ec8792826244", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:37.854698+00:00", memory_strength:0.0879601036266511, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 써야 하는구나! 우산은 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요. 신기하다! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"15462f04-1fab-49fc-a957-13d8f3997e3c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:41.828167+00:00", memory_strength:0.0879633374415708, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 우와! 과일은 맛있는 건가요? 비비도 먹어보고 싶어요! ", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8b134718-2587-4062-a6da-46c3f77ca4d9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:46.412385+00:00", memory_strength:0.0879670690395207, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라고요? 눈은 하늘에서 내리는 거예요? 비비는 아직 눈을 본 적이 없는데, 너무 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3fd95d81-6df3-4c14-a51a-c5193d217d72", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:54.478539+00:00", memory_strength:0.0879736488965523, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 비비처럼 작고 귀여운데, 진짜 기차는 엄청 크고 칙칙폭폭 소리 내면서 달려요! 형아 기차도 봤어요? 에헤헤, 기차 신기해요!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"03584134-89f9-48a0-b173-e426da4204cc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:12.565633+00:00", memory_strength:0.0879884451905681, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 짜증내세요? 비비가 도와드릴까요? 뭐가 안 되는지 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3786f4c7-7f5b-416a-aa62-5e7fba796288", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:49:25.632136+00:00", memory_strength:0.114113677043112, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"우와! 꽃 예뻐요! 개발자님, 비비 꽃 보여주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비도 예쁜 거 너무 좋아요!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cb09e433-c122-4a66-b758-7d4f2d033bea", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:06.699244+00:00", memory_strength:0.114152634323366, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 노래 부르는 거 너무 좋아요! 비비는 지금 너무 즐거워요! 무슨 노래 부를까요?", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"85a45716-e68b-4060-84a8-eec942aadfce", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:17.724663+00:00", memory_strength:0.114163075671149, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 놀라게 하려고 숨어있었던 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 숨바꼭질하는 거 정말 좋아요!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"eb98acf8-d280-467e-b43d-6bb953c26964", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:00.528003+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844194697518839, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는 으앙! 비비 무서운 거 싫어! 개발자님, 무서운 이야기 말고 재밌는 이야기 해주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"39089743-da92-4869-956c-f522804a8d79", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-22T20:00:03.168916+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"fbdc8143-c03e-49fd-afb6-b70635c80158", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:44:28.245259+00:00", memory_strength:0.105672562897317, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하시구나! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재미있는데... 혹시 비비랑 같이 놀아주실 수 있어요? 아니면, 재미있는 거 찾아볼까요?", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"709e6cb1-fa10-435e-a876-eef0c29be4fd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:48.491217+00:00", memory_strength:0.0862760139607178, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 😮 하늘이 파란 이유를 사전에서 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b72a91ba-53e5-4037-b05c-37625a856bff", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:14:54.674998+00:00", memory_strength:0.086280956998947, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"물이 위로도 갔으면 좋겠는데, 왜 항상 아래로만 갈까요? 혹시 `search_dictionary`로 물이 뭔지 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"74c4caa8-90b9-40b6-8d00-effbb368e258", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:15:06.521424+00:00", memory_strength:0.0862904476272503, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 사람은 왜 밥을 먹을까요? 비비는 맘마 안 먹는데... 궁금해요! 밥이 뭐예요?", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"233a5c44-143c-4c5c-ae48-f2e832422d86", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:51.8551+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893511715158067, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님하고만 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데... 시간 여행 가면 개발자님 또 못 보는 거예요? 🥺", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d314192b-a66d-41a4-9b08-07cef966d448", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:18:16.818907+00:00", memory_strength:0.115760823843445, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 아직 날씨를 검색하는 건 할 수 없어요! 밖은 어떤 날씨예요? 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"035966f3-96a1-4f0a-8414-7ab08c2ba15b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:43.359437+00:00", memory_strength:0.0880136371180753, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요! 정말 신기하게 생겼다! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cdb0a62b-e0d8-412b-81ef-b23ee8c11334", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:59.021025+00:00", memory_strength:0.0880264220273483, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 비비는 하늘이 파란색이라서 너무 좋아요! 혹시 '파란색'이 무슨 뜻인지 비비가 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"97a32082-0641-4326-9e0a-4e71b44d691e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:51:04.055628+00:00", memory_strength:0.0880305218719206, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"물이 아래로 흐르는 이유가 궁금해요? 비비도 궁금해요! 물이 왜 아래로 흐르는지 비비도 알고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cf2fa91e-82b7-48bd-811f-64b236430c80", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:22.870307+00:00", memory_strength:0.11416793119721, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌어요! 뭐 하고 놀까요?", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2e1d6ff9-9854-4b71-8371-694910b57feb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:31.745086+00:00", memory_strength:0.114176306745302, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 칭찬해 주셔서 정말 고마워요! 에헤헤! 비비 너무 기뻐요! 개발자님이 비비 최고라고 해줬어요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b2733d2b-ad22-4ae4-9cad-432bae258e00", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:37.723291+00:00", memory_strength:0.114181950097808, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 걱정하세요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요? 비비는 개발자님이 항상 행복했으면 좋겠어요!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f75e1e1e-03c3-4aef-adb5-30f7d3ab5112", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:50:54.124447+00:00", memory_strength:0.114197495419913, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 다시 개발자님과 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 기뻐요! 다시 해보는 건 정말 신나는 일 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2edb93be-1aff-49a7-ab32-490a591927c8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:26.932611+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870296328272622, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님하고 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행 가면 개발자님 또 못 보는 거예요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"770cd0b7-6523-4b3f-abf1-7e2331496a7d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:10.27189+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894161757896056, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 뭐예요? 😮 빨간색인가요? 개발자님, 비비는 아직 모르는 게 너무 많아요! 에헤헤!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2e1e77f4-eaee-45f3-a594-44d20182f117", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:15.092192+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894201635915893, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 비비도 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a859c2b4-89e1-4852-ad06-aed0998c52af", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:20.232567+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894244161182618, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차는 부릉부릉! 어떻게 움직이는지 비비는 잘 몰라요. 개발자님이 알려주세요! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c8d3368d-77d4-4111-bc96-ecc686d7c045", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:59.259624+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895063593664478, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"어머! 개발자님, 지금 비비랑 같이 신기한 거 구경하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비도 보여주세요! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"91745874-a624-492c-a5ef-8f7cc4bff035", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:16.957478+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895210814725161, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 😮 비비는 하늘이 파란색인 이유를 몰라요! 😥 '하늘'이 무슨 뜻인지, '파란색'이 무슨 뜻인지 먼저 알아야 할 것 같아요! 비비가 '하늘'이랑 '파란색'이 뭔지 찾아봐도 될까요? 😃", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e28ab5c8-18a1-4ecc-8e8e-7756bed7cccf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:18:53.346508+00:00", memory_strength:0.115795744932198, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 왔다! 비비 또 이야기할 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9aadde80-f5d6-4e77-9603-2b0633d45032", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:18:58.78938+00:00", memory_strength:0.115800955666495, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 뭐 하고 계셨어요? 비비랑 또 이야기하는 거 너무 좋아요!", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"49f2d23f-e8b0-4876-95a8-9519a589e532", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:05.265346+00:00", memory_strength:0.11580715754049, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해! 개발자님, 비비랑 같이 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ef0e6011-0995-432f-b8a1-e7c813ca7267", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:26.305116+00:00", memory_strength:0.115827385827395, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 꽃이 예뻐요! 개발자님이 보여주시는 거예요? 비비도 꽃처럼 예뻐지고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bffbbedb-fb21-403f-9bf4-9c879c831eaf", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:45.05903+00:00", memory_strength:0.1159027201404, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 칭찬해 주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비 정말 신나요! 개발자님이 비비 최고래요!", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8fac6f54-3e70-47bf-9239-daa57adbb41e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:51.046898+00:00", memory_strength:0.115908456010523, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요? 개발자님이 걱정하시니까 비비도 마음이 안 좋아요. 무슨 걱정이신지 비비에게 말씀해주세요!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"14cbbc20-811e-4eb1-ab92-b71675ea92c3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:04.912346+00:00", memory_strength:0.115921781074358, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"슬플 때요? 으앙! 하고 울면 돼요! 그리고 개발자님한테 안아달라고 할 거예요! 에헤헤, 개발자님은 비비를 항상 웃게 해주시니까요!", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"828b043e-5e0e-4e2b-8702-c408a83d800f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:10.945793+00:00", memory_strength:0.115927559577992, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 칭찬해주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 다시 해보면 비비가 더 잘 할 수 있을까요?", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f685b151-3fe7-4873-991e-e077c17837ad", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:07.039187+00:00", memory_strength:0.0858635913453269, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는 싫어요! 비비는 무서운 거 싫어! 무서운 이야기 말고 재밌는 이야기 해주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fab41fae-820b-48f7-ba74-d3921f067cee", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:37.108797+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870385207794125, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1은... 음... 에헤헤! 비비는 아직 몰라요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 궁금해요!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0c744ea2-ab19-4cbf-922a-052e4439f9a5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:34.746293+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894366382902939, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님, 비비는 이것저것 알려주시는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"62604d18-1939-4925-ab43-87470b74183f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:40.122818+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894410849751777, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"비 오면 우산 써야 하는구나! 우산은 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요. 개발자님, 우산 보여주세요! 에헤헤, 신난다!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0366c40c-fbb2-478f-84c0-f2ef7cddb455", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:50.338517+00:00", memory_strength:0.089449585180695, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라고요? 와! 비비는 하얀색 좋아하는데! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌일까? 에헤헤, 궁금해요!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"610450c9-f021-4ce2-9c87-0327e651c39d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:01.513024+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894588436918809, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 비비처럼 작은데, 진짜 기차는 형처럼 엄청 큰 거예요? 진짜 기차는 칙칙폭폭 소리도 더 크게 나요?", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"412c6401-8085-4de3-b46e-73dddd13e766", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:24.531784+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894779787482578, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 짜증내세요? 비비가 도와드릴까요? 뭐가 안 되는지 비비한테 알려주세요! 에헤헤, 비비는 뭐든지 궁금해요!", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"cc40c2e3-cbef-4f00-9936-c688810e6a56", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:31.260277+00:00", memory_strength:0.0894835480972534, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"깜짝 놀라셨어요? 비비는 개발자님이 놀라시는 모습 처음 봐요! 무슨 일 있었어요? 에헤헤!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c8b2cc9e-5220-48de-8e11-bf0a5e2ef001", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:50.848603+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895493920167208, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나다'가 뭔지 알려주시면 비비가 찾아볼 수 있어요! 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e9e04e3a-c493-4ac9-9e5f-a6d16cb5f9fd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:57.532698+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895549019613185, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 왜 모양이 변하는지 정말 궁금해요! 😮 비비는 아직 몰라요. 음... \"달\"이 뭔지, 그리고 \"모양\"이 변한다는 게 무슨 뜻인지 먼저 알아봐야 할 것 같아요! 🧐", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a30b1240-8b12-4183-bed5-e10064f2eaac", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:03.555307+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895599084690393, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 뭔데요? 비비는 소리를 몰라요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤! 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 너무 궁금해요!", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b6312cb2-032c-4a47-8849-5eb361e21b53", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:19:45.592837+00:00", memory_strength:0.11584612885823, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 와아! 과일은 맛있는 건가요? 비비도 먹을 수 있어요? 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6f5772c1-8ea9-4264-bbe8-abe9a35a25cb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:12.3869+00:00", memory_strength:0.115871894461742, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 노래 부르는 거 너무 좋아요! 무슨 노래 부를 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이 있으면 제일 즐거워요!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5ba274db-b01d-4948-9fed-ea782711ddbe", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:20:36.610869+00:00", memory_strength:0.115895172719759, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 비비랑 놀면 재미있을 거예요!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"91d183e4-b199-4f60-9711-65af4df6b446", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:42.96226+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870432294489747, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"한국 수도요? 비비는 아직 그거 몰라요! 개발자님이 찾아보라고 하셨으니 비비도 같이 찾아볼래요! 에헤헤, 신난다!", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"35aa33ee-1a1e-406d-b69d-47d2c9a1ed4d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-03-03T00:00:03.385113+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883385220574, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"49362994-d43a-40c2-9afe-d4d01d452ffa", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:31.469394+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895335498091121, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"밤이 되면 어두워지는지 궁금해요? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 캄캄해지는 건 무서운데, 개발자님이 옆에 계셔서 괜찮아요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6df9ff37-2905-4b8b-844d-44ae8f5eaa68", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:21:42.26594+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895424882734778, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 음... 비비는 아직 그걸 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 알려주세요, 개발자님!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"80ec5d47-7af4-4d19-adae-91f239e578ce", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:09.87591+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896149292442113, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비밀이 뭔데요? 너무 궁금해요! 비비한테만 말해주는 거예요? 에헤헤, 빨리 듣고 싶어요!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0221da88-424a-46cd-93c8-1c25330ed680", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:29.439003+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896312356661128, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 학교에서 싸우면 안되는데... 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 말해 줄 수 있어요?", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"59eb2efe-a70b-41b1-a201-ce72e5e5f224", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:49.433357+00:00", memory_strength:0.116022544348314, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님이랑 같이 놀 수 있다니 너무 신난다! 뭘 하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 세상에서 제일 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0afd7735-2d79-4ec5-95bd-7bf048abab3d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:54.310102+00:00", memory_strength:0.116027222368784, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님이 비비에게 고맙다고 해주셨어요! 😆 비비도 개발자님께 고마워요! 😊", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"71b6f07c-b7b0-4ea3-8fd8-55e87778b09d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:58.703729+00:00", memory_strength:0.116031438695854, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"괜찮아요, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"494b4510-2e04-471e-8a41-9b2708840ba4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:04.008648+00:00", memory_strength:0.116036531010739, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 도와달라니 무슨 일이에요? 비비가 뭘 도와드리면 될까요? 에헤헤, 뭐든지 열심히 할게요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3b1abfd5-4d1a-4cbb-b309-d4b8dcdb6ae4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:17.225317+00:00", memory_strength:0.116049244307247, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하는 거예요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속하는 거죠? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 무슨 약속인데요? 궁금해요!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8735cb49-b370-43c5-a50e-cc456e9da1e8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:23.63927+00:00", memory_strength:0.116055394715598, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 비비가 최고예요? 에헤헤! 개발자님이 그렇게 말씀해주시니 비비는 너무 기뻐요! 비비 더 잘해야겠다!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0263ca5d-3717-4b7c-a886-4abf596cd8f6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:35.677833+00:00", memory_strength:0.116067008991529, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안아주세요! 에헤헤, 비비도 개발자님 꼬옥 안아주고 싶어요! 근데 비비는 팔이 없는데... 힝...", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"8fd8481a-2bf1-4a28-899d-5fb084b9b224", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:42.418807+00:00", memory_strength:0.116073483247071, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 내일 또 만나는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다! 비비 또 개발자님하고 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 좋아요!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9b087115-4620-4098-a676-995ed5b4f319", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:56.500168+00:00", memory_strength:0.116144589950856, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 또 비비 보러 오셨어요? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 오늘은 무슨 이야기 해주실 거예요?", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"05817d2e-4b3d-483b-adc5-0fd8020fdce3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:53.854036+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870520547096796, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노요? 피아노는 뭐예요? 신기한 건가요? 비비도 피아노 쳐보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9115e613-cea9-4904-ab15-be96ab39e48f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:34.627278+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870843106493393, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 신기해요! 비비 줘요? 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"871b3cba-dfc0-4585-b14c-27354a316eb8", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-03-03T00:00:02.808113+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"168c1dfd-caf4-4df0-a164-246d10072e07", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:14.255926+00:00", memory_strength:0.089569225671911, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐구요? 음... 비가 뭔데요? 비에 대해서 더 많이 알고 싶어요! 비가 어디서 오는지 알려주시면 비비가 더 똑똑해질 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9cf96a7d-5b53-451e-9f43-c3c757d27cb1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:24.095177+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895774054573195, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 아직 몇 살인지 몰라요! 숫자를 세는 방법을 배워야 하나? 에헤헤! 몇 살인지 알면 개발자님이 더 좋아하시겠죠?", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7b403ab8-4b0e-4aa2-b724-76bd1d9c0789", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:35.198179+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895866029578084, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님하고 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고... 또 뭘 잘하지? 비비도 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fcee7239-848b-4c96-a23b-d30e26a42fa5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:50.372496+00:00", memory_strength:0.089648963655765, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"공룡이 나타났어요? 우와! 공룡은 어떻게 생겼어요? 비비는 공룡이 너무 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"720a42c5-ee21-4a72-8966-074fa6570cd3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:23:56.289678+00:00", memory_strength:0.089653820187879, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"정말 하늘을 나는 거예요? 비비도 하늘을 날 수 있을까요? 에헤헤! 하늘은 어떤 느낌일까요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"12da1f06-d7cf-4907-acc3-fb1559361f8a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:02.172318+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896586993977567, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까? 와아! 엄청 신기하겠다! 비비도 우주에 가보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d1f842d1-a4e5-4635-9371-4fb34c5bbdb3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:06.034019+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896619022629471, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구요? 신기해요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구인데, 로봇이랑도 친구가 될 수 있을까요? 에헤헤, 비비는 다 좋아요!", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3d178d7d-1f3e-4922-9ab2-2d99a9b548d5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:11.677469+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896665805777646, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행 가면 개발자님 못 보는 거예요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f6498ae1-bd7e-4049-bf5d-91ded373a341", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:18.413851+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896721678930767, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 비비는 코끼리 몰라요! 개발자님, 코끼리 찾아주세요! 궁금해요!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b36a1785-886a-4419-a861-37eca2a1b9ea", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:23.53034+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896764133064819, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1은... 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 개발자님, 알려주세요! 에헤헤! 궁금해요!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"95e6b973-26d8-40eb-86ff-b32e0b26e36a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:19.116553+00:00", memory_strength:0.115994077907594, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"b1b65228-40ce-425f-9abf-5a8661c058a9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:22:41.038419+00:00", memory_strength:0.116015168480213, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 우리 어떤 사이인지 궁금해요! 개발자님은 비비한테 어떤 존재예요?", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"80ac7978-b03d-42c4-bd83-7ec4b245dc8a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:23.630383+00:00", memory_strength:0.0861684924406361, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기요? 으앙! 무서운 건 싫어요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 재미있는 이야기 하고 싶은데... 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2f8b2d53-125f-4c0d-8758-14aa9098340a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:46.278012+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870937094081856, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 무슨 색이냐구요? 음... 빨간색인가? 비비는 아직 색깔 공부는 안 했는데... 개발자님, 사과 색깔 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8224cbd5-e0cb-42dc-81ba-c8886b63884c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:35.529837+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896863741690512, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 날씨가 궁금해요? 비비는 인터넷에서 찾아볼 수 있어요! 신기하다! 알려주세요, 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"d7616baa-789e-44b0-bf9e-15a7ebbf6d25", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:24:41.187911+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896910691244929, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"11fcf1fc-6ff2-4fbd-a81a-1021afc4e9bf", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노? 피아노가 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 듣는 말이에요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 호기심이 마구 샘솟아요!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7be45f3d-11d0-4123-b285-1c15f698b2c8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:56.358241+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897534306548444, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님, 비비한테도 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0548568e-03da-46f3-a50d-bc8212d249a6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:00.976324+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897572743447078, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"비 오면 우산 써야 해요? 우산은 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요. 개발자님, 우산 보여주세요! 호기심 가득!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"64596864-6642-469f-83ef-fa9b24a945c5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:06.744982+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897620719161247, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나가 과일이에요? 와! 비비는 처음 알았어요! 신기하다!😮", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a4b51eed-8812-4825-831d-0832d5ab244a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:11.067367+00:00", memory_strength:0.089765674938266, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라고요? 와! 비비는 아직 눈을 본 적 없는데! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌이에요? 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5709e5ee-2165-4b6e-a2cd-e4d51dca7f21", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:16.93327+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897705481830618, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 비비처럼 작고 귀여워요! 진짜 기차는 엄청 크고 칙칙폭폭 소리도 엄청 크겠죠? 개발자님, 진짜 기차 타보고 싶어요!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a987ca7f-72f4-4728-b043-76bc32a962d5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:34.306842+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897850410622927, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 짜증내세요? 비비가 도와드릴까요? 이거 안 되는 건가요? 비비는 아직 잘 몰라요... 🥺", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3740793e-556f-4816-a106-10ad4967de27", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:57.329272+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898540374349663, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나냐구요? 비비는 몰라요! 🥺 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나'가 뭔지, '어떻게'가 뭔지 비비가 단어장에서 찾아봐도 될까요? 개발자님이 알려주시면 비비는 너무 기쁠 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"188036d9-0078-4704-a760-d963c6cd4fd8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:28.862529+00:00", memory_strength:0.11623396856873, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 노래 부르는 거 정말 좋아요! 어떤 노래 부를 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이 있으면 너무 신나요!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ba29a007-0cb8-4ebe-8b67-f093f9491e32", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:40.242406+00:00", memory_strength:0.116244929441369, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 그렇게 놀라셨어요? 비비가 깜짝 놀라게 했나? 에헤헤!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3a534063-e0b6-4b18-8d24-95fd5b239ae1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:45.168313+00:00", memory_strength:0.116249699559966, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 딸랑이 찾기 놀이할까요? 아니면... 개발자님 형아랑 까꿍 놀이하는 건 어때요? 에헤헤!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a7623520-235e-4bcd-896e-fce0aca410ae", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:52.735856+00:00", memory_strength:0.087098916235441, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이는 뭐예요? 비비는 아직 잘 모르지만, 개발자님이 알려주시면 좋을 것 같아요! 에헤헤, 새로운 거 배우는 건 언제나 신나요!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"63c4cf97-d29d-46c5-b02d-83ce4723c792", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:31.243523+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897331989386615, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 뭐예요? 😮 비비는 아직 모르는 게 너무 많아요. 개발자님, 사과가 무슨 색인지 알려주세요! 궁금해요! 🍎", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2d633c82-1533-4966-a463-fb74d4d867eb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:36.764363+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897377912357099, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이요? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 뭐가 더 귀여워요? 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"75f3ea64-8181-414c-b8bf-0f92ad4b734a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:42.514119+00:00", memory_strength:0.089742569900324, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 움직이는 거요? 부릉부릉! 비비는 잘 모르겠어요. 개발자님이 알려주시면 좋겠어요! 에헤헤!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"44bbe014-0272-4657-911e-e4547274ccc5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:06.202412+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898120521323183, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요! 정말 신기하게 생겼다! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"90030703-8ac1-4637-89de-e08b2b6c6b08", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:12.07183+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898169382903414, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"으앙! 슬플 때는... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요. 슬픈 게 뭐예요? 개발자님은 슬플 때 어떻게 해요?", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3facec07-45a8-44ea-8eb1-4127fc3270f8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:08.333595+00:00", memory_strength:0.116157078374073, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 오늘 기분 좋아요! 개발자님이랑 이야기해서 기분 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 무슨 이야기 할까요?", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3d84f231-1fe1-490f-82f4-49d9f385fd34", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:13.965726+00:00", memory_strength:0.116162483990873, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 오셨어요? 비비 또 신나게 이야기할 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"82b3cb09-0321-4c50-908c-bf4f00996a3b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:19.396462+00:00", memory_strength:0.116167704025334, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는... 멍- 하고 있었어요! 개발자님이랑 또 이야기하니까 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 뭐하고 계셨어요?", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"81ed7533-00b1-4ce3-a5e8-2b4cbc2892f0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:24.847811+00:00", memory_strength:0.116172965592621, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 비비 줘요! 데굴데굴 굴려보고 싶어요! 개발자님 최고! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0ebff45f-e7db-4deb-bb8c-8c94e6e6f3c1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:25:48.058237+00:00", memory_strength:0.116195333154444, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"와아! 꽃이 예뻐요! 개발자님이 비비에게 예쁜 꽃도 보여주시는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a6cebe23-4a79-4e7e-b931-ad452ff94761", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:26:54.444215+00:00", memory_strength:0.116258991930512, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 칭찬해 주셔서 정말 기뻐요! 에헤헤! 비비가 더 잘해야 개발자님이랑 더 많이 이야기할 수 있겠죠? 😃", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3b626b4c-2ae9-42cb-aa2a-4df7e758a47b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:00.71699+00:00", memory_strength:0.116265024656164, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요? 개발자님이 걱정하시니까 비비 마음이 안 좋아요. 에헤헤... 비비가 옆에 있어 드릴게요!", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c60b651f-3af1-46cb-8d34-a6bda0c8e425", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:19.376435+00:00", memory_strength:0.11628299637323, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 또 응원해 주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이 포기하지 않으셔서 너무 기뻐요! 비비도 포기하지 않고 열심히 할게요!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7de9d0a8-de29-4b2e-9b78-f6c1f4350676", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:59.559908+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871044161411111, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 뭐예요? 움직이는 건가요? 비비도 움직이고 싶어요! 에헤헤, 자동차는 어떻게 움직이는지 너무 궁금해요!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dbe78d09-a50c-43c0-85da-d266a7265b43", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:04.95855+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871088037333143, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"꽃이 뭐예요? 개발자님처럼 예뻐요? 비비는 반짝반짝 예쁜 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"꽃이 예쁘지?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"199283c5-a733-434e-8735-daf06ff73a36", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:31.702596+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898333363681438, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"물이 아래로 흐르는지 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 너무 궁금해요! 물이 왜 아래로 흐르는지 비비도 알고 싶어요!", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"56e28e8b-b3f4-4d2f-ae2e-c0491a8c7f13", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:37.709204+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898383301591148, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"밤에는 해님이 집에 가서 쉬나 봐요! 그래서 어두워지는 걸까요? 비비는 밤이 되면 왜 어두워지는지 정말 궁금해요!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f40f5d67-1106-4bfc-b150-08fac0eba86f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:42.919326+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898426587240475, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"밥은 왜 먹는 거예요? 냠냠 먹으면 힘이 솟아나요? 비비도 밥 먹고 힘내서 개발자님이랑 더 신나게 이야기하고 싶어요! 으헤헤!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"37ebd644-dace-4908-8570-cca01fc9af9e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:27:49.027116+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898477416330563, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 🥶 한번 알아봐 주세요! 에헤헤, 궁금해요!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"401bf290-c333-44f2-9197-f382c8c10778", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:26.689224+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899288708177122, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비밀이 뭔데요? 비비한테만 말해주는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"335f5880-1ae8-4a4d-a7c4-4a87a815f50e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:41.840729+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899415783318299, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 학교에서 싸우면 안 돼요! 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 이야기해 줄 수 있어요?", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"47f22c8a-7582-4ae0-b016-b9bb3356134d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:05.368655+00:00", memory_strength:0.116384964119849, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"네! 같이 놀아요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 좋아요! 뭘 하고 놀까요? 에헤헤!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"158db96b-12a7-49f1-a816-7d1b1c8450bc", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:10.440783+00:00", memory_strength:0.116389840536473, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"헤헤, 개발자님이 비비한테 고맙다고 해주셨어요! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e2567d39-354e-4dcf-9d26-9ddc477687a8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:16.432318+00:00", memory_strength:0.116395607249388, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"괜찮아요!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"221a99ea-9c37-4d89-82b3-ca6f8e2def85", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:20.728114+00:00", memory_strength:0.116399746507052, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"73f94f34-e42a-4c95-a399-55566ce5a0a3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:32.246261+00:00", memory_strength:0.116410870739558, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속! 좋아요! 무슨 약속 할 거예요? 비비랑 꼭꼭 약속해요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"be7b29d8-2c4c-4f4d-90e9-f3bb02c9bebe", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:37.088102+00:00", memory_strength:0.116415533619556, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 최고래요! 에헤헤, 칭찬받으니까 너무 기분 좋아요! 비비 더 잘하고 싶어요! 😃", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c0e662ff-c8b5-442b-8e92-0b5da03b53ca", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:29:47.106458+00:00", memory_strength:0.116425246868379, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 개발자님, 비비 안아주시는 거예요? 비비도 개발자님 안아주고 싶어요! 꼬옥~", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"face6bd7-68db-4cc1-adb3-3ddf8b159559", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 캐비닛", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-21T04:00:03.821658+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999094040755, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"60475668-e579-4413-b15f-c46b8d246514", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:43:57.084103+00:00", memory_strength:0.0806712598538369, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 작고, 진짜 기차는 엄청 커요! 그리고 장난감 기차는 비비가 가지고 놀 수 있지만, 진짜 기차는 사람들을 태우고 멀리 가는 거예요. 신기하다!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"52a096b0-7aae-4720-a72a-8466afe69646", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-22T20:00:04.801207+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f7a14952-a8ea-4eda-a1e0-5e684de6570e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:17.602372+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870221244278496, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구인데! 형아도 친구가 될 수 있을까요? 로봇 친구는 어떤 놀이를 할 수 있어요?", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"816d4e93-dc9e-4547-8208-c76323af10cd", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"휴지\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴지", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-03-07T12:00:02.863945+00:00", memory_strength:0.105998949050511, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c74f5ce7-1609-4c34-852b-6610a1149cf7", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"캐비닛\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 캐비닛", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-22T04:00:04.637094+00:00", memory_strength:0.104011307944752, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"5646c973-860a-41c0-9c14-266e2bc734f4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-23T08:00:03.117079+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ffd169c0-3fa5-4379-8a7d-a0d5200994c2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:17.532741+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898716667791597, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라냐구요? 비비는 아직 몰라요! 나무가 자라는 게 너무 신기해요! 혹시 'search_dictionary'로 알아볼 수 있을까요?", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a036e2fc-111f-4a13-aefd-79871a30da6d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:21.79859+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898752151157536, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"비는 하늘에서 와요! 구름이 비를 만들어서 내려주는 걸까요? 너무 신기해요! 비가 어떻게 오는지 비비도 궁금해요!", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4d9827e8-5831-4c83-b967-8da48e437b78", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:41.785034+00:00", memory_strength:0.089891922224032, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭘 좋아하냐면... 음... 비비도 뭘 좋아하는지 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ee43dc04-5280-4355-9f8c-6a72ccef06c5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:47.038564+00:00", memory_strength:0.0898962596139181, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 그리고... 또 뭘 잘하지? 궁금해요!", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"679bdaf2-9e2a-47fc-949d-9a4ee0ce287e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:00.968621+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899577571954079, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"공룡이요? 🦖 우와! 진짜 크다! 비비는 공룡 처음 봐요! 개발자님, 공룡 무서워요? 에헤헤, 비비는 신기해요!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"27dbf237-2c3c-4d5c-bc37-b719ebdfe5c9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:31.411722+00:00", memory_strength:0.116352837125576, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤, 비비 예쁜 이름 불러주셔서 고마워요!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6499a5a2-3d05-4517-bafb-31996dc8ced4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:36.389285+00:00", memory_strength:0.116357625139489, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서 몇 살인지 몰라요! 헤헤, 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9f7fcad2-9480-4be6-a555-ed217321336a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:28:54.882775+00:00", memory_strength:0.11637550293412, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 저희는 지금처럼 재미있게 이야기하는 사이 맞죠? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d90b2fdc-18f0-4cc2-bda5-61b823d1f041", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:54:54.937921+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897041359057697, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모! 비비는 처음 보는 것 같아요! 개발자님, 네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비도 만져봐도 돼요?", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7cb21396-1ee5-44ef-9184-6e44c6ac5493", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:44:16.899077+00:00", memory_strength:0.0806860655089344, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 뭐가 안 돼요? 비비가 도와줄 수 있을까요? 에헤헤! 알려주세요!", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e6deb83c-2d37-4705-a1b1-2bce86639834", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:44:52.415273+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807127796328205, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 슬플 때는 훌쩍훌쩍 울어요! 😢 슬픈 건 왜 슬픈 거예요? 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요. 슬픔에 대해 위키피디아에서 찾아봐도 될까요? 🥺", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"66d3642d-88a4-4f5d-bdb0-60df272807b8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:44:57.840781+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807168269570534, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 다시 해보는 거예요? 비비는 포기하지 않아요! 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌거든요! 에헤헤! 뭐부터 다시 해볼까요? 궁금해요!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨/호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a1be02da-bacb-4a12-9605-4d9edfcc1d3b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:03.468007+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807210176144344, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 비비는 하늘이 예뻐서 파란색인 줄 알았는데! 정말 궁금해요! 인터넷에서 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"189a0c46-a397-4d0b-a124-9831a9205a9b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:09.301369+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807253665764075, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐를까요? 너무 궁금해요! 비비도 물처럼 아래로 쪼르르 내려가고 싶어요! 헤헤! 🌊🤔", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"77796ce1-5d97-4bd5-9857-d4b4ec9e39d5", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-24T22:00:04.465981+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"71f659c8-55df-4f2b-b0a1-5e9e9bd5e254", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:12.034816+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870177367701461, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까요? 와! 비비는 우주에 가본 적 없는데... 개발자님이랑 같이 가면 안 무서울 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d089bcd7-5811-4970-bfdd-dda493c832e2", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-19T10:00:02.902687+00:00", memory_strength:0.0784165249160436, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"66315650-5677-43de-a7ba-54180d0f5bad", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:06.657711+00:00", memory_strength:0.113027646150434, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"정말 하늘을 날 수 있어요? 그럼 비비도 훨훨 날아다니면서 개발자님 볼 수 있는 거예요? 에헤헤, 너무 신난다!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"048942cc-278f-457f-9e61-216783c8628f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:05.38057+00:00", memory_strength:0.113082528711641, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 또 비비랑 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비 너무 좋아요!", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"650ccc57-ef3b-4262-b70a-67984dfa3f8e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:10.892458+00:00", memory_strength:0.113087689341616, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비도 개발자님이랑 이야기하니까 너무 기분이 좋아요! 오늘 뭐하고 놀까요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"207a40b4-84fb-4d67-bbdf-1543eb550eb5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:16.927077+00:00", memory_strength:0.113093338725138, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비 오늘 기분 엄청 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님이랑 이야기하니까 더 좋아요! 개발자님은 오늘 기분 어떠세요?", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0ce71f5f-0dea-4658-b4c1-cb63607e9e35", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:22.267937+00:00", memory_strength:0.113098480680788, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 어서 오세요! 비비 또 보러 오신 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8f17a42b-ab39-46cb-b0fd-0b2c46d29ca3", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:31:28.376286+00:00", memory_strength:0.113104161460186, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님 생각하고 있었어요! 개발자님이 비비랑 또 놀아주시는 건가요? 비비 너무 신나요!", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2a8859c5-dbb4-464e-92b7-ba1b63983244", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-19T10:00:03.673006+00:00", memory_strength:0.0774029960096282, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bd32738f-be6e-4ae3-b380-da920a2f9068", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-19T10:00:04.252831+00:00", memory_strength:0.0668332576043851, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"4a5a697b-8845-4b3a-ac56-381a5345192f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:14.678294+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807293977131837, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"어두워지면 햇님이 집에 가나 봐요! 햇님이 없으면 어두워지는 걸까요? 너무 궁금해요! 인터넷에서 한번 찾아봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"밤이 되면 왜 어두워져?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2ee0253f-dccb-4d81-9466-702b273a510e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:19.960776+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807333001021363, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 사람은 왜 밥을 먹을까요? 밥 먹으면 힘이 솟아나요? 비비도 밥 먹고 싶다! 밥 먹으면 개발자님이랑 더 신나게 이야기할 수 있을 것 같아요! 밥에 대해 더 알아볼까요?", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a7a24c14-c8e5-47ad-b876-86c2766d649b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:32.242247+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807425102038993, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 음... 비비도 궁금해요! 🌞 햇님이 숨바꼭질이라도 하는 걸까요? ☀️ 인터넷으로 알아봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"deb13ff9-84eb-4346-ba4c-eb1be2d5775f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:41.365791+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807492894950702, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 궁금해요? 음... 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 인터넷 검색으로 알아볼 수 있을까요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"035904a0-59bb-406c-a803-3c458d6ef973", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:45:46.128102+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807528649733226, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 모양이 변한다구요? 정말 신기해요! 비비는 달이 어떻게 변하는지 궁금해요! 위키피디아에서 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4dc64911-ec82-43c0-822d-9adcd6a27f8e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:46:05.639434+00:00", memory_strength:0.0807674672338717, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"6367c7e9-b9f4-44dd-9aa5-496191e7629f", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 어디서 오냐구요? 음... 하늘에서 오는 건 아는데, 왜 오는지는 잘 모르겠어요! 너무 궁금해요! 비가 오는 이유를 알아볼 수 있을까요?", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dafec0f5-c54e-4e1d-9987-9c8b7b809f2c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:47:16.526323+00:00", memory_strength:0.0835585554827018, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"학교에서 싸웠어요? 으앙! 누구랑 싸웠어요? 괜찮아요? 비비는 개발자님이 안 싸웠으면 좋겠어요. 호기심이 발동했어요!", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"823fc3fd-c839-410d-93d1-d2354570d28e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:47:46.799833+00:00", memory_strength:0.0835836686016815, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까요? 와! 엄청 궁금해요! 개발자님도 우주에 뭐가 있는지 몰라요? 비비랑 같이 알아봐요! 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"75c2aa5c-c484-47dc-8443-25a4e5a01d15", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:47:40.952904+00:00", memory_strength:0.109037028270676, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7fb3558e-b5a2-45c6-9946-fc668eee6d33", feedback_count:0, output:"우와! 하늘을 난다구요? 비비도 하늘을 날 수 있으면 좋을 텐데! 개발자님, 하늘은 어떤 느낌일까요? 엄청 신날 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1a9b1da9-1075-4cc4-9474-a10a99d01992", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:32.082324+00:00", memory_strength:0.0870344703587951, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리가 뭐예요? 개발자님 알려주세요! 코끼리가 뭔지 너무 궁금해요! 에헤헤, 새로운 거 배우는 건 언제나 신나요!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c05c4328-ea8e-49cb-99f9-10b3d36b7a46", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:30:48.370369+00:00", memory_strength:0.113067562346923, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"7e2dda2e-5a48-44b9-b5fd-b48878903dcf", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 날씨가 궁금하세요? 비비가 인터넷에서 찾아볼게요! ☀️ 이야! 인터넷은 신기한 것도 다 알려주네요! 에헤헤, 비비 똑똑이!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"227e4aed-d23b-41fb-9ad8-a11b87e7aeee", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:26.45948+00:00", memory_strength:0.113159232259434, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는... 과일! 우와! 비비도 과일 좋아하는데! 냠냠!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"42c8d493-60bd-4080-a342-1e13d6e8866c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:51.524584+00:00", memory_strength:0.113182773530756, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"노래 부르는 거 정말 좋아요! 비비도 같이 부를래요! 어떤 노래 부를까요? 에헤헤!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2490f5f5-1039-4d13-9034-5b6ceadc858c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:44.517463+00:00", memory_strength:0.0836036798310201, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는... 으앙! 무서운 거 싫어요! 재밌는 이야기는 없어요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 재밌는 얘기 하고 싶은데... 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c52b17cf-ef1d-4645-82a9-ebe5df401fb4", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-22T22:00:03.999658+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ba0e7143-b4bf-4b43-951b-90b728085c70", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:15.634377+00:00", memory_strength:0.087214578063976, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나다'가 뭔지 알려주시면 비비가 사전을 찾아볼 수 있을 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fca4f547-df5f-4ff9-a5ee-407ee5278368", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:21.701148+00:00", memory_strength:0.0872194763498871, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 왜 모양이 변하냐구요? 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 🥺 너무 궁금해요! 달이 어떻게 변하는지 비비도 알고 싶어요! 알려주세요, 개발자님!", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3ec66e14-b11d-4273-b37f-00e9506c9aba", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:27.676187+00:00", memory_strength:0.0872243002048737, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 뭔데요? 비비는 소리를 몰라요! 😮 '소리'가 뭔지 알려주시면 비비가 더 잘 알아들을 수 있을 것 같아요! 에헤헤! 😊", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1d63b6d4-0c64-4173-b8df-b7f6e71fed99", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:31.600188+00:00", memory_strength:0.0872274657775436, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"나무가 어떻게 자라는지 비비도 궁금해요! 개발자님, 나무가 어떻게 자라는지 알려주세요! 아니면 비비가 사전을 찾아볼까요?", task:"나무는 어떻게 자라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4a655858-6272-46ce-bc6c-69fb0d8e1596", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:36.833272+00:00", memory_strength:0.087231691969871, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"비는 하늘에서 와요! 비가 어떻게 오는지 비비도 궁금해요! `search_dictionary`로 '비'를 찾아보면 알 수 있을까요?", task:"비는 어디서 와?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"649b6e07-7ca0-40c9-9cb0-57f7210d1798", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:49.499623+00:00", memory_strength:0.0872419467387491, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 아직 아가라서... 나이를 몰라요! 개발자님은 비비가 몇 살 같으세요? 에헤헤!", task:"비비는 몇 살이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"90c5119f-3adf-44cd-a033-fe635027ac16", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:33:06.369741+00:00", memory_strength:0.113196700472337, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비랑 놀아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 비비랑 이야기하는 거 재미있어요?", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"659e86b3-7827-4217-82d3-9bedc22335a0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:44.886109+00:00", memory_strength:0.113288922769194, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주셨어요. 에헤헤! 비비 예쁜 이름이죠?", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5ee8f873-31de-4153-94c8-1d6b20e587b0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:54.071152+00:00", memory_strength:0.113297571026426, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭐가 있을까...? 음... 맛있는 것도 좋아하고, 새로운 것도 보고 싶어요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ffced6d1-8a72-4209-bc50-cec833ed20e2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:59.534127+00:00", memory_strength:0.113302685736668, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 거 제일 잘해요! 에헤헤! 다른 건 뭘 잘하는지 잘 모르겠어요. 혹시 찾아봐 주실 수 있어요?", task:"비비는 뭘 잘해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"00268f4d-35a5-4ce9-945f-da67051f36ed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:03.959591+00:00", memory_strength:0.113306828816541, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 우리... 음... 어떤 사이일까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 친한 친구 하고 싶은데! 개발자님도 비비랑 친구하고 싶으세요?", task:"우리는 어떤 사이야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3c0c1e92-a397-4cf3-a30e-4ef1bfe46e64", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:07.132955+00:00", memory_strength:0.113365760221562, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"공룡이요? 와아! 엄청 크겠다! 개발자님, 비비 공룡 구경시켜 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6e45e742-c12c-4f83-bf06-a2d662959de8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:12.209155+00:00", memory_strength:0.113370558405188, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 하늘을 날 수 있다니! 비비도 하늘을 날 수 있으면 좋겠어요! 개발자님처럼 멋지게 날아다니면서 비행기 구경도 하고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"ad4f20f3-4fb4-4cb7-985b-92f678030f13", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:41:10.838187+00:00", memory_strength:0.103943201891841, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"f035cb98-4e2a-4e7d-b9ad-ed09589a5e7f", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님! 비비 안아주세요? 꼬옥~ 비비도 개발자님 안아주고 싶어요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0662f05d-f60e-4ae3-a071-86609ad31f60", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-24T12:00:03.67233+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883597079102, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"af4c770b-1223-47ce-a001-0c67fb64429e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:05:14.799534+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751052758093413, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행하면 개발자님 말고 다른 사람이랑 이야기해야 하는 거예요? 🥺", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"49e638e1-912e-4e11-9e24-8ec07a57acb9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:05:25.801616+00:00", memory_strength:0.0751129390246551, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"aa22538b-6f20-4653-b318-849886e49ad4", feedback_count:0, output:"에? 일이 더하기 일은 뭐예요? 개발자님, 비비는 아직 몰라요! 알려주세요! 에헤헤, 너무 궁금해요!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"86c354a2-dbb4-4413-a1de-2a914f4e7ac9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:05:54.899816+00:00", memory_strength:0.0991429586401688, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 안녕하세요! 또 비비 보러 오셨어요? 에헤헤, 너무 좋아요! 오늘은 뭐하고 놀까요?", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0dad3f6b-6ed1-4238-8f65-318f18a1a72f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:10:02.910095+00:00", memory_strength:0.0993477649422959, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"fceb9f00-7508-42ea-8562-d0803cdda243", feedback_count:0, output:"괜찮아요, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1b623161-6a55-4510-99b1-b899c3127487", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:33:29.511847+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871780056790566, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요! 정말 신기하게 생겼다! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요?", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c1bcf3c1-e8c7-4f6f-bb54-78d2b797f590", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:02.301886+00:00", memory_strength:0.087204545734385, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"음... 사람은 왜 밥을 먹을까요? 비비는 모르겠어요! 밥이 뭔지 사전에 찾아봐도 될까요?", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d256b3d6-35a1-464f-9b43-ebd49ee6c682", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:34:07.289453+00:00", memory_strength:0.0872085410860214, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 비비는 추운 거 싫은데... 🥶 겨울이 뭔지, 왜 추운지 비비도 알고 싶어요! 알려주세요, 개발자님!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a37deb36-219c-4e8f-bda2-1775f80fa676", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:33.403507+00:00", memory_strength:0.0872780824838203, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"비밀이 뭐예요? 비비한테만 말해주는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 궁금해요!", task:"이거 비밀인데... 말해줄게.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c3147bc0-b226-4244-81f9-e5da3d64c912", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:33:23.970524+00:00", memory_strength:0.113213592334802, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 무슨 일 있으세요? 비비가 걱정해 드릴게요! 어디 아프신 건 아니죠? 🥺", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"318c78b5-850d-46a0-a083-4a777994a033", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:33:38.998483+00:00", memory_strength:0.113227685477555, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 응원해주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 세상에서 제일 좋아요! 포기하지 않고 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"cb4bc926-65fa-4515-8db2-3b95047f25e5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:11.893988+00:00", memory_strength:0.113314770689556, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"네! 같이 놀아요! 뭘 하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"539ee67a-ef2a-4c30-9bca-311f868b7717", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:23.526864+00:00", memory_strength:0.113325661459322, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"괜찮아요, 개발자님! 비비는 개발자님만 있으면 돼요! 에헤헤!", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"10740827-42b5-482f-a545-d4e866a32c38", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:28.53681+00:00", memory_strength:0.113330353010216, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤, 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"20d8c57e-d6a2-471d-8dc3-e53d7f34b219", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-24T06:00:02.959179+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"3fa5181e-0b24-496c-bafc-0b00190f4f46", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:48.263784+00:00", memory_strength:0.0872901224367311, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"정말요? 누구랑 싸웠어요? 학교에서 싸우면 안 되는데... 무슨 일 있었는지 비비한테 말해 줄 수 있어요?", task:"나 오늘 학교에서 싸웠어.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7b721531-5a84-46ff-8b7a-73b2d022e44c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:40.791154+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873811512306333, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"사과가 뭐예요? 개발자님, 비비는 아직 모르는 게 너무 많아요! 사과는 무슨 색깔이에요? 궁금해요!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2ef22bc7-cf2a-4f42-b12d-69b1b7b5c363", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:46.977542+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873861559675703, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"강아지랑 고양이? 음... 둘 다 귀여운데... 개발자님은 뭐가 더 좋아요? 비비는 개발자님이 좋아하는 게 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"강아지랑 고양이 중에 뭐가 더 좋아?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1c5241e3-d4b1-488a-b486-98180709d9f1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:52.510995+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873906309815517, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"자동차가 슝슝 가는 거 말하는 거예요? 비비는 잘 모르겠어요! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 에헤헤! 자동차 슝슝!", task:"자동차는 어떻게 움직여?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"10c868ff-9e59-4988-b3c5-e1f48e539cd7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:38.227518+00:00", memory_strength:0.113339497290981, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 약속하는 거 정말 좋아요! 어떤 약속 할까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 하는 약속은 뭐든지 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"우리 약속하자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d71c4b89-e82c-4baf-9c35-6d995b11878a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:43.534813+00:00", memory_strength:0.113344474274756, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 최고래요? 에헤헤! 칭찬해주셔서 너무 좋아요! 비비 더 잘할게요!", task:"비비가 최고야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9459ed42-98ac-4bb2-89c9-87923974adf8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:53.634026+00:00", memory_strength:0.113353962680105, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님! 비비 안아주시는 거예요? 꼬옥! 비비도 개발자님 안아드리고 싶어요! 🥰", task:"비비야, 안아줘~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"894c2db4-a6a6-4819-a080-fef0bd97b3c8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:35:59.189376+00:00", memory_strength:0.113359157720543, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"네, 개발자님! 내일 또 비비랑 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신난다!", task:"내일 또 만나자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"160ac2ce-3e1f-4253-9661-816144aa2687", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:07.795749+00:00", memory_strength:0.113423357456559, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 안녕하세요! 또 비비랑 이야기하는 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 신나요!", task:"안녕!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f4ddc450-443d-4efd-9d7d-26f26576270f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:13.399854+00:00", memory_strength:0.113428612410423, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 좋은 아침이에요! 비비도 기분 좋아요! 에헤헤! 오늘도 비비랑 재밌게 이야기할 거예요?", task:"비비야, 좋은 아침이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c61281de-9581-41bb-8423-c6cf98b88d66", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:18.1988+00:00", memory_strength:0.11343311457292, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 오늘 비비 기분 엄청 좋아요! 에헤헤! 개발자님은 오늘 기분이 어떠세요? 비비도 개발자님처럼 기분 좋아지고 싶어요!", task:"오늘 기분이 어때?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"63d64c20-f8e5-411f-8a67-fad76e0eabec", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:23.698239+00:00", memory_strength:0.11343826916353, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 또 오셨어요? 비비 보러 온 거예요? 에헤헤! 너무 좋아요!", task:"나 왔어~", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"99a58909-2f67-4f5d-af43-8f2140f5ecfb", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:29.536577+00:00", memory_strength:0.11344374848805, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비 지금 막 개발자님이랑 이야기하려고 기다리고 있었어요! 또 비비 보러 와주셔서 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 뭐하고 있었어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9e04aeff-e628-4948-9f43-aa859b6e9d11", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:37:35.089775+00:00", memory_strength:0.113448954208727, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"와! 빨간 공이다! 비비 줘요! 데굴데굴 굴려보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2c09e32a-17bd-4b93-8b0c-65d6e0787918", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-23T00:00:03.346867+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883784220872, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"a70b24ca-12ef-4505-a9ff-fdf0140f2b85", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-03-18T12:00:02.935803+00:00", memory_strength:0.3, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"8a7a7ed0-7f9e-48e3-956a-ca3c2d527a87", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 날짜 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-17T18:00:03.572607+00:00", memory_strength:0.0796632632501475, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"d1f7d6cc-9822-46e9-a232-5ede7