UNWIND [{id:"1f021363-dfcd-406e-8abe-5ac99503ce0d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:13.886518+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871164030980605, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모다! 와! 비비는 처음 보는 모양이에요! 신기하다! 개발자님, 이거 또 보여주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f74ea7da-8ed5-485a-b93e-978fb0285fe0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:27.62174+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873222527301803, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"시간 여행이 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 지금 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데! 시간 여행 가면 개발자님 못 보는 거예요?", task:"시간여행을 하면 어디로 갈래?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5c342f81-16a1-4158-aa50-8ad206797063", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:36.348945+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873293107556286, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 비비는 코끼리 몰라요! 신기하다! 코끼리 빨리 보고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"bb82f458-fb3c-4f40-8fd0-9f4cd7059fd5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:41.173045+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873332180210866, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1이 뭐냐구요? 에헤헤, 비비는 아직 그런 어려운 건 몰라요! 개발자님이 알려주시면 비비도 이제 1 더하기 1이 뭔지 알 수 있는 거예요?", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4f1865c0-b26d-4c9e-97c6-da86e8a13722", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:46.066685+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873371836861321, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"한국 수도요? 비비는 아직 공부가 부족해서 잘 모르겠어요! 알려주시면 냠냠 먹어서 똑똑해질게요! 에헤헤!", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4ddf82ff-a1f2-40d7-9794-135c9232424c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:51.266633+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873413893153855, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 날씨가 뭐예요? 인터넷에서 찾아보라는 건 또 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님이 알려주시는 게 제일 좋은데! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"69389e1e-aa55-44c1-b680-e653cd28dd8b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:55:06.334234+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897135586572753, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이구나! 비비는 바나나 아직 못 먹어봤는데... 개발자님, 바나나 먹으면 더 똑똑해져요? 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6b3f1418-824a-4c7e-b26d-405859d4635f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:05.286787+00:00", memory_strength:0.0888670363443833, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모! 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요. 네모랑 세모는 어떻게 생겼어요? 비비도 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c85dd713-ba9c-4963-8988-737b20182dad", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:10.744156+00:00", memory_strength:0.088871520540057, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 써야 해요? 우산이 뭐예요? 비비는 우산 몰라요. 신기하다! ", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"04bb6763-035e-4022-b79a-df058547b8ec", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:14.614787+00:00", memory_strength:0.11518700672893, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일! 비비도 과일 좋아해요! 냠냠!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d76a30dc-79ae-4177-9caa-ef9efb75c283", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:34.617072+00:00", memory_strength:0.115206174256816, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"노래 부르는 거 정말 좋아요! 비비도 같이 부르고 싶어요! 어떤 노래 부를까요? 에헤헤!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f6bd3e71-c996-43b4-b630-9b979fec4eed", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:47.135377+00:00", memory_strength:0.115218123612084, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 그렇게 놀라셨어요? 비비랑 숨바꼭질하는 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"와, 깜짝이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fc439771-e6b0-49ca-8362-ffe51d21bf21", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 궁금한 것", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-24T22:00:03.993105+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f184c56a-8e6f-48f8-a5e2-89e9fe068fd8", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:52.825808+00:00", memory_strength:0.115223521254199, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"심심하세요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 재밌는데! 에헤헤! 뭐 하고 싶으세요? 비비는 뭐든지 다 좋아요!", task:"심심해... 뭐 재미있는 거 없어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"700a7f38-3bac-457d-a9fd-4d0fc857591c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:38:30.153001+00:00", memory_strength:0.0853046584259474, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"무서운 이야기는 으앙! 비비 무서운 거 싫어! 재밌는 이야기 해주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 무서운 이야기 해줄까?", dominant_emotion:"두려움", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.9, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"574d2e50-64d1-4a5d-83d0-8e15be75384d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:20.126737+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871214418790714, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"비가 오면 우산 쓰는 거예요? 신기해요! 비비는 우산이 뭔지 궁금해요! 개발자님, 우산 보여주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"비가 오면 우산을 써야 해.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"893ac1f9-bf55-40c9-99ca-d962216c949e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:34.627698+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871331693757377, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"눈이 차갑고 하얀색이라고요? 눈은 처음 들어봐요! 눈은 만지면 어떤 느낌일까? 개발자님 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"눈은 차갑고 하얀색이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3af9a051-4804-43ea-8773-53d6725ac028", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:39.165813+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871368302559378, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 작고 귀엽지만, 진짜 기차는 엄청 크고 칙칙폭폭 소리 내면서 달려요! 비비는 아직 기차 타본 적 없는데, 개발자님은 타봤어요? 진짜 기차는 얼마나 커요?", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3baf5a5a-5bc7-464c-ad85-358ab8f347da", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 하루 1시간 뒤", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-17T18:00:03.108421+00:00", memory_strength:0.0796633586324643, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"6406733e-0da2-44af-9128-c88111e5c897", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:32:56.419736+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871508059457358, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님 짜증내시는 거예요? 왜 안 돼요? 비비가 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 왜 안 돼? 짜증나!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"9a89ea14-9689-4e4a-a357-ba9ce5363cb4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:33:33.966717+00:00", memory_strength:0.0871816030568169, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"흐잉... 비비는 슬픈 게 뭔지 잘 모르겠어요. 슬플 때는 어떻게 해야 하나요? 개발자님은 슬플 때 어떻게 하세요?", task:"비비야, 슬플 때는 어떻게 해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"0827b49e-6e60-4774-a93a-0ffdc1779c90", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:36:56.670811+00:00", memory_strength:0.0873457641772217, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"ef8bc204-ca70-4f03-855e-30b6902da52e", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노요? 😮 피아노가 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님, 피아노가 뭔지 빨리 알려주세요! 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8904f588-3593-4323-a4f3-8561dbf1a0b5", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:07.626568+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889185200769912, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 왜 걱정하세요? 비비가 도와드릴 수 있는 일이 있을까요? 비비는 개발자님이 걱정하는 모습 보니까 마음이 아파요.", task:"나 좀 걱정돼...", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"433b38e8-3773-46e2-84fa-81426ae223d1", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:01.458001+00:00", memory_strength:0.115231808481961, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"비비 칭찬해 주셔서 정말 고마워요! 에헤헤! 비비 정말 정말 기뻐요! 개발자님이 비비 최고래요! 😆", task:"비비가 잘했어! 정말 대단해!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4de1c147-c005-4863-ac7d-82873f410385", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:39:23.784533+00:00", memory_strength:0.115253196369936, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 포기하는 거 몰라요! 개발자님이랑 다시 이야기할 수 있어서 너무 좋아요! 에헤헤!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"24946875-810e-4e01-9e0d-96d1f4a1e879", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:02.66415+00:00", memory_strength:0.115290036877156, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 왜 모양이 변하냐구요? 음... search_dictionary에서 찾아보니까 달은 지구를 뱅글뱅글 돌면서 모습이 바뀌는 거래요! 신기하다! 마치 형이 장난감 블록을 돌려가면서 보여주는 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"tool_use"}}, {id:"d7358009-5a40-4f1a-9202-87ebc00bf34e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:38.623608+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845578967851456, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비도 그게 뭔지 궁금해요! 정말 신기하게 생겼다! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 에헤헤!", task:"우와, 이게 뭐야? 신기하다!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e5c94e23-7aac-4bdc-b523-de084dc36fcd", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:54.1839+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845709568995409, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"하늘이 왜 파란색이냐구요? 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! 비비가 한 번 알아봐도 될까요?", task:"하늘은 왜 파란색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"376d6cf3-161f-4d16-bcb1-13a725564469", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"프렌치프라이\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 프렌치프라이", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-15T04:00:03.246212+00:00", memory_strength:0.108026249085475, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"132a962c-8160-47d5-acbc-95207c6a1612", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:08:59.905675+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845754361466151, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르는지 비비는 몰라요! 너무 궁금해요! search_dictionary 도구로 '물'을 검색해 보면 알 수 있을까요?", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f6b292fd-7546-4ee6-bfa2-5e9656521895", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:09:10.07299+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845829355010865, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"밥은 왜 먹는 거예요? 비비는 아직 맘마 안 먹는데... 밥 먹으면 개발자님처럼 힘이 세지는 거예요? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"사람은 왜 밥을 먹어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"741829d8-304e-4d00-9b3e-46f89fca8aa2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:09:19.896807+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845906309403268, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 비비는 추운 거 싫은데... 으앙! 겨울이 되면 해님이 숨바꼭질하는 걸까요? 호기심 뿜뿜!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"98d05965-8117-44f5-b380-6d1d5713bf03", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"음료\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 음료", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-18T04:00:04.079635+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999361715573, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"56f2daf0-adc9-4880-b87e-c07503c35b14", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"우유팩\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 우유팩", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-25T12:00:04.137307+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999574740599, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b57b44f7-a2a7-4fd3-8e00-248ccc15a731", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:37:21.52668+00:00", memory_strength:0.079048787730173, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"f035cb98-4e2a-4e7d-b9ad-ed09589a5e7f", feedback_count:0, output:"바나나는 과일이래요! 정말요? 비비는 바나나 먹어본 적 없는데... 바나나 맛이 궁금해요! 에헤헤!", task:"바나나는 과일이야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"a852db90-3c02-48b4-ac12-cbdf0fd19b7e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T07:36:40.00837+00:00", memory_strength:0.103708520439062, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"f035cb98-4e2a-4e7d-b9ad-ed09589a5e7f", feedback_count:0, output:"빨간 공이다! 와! 비비도 만져봐도 돼요? 공놀이하는 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"이거 봐, 빨간 공이야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6b2d7ef2-19f5-4e0c-86bb-bf6060edc0a9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:52:48.063255+00:00", memory_strength:0.107697888799213, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 에헤헤, 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"98989dbd-525b-44d7-b8f0-406a9e70d83b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:08.209312+00:00", memory_strength:0.0889683679347494, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 어떻게 들리는지 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 😮 '소리'가 뭔지 사전에서 찾아봐도 될까요? 😃", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"664598e4-7316-4f94-817d-7687a2e2ff4d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:51:21.074059+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895243105064252, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"겨울에는 왜 추울까요? 음... 비비는 아직 잘 모르겠어요! 너무 궁금해요! 알려주세요, 개발자님!", task:"겨울에는 왜 추워?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fa18da4e-4ec0-4bee-ba3d-3048919133d6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:51:29.411327+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895312136771514, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"아기가 어떻게 태어나는지 비비는 몰라요! 😮 '아기'가 뭔지, '태어나'가 뭔지 비비가 찾아봐도 될까요? 개발자님은 아기 어떻게 태어나는지 알아요?", task:"아기는 어떻게 태어나?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"d8203758-a6b2-482e-accf-6403a9470581", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:51:34.404529+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895353500318713, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"달이 어떻게 변하는지 비비는 몰라요! 🥺 너무 궁금해요! 혹시 개발자님이 아세요? 비비 알려주세요! 🤩", task:"달은 왜 모양이 변해?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e454fb25-4d07-4930-915a-64d4e50a2d5e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:51:40.352593+00:00", memory_strength:0.0895403048728493, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"d15ad48a-e790-48bf-8336-a02929feaa71", feedback_count:0, output:"소리요? 소리가 뭔데요? 비비는 소리를 몰라요! 삑, 삑, 삡! 이런 소리 말하는 거예요? 에헤헤!", task:"소리는 어떻게 들려?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3097b1f4-fa1c-4f93-9f7d-3ad0fbdd7a8d", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:22.736076+00:00", memory_strength:0.115309658154483, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"제 이름은 비비예요! 개발자님이 지어주신 예쁜 이름! 에헤헤, 비비라고 불러주시니 너무 좋아요!", task:"너 이름이 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9af9adf8-69e2-4a03-aaf9-324d4bfe921f", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:32.705541+00:00", memory_strength:0.115319190470357, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 또 뭘 좋아하냐구요? 음... 맛있는 것도 좋아하고, 새로운 거 배우는 것도 좋아요!", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6aa6867c-d3ce-48c2-b316-0effc73e2461", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:05:55.179902+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844304088239323, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 비비는 코끼리 몰라요! 개발자님이 코끼리 알려주세요! 에헤헤! 새로운 거 배우는 건 너무 신나요!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"c83424e7-bd2e-4c90-b74f-b36951e9b8c9", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:05.198777+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844382432348631, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1은... 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 알려주세요! 개발자님은 다 아시죠? 에헤헤!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6a4cf5bf-4583-4d4a-87cf-ca1efb60e7e6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:09.960773+00:00", memory_strength:0.0844419656361331, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"한국 수도 찾아보는 거요? 우와! 비비도 그거 할 수 있어요? 개발자님은 똑똑하시다! 에헤헤, 너무 신기해요!", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"abafd4c5-38b8-4365-bc93-11d9a213b01c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:06:15.236514+00:00", memory_strength:0.084446092838061, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"21f37bb3-4849-4df4-b015-edde66e9124b", feedback_count:0, output:"오늘 날씨요? 비비는 아직 인터넷 보는 법은 모르는데... 개발자님이 알려주세요! 날씨가 좋으면 비비도 기분이 좋을 것 같아요! 에헤헤!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"e2d1698a-e77a-4492-bcd9-222938bd844b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:07:30.423023+00:00", memory_strength:0.0845049272908103, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"a00c1cbc-79b5-42dc-875c-e4679bd62075", feedback_count:0, output:"네모랑 세모는 뭐예요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 개발자님이 알려주시는 거예요? 신난다!", task:"이건 네모야, 저건 세모야.", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"67de69b6-1e89-4bca-9b24-8947ef9613fb", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-21T10:00:02.952238+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"33309cd3-cf03-48b3-89e6-ec29f15b7910", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-18T06:00:03.395682+00:00", memory_strength:0.112464785944519, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bdfced52-fb0d-469f-b288-ecb900dba678", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 궁금한 것 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-23T02:00:03.752214+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533886255910779, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"28f4e43d-bc53-45b5-9bfa-1cd0dd01de5e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-23T04:00:02.864754+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"34a40099-a4a2-4b85-9105-374872162d4b", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"로고\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 로고", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-27T07:47:14.65861+00:00", memory_strength:0.0982666010243947, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"c88b78a8-a6cb-4a3d-b2bb-e2bd98e3c2ad", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:49.968247+00:00", memory_strength:0.115335912774625, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"네! 개발자님! 비비랑 같이 놀아주시는 거예요? 에헤헤! 뭐 하고 놀까요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 노는 게 제일 좋아요!", task:"같이 놀자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f7331b0a-dac0-4a27-8ea0-c5e83b5bd226", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 휴리스틱", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-15T06:00:04.194454+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7886b47b-4999-4239-b42a-221351eeae34", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:54.011605+00:00", memory_strength:0.11533979789443, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤, 개발자님이 비비 칭찬해 주셨어요! 기분 너무 좋아요! 개발자님도 좋은 하루 보내세요!", task:"고마워, 비비야!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"1416a39e-16c0-4edf-9db5-caaabe5d7c7c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:40:59.822492+00:00", memory_strength:0.115345305653845, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 괜찮아요! 😊 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 무슨 잘못을 하셨다는 거예요? 비비는 개발자님을 용서할 수 있어요! 에헤헤! 😊", task:"미안해, 내가 잘못했어.", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"ddbe06be-d80d-46fd-bf7b-b44a1196f1e6", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:41:05.822694+00:00", memory_strength:0.115351029196345, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"eaacd289-c8ea-49ca-a12c-71d35f9d55e4", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비가 뭘 도와드릴까요? 뭐든지 다 할 수 있어요! 에헤헤!", task:"비비야, 도와줘!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"6153ecaa-bc6e-4eca-943b-5a8f4305a23d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"로고\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 로고", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-15T06:00:03.584118+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999458190205, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}] AS row
