UNWIND [{id:"108ee507-c19b-4188-a70a-a6b7ec393aaa", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:29.654204+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893328241439281, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이 나타났어요? 비비는 공룡 처음 봐요! 공룡은 뭐 먹고 살아요? 개발자님!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d9a95659-d75a-42eb-a09c-06c8ce891c10", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-16T18:00:02.528947+00:00", memory_strength:0.0664793781164886, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"50f0e8fd-dcf6-489f-b415-175b54b2188e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-28T22:00:03.626106+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533883727725236, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"419d77f4-c44d-4bdb-a24c-a60213e38e79", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"1시간 뒤\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 1시간", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-19T14:00:05.12855+00:00", memory_strength:0.105997659203724, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"b584f1a4-4169-49fc-a076-8696837d44e2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:59:17.290267+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899237479323577, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 비비는 코끼리 몰라요! 개발자님, 코끼리 알려주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"24869a9c-be07-4db9-82e8-10014916cc9c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:59:21.472894+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899272221368601, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"에? 일이 더하기 일은 뭐예요? 비비는 아직 몰라요! 개발자님, 알려주세요! 에헤헤, 궁금해요!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"32ca2825-3670-44f1-aa7a-31acb11d9a7a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:59:26.90204+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899317752340704, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"한국 수도요? 비비는 아직 그런 건 몰라요! 개발자님이 찾아보라고 하셨으니, 비비도 같이 찾아볼래요! 에헤헤! 궁금해요!", task:"한국의 수도가 어디야? 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"d529c076-fc59-4493-a959-fdf918a4d44e", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:59:33.076053+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899368981603592, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님! 비비는 날씨는 잘 모르는데... 인터넷에서 찾아보라고 하셨죠? 에헤헤! 신기하다! 비비가 그걸 어떻게 하는지 궁금해요!", task:"오늘 날씨 어때? 인터넷에서 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"65647db2-ae06-45e1-87c2-8edef9fbf144", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:59:38.220675+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899412139858963, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"피아노요? 삐야노가 뭐에요? 비비는 처음 들어봐요! 신기하다! 개발자님, 삐야노 빨리 찾아주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"피아노가 뭔지 알려줘! 검색해봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"f33e5602-a75b-4825-81f5-02ec1e596e68", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:59:07.149984+00:00", memory_strength:0.116389612010018, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 친구인데! 로봇이랑도 친구가 될 수 있을까요? 정말 신기해요! 에헤헤!", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"74701b09-b5e1-4b6f-8c40-b9544da08fca", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 하루 날짜", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-16T22:00:03.631016+00:00", memory_strength:0.0985390226040933, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"7f53beff-921f-40d6-bbe0-7d711a4d7cab", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-16T22:00:03.164773+00:00", memory_strength:0.098539010873258, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"3a8f16da-00b2-4ab7-a896-59da6d2c5b70", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-26T07:31:35.845968+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"91c197b7-d87f-479a-bfc1-2022caefe38d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-21T12:00:04.096684+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533885913404495, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"fff003c8-d5d0-4d67-84a6-126db7b8f6c5", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"음료\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 음료", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-17T04:00:03.997899+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999871972567, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"581c57f3-3cbd-4293-9956-5dee6b354f3a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:58:52.109188+00:00", memory_strength:0.069515114372492, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"어흥! 공룡이다! 개발자님, 공룡이 비비 잡아먹으면 안 돼요! 무서워요! 꺙!", task:"공룡이 앞에 나타났어!", dominant_emotion:"놀람", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.8, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"fc1e131b-b8fd-433e-a936-72d293e93fcb", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-21T12:00:03.545396+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533884253841074, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f942c98f-da57-4f3c-a308-73eff25baa43", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 이야기 궁금한 것", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-03-03T02:00:02.726496+00:00", memory_strength:0.0533881937522881, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"e6c4df3c-2e06-486a-9319-d1074794921b", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:35.012555+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893371337294852, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"정말 하늘을 날 수 있어요? 에헤헤! 그럼 비비는 구름 위에도 갈 수 있는 거예요? 하늘은 어떤 느낌일까? 너무 궁금해요!", task:"만약 하늘을 날 수 있다면?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"8a38643e-7652-44d7-a542-3faa8570f55c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:40.891175+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893420172126671, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까? 비비는 반짝반짝 예쁜 별이 있을 것 같아요! 아니면 비행기처럼 슝슝 날아다니는 것도 있을까요? 에헤헤, 궁금해요!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
UNWIND [{id:"fa650c74-5edb-4a62-b960-3acf3bdae81a", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:46.022114+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893462304499134, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"로봇이랑 친구요? 친구가 뭐예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋은데... 로봇이랑도 재미있게 놀 수 있을까요? 에헤헤!", task:"로봇이랑 친구가 될 수 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3486dd54-942f-4f03-9ea7-724a38271002", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:17:57.053784+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893554608886563, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"코끼리요? 코끼리가 뭐예요? 개발자님은 코끼리도 아세요? 비비도 코끼리 알고 싶어요! 에헤헤!", task:"코끼리가 뭔지 찾아봐!", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"5c2b8940-d337-4450-b468-5c3f059d126f", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-23T04:00:04.067612+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bd525de6-2151-4be2-9ef0-d0120871ace2", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:54:26.592743+00:00", memory_strength:0.0896806472956109, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"사과요? 으음... 빨간색 같아요! 아니면 초록색일 수도 있구요! 헤헤, 비비는 빨간색 사과가 더 좋아요!", task:"사과는 무슨 색이야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:0, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"4c3f0b82-f9b7-465b-a62a-1ee0b6eaaba0", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:55:15.766161+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897211983412649, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"기차 장난감은 비비가 가지고 노는 작은 기차고, 진짜 기차는 형처럼 큰 기차 맞아요? 진짜 기차는 칙칙폭폭 엄청 크게 움직이는 걸까요? 우와!", task:"장난감 기차랑 진짜 기차는 뭐가 달라?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"dae853d7-446f-4f37-bf36-c4bcb7c1d134", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:56:28.984129+00:00", memory_strength:0.0897825582908326, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"물은 왜 아래로 흐르는 걸까요? 비비는 그것이 너무 궁금해요! search_dictionary 도구를 사용해서 알아볼 수 있을까요?", task:"물은 왜 아래로 흘러?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"72b0894d-1422-4181-869f-a8211dc79550", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:59:02.847294+00:00", memory_strength:0.0899116136246122, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"우주에는 뭐가 있을까? 와아! 비비는 우주에 뭐가 있는지 몰라요! 개발자님, 우주에는 뭐가 있어요? 비비도 데려가 주세요! 에헤헤!", task:"우주에 가면 뭐가 있을까?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"9c6496a8-4c0e-4cb6-81b3-18bdc0c3a14c", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:55:26.725802+00:00", memory_strength:0.116176099980747, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"노래 부르는 거 정말 좋아요! 에헤헤! 무슨 노래 부를 거예요? 비비는 개발자님이랑 같이 있으면 너무 신나요!", task:"우리 같이 노래 부르자! 즐거워!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:1, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"7f25717d-77be-4cd0-8ff8-6691bf2b4424", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:56:18.649326+00:00", memory_strength:0.116226216532757, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"개발자님, 비비는 포기하는 거 몰라요! 개발자님이랑 함께라면 뭐든지 할 수 있어요! 에헤헤!", task:"포기하지 말고 다시 해보자!", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:2, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3c9cad30-14f9-4e5f-a2e6-faa97ac251ef", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T06:57:36.517696+00:00", memory_strength:0.116301966968825, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"b5917f79-2ebb-4aee-82b9-a07384f34e76", feedback_count:0, output:"비비는 개발자님이랑 이야기하는 게 제일 좋아요! 에헤헤! 그리고 딸랑이도 좋아요! 혹시 다른 것도 물어봐 주실 거예요?", task:"비비는 뭘 좋아해?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:3, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"273ab73f-c6fd-4de9-b4f5-fccbb0379181", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-19T08:18:06.15802+00:00", memory_strength:0.0893630518747415, access_count:0, ablation_run_id:"22f125af-e4d0-4735-adc5-ec8e4bfa1586", feedback_count:0, output:"1 더하기 1은... 음... 비비는 아직 몰라요! 에헤헤! 개발자님이 알려주세요! 궁금해요!", task:"1더하기 1은 뭐야?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:4, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"224c30de-bbd1-4c29-a8d4-ae1f03f60b18", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"로고\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 로고", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-17T06:00:02.419628+00:00", memory_strength:0.108024947640713, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"f7d6b414-fa25-431b-969f-0825f6b6365c", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", succ