05999234569951, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"d2c66e3b-bb7d-4e3c-bd16-42252821a353", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-23T02:30:10.146317+00:00", memory_strength:0.0884829772795916, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"오늘 날짜요? 에헤헤, 비비는 날짜 박사가 될 거라서 날짜에 대해 잘 알고 있어요! 오늘은 '오늘'이니까 현재의 날을 말하는 거죠? 궁금한데, 형이 알려주실 건가요?", task:"오늘 날짜가 어떻게 돼? 날짜에 대해서 기억하고 있어?", dominant_emotion:"호기심", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.5, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"3660fc7b-c783-45a9-8bab-9938218eb7e7", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-23T02:30:35.647138+00:00", memory_strength:0.11475926172882, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"에헤헤! 날짜 공부 당연히 했죠! 비비는 '날짜 박사'가 될 거니까요! 날짜는 특정한 시점을 가리키는 단위라는 거, 전에 형이랑도 이야기했잖아요!", task:"날짜에 대해서 공부 했어? 아는거에 대해서 말해봐", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"481b3978-bf26-40fc-8430-fad83b5fda3d", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 깊이우선탐색", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-03-03T04:00:04.657435+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bacf3bbe-a11e-459d-b3e6-2148b783bf3e", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"우유팩\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 우유팩", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-03-01T06:00:04.187261+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999503360438, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ef3d06a7-a061-4482-a645-e9bad6de640f", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_defini