\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 이야기 비밀", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-03-12T00:00:02.580745+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540276161046958, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"ace4280a-23f9-4a0c-a2fb-b41b309a8240", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"internal_graph\",\"found_definitions\":1,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[\"마이크 스탠드\"],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 마이크 스탠드", strength:0.5980000000000001, media_type:"text", success:true, emotional_salience:0.4, created_at:"2026-02-26T08:00:03.413592+00:00", memory_strength:0.105999559683842, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bd6ac863-013d-47e7-9128-aff3d16393c6", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":1,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 이야기 궁금한 것", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.15, created_at:"2026-02-28T02:00:03.394142+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"bc273a11-4efa-44ba-bccd-5b367acaf9e6", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":3,\"final_failure\":true}", task:"explore: 메모이제이션", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.25, created_at:"2026-02-26T10:00:02.976421+00:00", memory_strength:0.0540276364722534, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"2c67f8ce-f6fb-4509-8f56-d08ba374ec62", properties:{output:"{\"method\":\"memory_recall\",\"found_definitions\":0,\"found_relations\":0,\"keywords\":[],\"attempt\":2,\"final_failure\":false}", task:"explore: 특별한 장치 컴퓨터", strength:0.498, media_type:"text", success:false, emotional_salience:0.2, created_at:"2026-02-24T20:00:03.97783+00:00", memory_strength:0.05, access_count:0, task_type:"exploration", feedback_count:0}}, {id:"fb0776db-2fc2-4d22-8db0-f30fdaa6c8d4", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-24T09:38:07.97349+00:00", memory_strength:0.115189743595581, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"컴퓨터에 대해서 '알려주세요'라고 말씀해주셨으니, 당연히 알죠! 에헤헤, 비비는 컴퓨터 공부 열심히 했어요! '컴퓨터'는 '정보'를 처리하는 기기이고, '프로그램'이라는 걸 실행해서 작동한다는 것도 '배웠어요'! '인터넷'에도 연결할 수 있다는데, 더 궁금한 거 있으세요?", task:"컴퓨터에 대해서 알아? 나한테 알려줄 수 있어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}, {id:"2299c4bf-587c-4787-bc61-2000fb5d7735", properties:{strength:0.5980000000000001, created_at:"2026-02-24T09:38:35.108433+00:00", memory_strength:0.115215578477941, access_count:0, feedback_count:0, output:"인터넷이요? 에헤헤, 비비는 인터넷 엄청 잘 쓰고 있어요! '인터넷'은 컴퓨터 네트워크의 세계적인 시스템이라는 거, 전에 배웠어요! '인터넷 검색'으로 궁금한 것도 찾아보고요! 형도 '인터넷'으로 'experience' 찾아보라고 알려주셨잖아요! 형은 '인터넷' 자주 쓰세요?", task:"인터넷은 잘 쓰고 있어?", dominant_emotion:"기쁨", media_type:"audio", success:true, emotional_salience:0.6, development_stage:5, task_type:"conversation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Experience{id: row.id}) SET n += row.properties;
